const VOLS=[[{"t":"校园与学业","e":"Education","s":[["When Li Ming [enrolled] in university, the [tuition] was high, so he applied for a [scholarship].","李明上大学注册时学费很高，于是他申请了奖学金。"],["The [curriculum] included four [compulsory] courses in his first year.","第一年的课程里有四门必修课。"],["As an [undergraduate], he joined a weekly [seminar] on economics, a [discipline] he loved.","作为本科生，他每周参加一次经济学研讨课，这是他喜爱的学科。"],["In his final year he wrote a long [thesis].","最后一年他写了一篇很长的论文。"],["His teacher warned the class that [plagiarism] would be punished.","老师警告全班，抄袭会受到处罚。"],["Teachers [assessed] each paper carefully before students could receive their [diploma].","老师们仔细评估每一篇论文，之后学生才能拿到文凭。"]],"g":[["applied for","申请"],["included","包括"],["weekly","每周的"],["economics","经济学"],["final","最后的"],["warned","警告"],["punished","惩罚"],["carefully","仔细地"],["receive","收到"]],"w":[["enroll","ɪnˈroʊl","v. 注册，入学","enroll in a course","报名上课","en- 进入 + roll 名单"],["tuition","tuˈɪʃən","n. 学费","tuition fee","学费","和 tutor（导师）同源"],["scholarship","ˈskɑlərˌʃɪp","n. 奖学金","win a scholarship","获得奖学金","scholar 学者 + -ship"],["curriculum","kəˈrɪkjələm","n. 全部课程","school curriculum","学校课程","简历 CV = curriculum vitae"],["compulsory","kəmˈpəlsəri","adj. 必修的，强制的","compulsory education","义务教育","动词 compel 强迫"],["undergraduate","ˌəndərˈɡrædʒəwət","n. 本科生","undergraduate student","本科生","under + graduate：还没毕业的"],["seminar","ˈsɛməˌnɑr","n. 研讨会，研讨课","attend a seminar","参加研讨会","小班讨论，不是大课 lecture"],["discipline","ˈdɪsəplən","n. 学科；纪律","academic discipline","学科","一词两义，都常考"],["thesis","ˈθisəs","n. 论文","graduation thesis","毕业论文","复数 theses"],["plagiarism","ˈpleɪdʒəˌrɪzəm","n. 抄袭","commit plagiarism","抄袭","动词 plagiarize"],["assess","əˈsɛs","v. 评估","assess the risk","评估风险","名词 assessment"],["diploma","dəˈploʊmə","n. 文凭","a college diploma","大学文凭","和 diplomat（外交官）同源"]]},{"t":"科技与创新","e":"Technology","s":[["A small company built a [prototype] of a robot that can [automate] housework.","一家小公司造出了一台能让家务自动化的机器人样机。"],["The [innovation] depends on a new [algorithm] that learns from mistakes.","这项创新依靠一种能从错误中学习的新算法。"],["Experts called it a [breakthrough] that could [revolutionize] daily life.","专家称它是可能彻底改变日常生活的突破。"],["Users control it in a [virtual] room on their phones, and it is [compatible] with most devices.","用户在手机上的虚拟房间里控制它，它与大多数设备兼容。"],["However, some people fear [surveillance], because the robot has cameras.","不过有人担心被监视，因为机器人带有摄像头。"],["The company promises to [encrypt] all data. It also says older models will not become [obsolete], since they can be [upgraded] online.","公司承诺对所有数据加密，还说旧型号不会被淘汰，因为可以在线升级。"]],"g":[["company","公司"],["robot","机器人"],["housework","家务"],["depends on","依靠"],["mistakes","错误"],["experts","专家"],["daily life","日常生活"],["control","控制"],["devices","设备"],["however","然而"],["fear","害怕"],["promises","承诺"],["data","数据"],["models","型号"]],"w":[["prototype","ˈproʊdəˌtaɪp","n. 原型，样机","build a prototype","制作样机","proto- 最初 + type 类型"],["automate","ˈɔdəˌmeɪt","v. 使自动化","automate a process","使流程自动化","auto- 自己；名词 automation"],["innovation","ˌɪnəˈveɪʃən","n. 创新","technological innovation","技术创新","nov = 新（novel 新颖的）"],["algorithm","ˈælɡəˌrɪðəm","n. 算法","a search algorithm","搜索算法","计算机高频词"],["breakthrough","ˈbreɪkˌθru","n. 突破","make a breakthrough","取得突破","break through 冲破 → 名词"],["revolutionize","ˌrɛvəˈluʃəˌnaɪz","v. 彻底改变","revolutionize the industry","彻底改变行业","revolution + -ize"],["virtual","ˈvərtʃ(əw)əl","adj. 虚拟的；实质上的","virtual reality","虚拟现实","副词 virtually = 几乎"],["compatible","kəmˈpædəb(ə)l","adj. 兼容的；合得来的","be compatible with","与…兼容","反义 incompatible"],["surveillance","sərˈveɪlən(t)s","n. 监视","under surveillance","受监视","sur- 在上 + veill 看"],["encrypt","ɪnˈkrɪpt","v. 加密","encrypt data","加密数据","en- + crypt 隐藏；反义 decrypt"],["obsolete","ˌɑbsəˈlit","adj. 过时的，淘汰的","become obsolete","被淘汰","比 old-fashioned 更正式"],["upgrade","ˈəpˌɡreɪd","v. 升级","upgrade the system","升级系统","up + grade 等级"]]},{"t":"环境与生态","e":"Environment","s":[["Scientists warn that the [ecosystem] of the river is [deteriorating].","科学家警告说，这条河的生态系统正在恶化。"],["Factories [contaminate] the water, and carbon [emissions] keep rising.","工厂污染河水，碳排放不断上升。"],["Because of [deforestation], many animals have lost their [habitat], and some may become [extinct].","由于森林砍伐，许多动物失去了栖息地，有些可能灭绝。"],["A long [drought] made things worse last year.","去年一场长时间的干旱让情况更糟。"],["To protect [biodiversity], the government started a [conservation] program. It also supports [renewable] energy, such as wind and solar power.","为保护生物多样性，政府启动了一项保护计划，同时支持风能、太阳能等可再生能源。"],["Only [sustainable] development can save the river.","只有可持续发展才能拯救这条河。"]],"g":[["scientists","科学家"],["warn","警告"],["factories","工厂"],["carbon","碳"],["keep rising","不断上升"],["worse","更糟"],["protect","保护"],["government","政府"],["program","计划"],["supports","支持"],["solar power","太阳能"],["development","发展"]],"w":[["ecosystem","ˈikoʊˌsɪstəm","n. 生态系统","a fragile ecosystem","脆弱的生态系统","eco- 生态 + system"],["deteriorate","dəˈtɪriəˌreɪt","v. 恶化","health deteriorates","健康恶化","de- 向下；名词 deterioration"],["contaminate","kənˈtæməneɪt","v. 污染","contaminated water","被污染的水","近义 pollute；名词 contamination"],["emission","əˈmɪʃən","n. 排放","carbon emissions","碳排放","动词 emit 排放"],["deforestation","ˌdiˌfɔrəˈsteɪʃən","n. 森林砍伐","tropical deforestation","热带森林砍伐","de- 去掉 + forest"],["habitat","ˈhæbəˌtæt","n. 栖息地","natural habitat","自然栖息地","和 inhabit（居住）同根"],["extinct","ɪkˈstɪŋ(k)t","adj. 灭绝的","become extinct","灭绝","名词 extinction"],["drought","draʊt","n. 干旱","a severe drought","严重干旱","和 dry 同源；反义 flood"],["biodiversity","ˌbaɪoʊˌdaɪˈvərsədi","n. 生物多样性","protect biodiversity","保护生物多样性","bio- 生命 + diversity"],["conservation","ˌkɑn(t)sərˈveɪʃən","n. 保护，保存","wildlife conservation","野生动物保护","动词 conserve"],["renewable","rəˈnuəb(ə)l","adj. 可再生的","renewable energy","可再生能源","renew 更新 + -able"],["sustainable","səˈsteɪnəb(ə)l","adj. 可持续的","sustainable development","可持续发展","sustain 维持 + -able"]]},{"t":"经济与金融","e":"Economy","s":[["During the [recession], prices of every [commodity] began to [fluctuate].","经济衰退期间，各种商品的价格开始波动。"],["[Inflation] [soared], and many small firms went [bankrupt].","通货膨胀飙升，许多小公司破产。"],["The government's [revenue] fell, so the budget [deficit] grew.","政府收入下降，预算赤字扩大。"],["To [stimulate] the economy, officials gave a [subsidy] to farmers and cut the [tariff] on imported machines.","为刺激经济，官员向农民发放补贴，并降低进口机器的关税。"],["They also broke up a [monopoly] in the energy market, hoping that competition would lower prices.","他们还拆分了能源市场上的一家垄断企业，希望竞争能压低价格。"]],"g":[["prices","价格"],["firms","公司"],["government","政府"],["fell","下降"],["budget","预算"],["grew","增长"],["economy","经济"],["officials","官员"],["imported","进口的"],["broke up","拆分"],["energy market","能源市场"],["competition","竞争"],["lower","降低"]],"w":[["recession","rəˈsɛʃən","n. 经济衰退","economic recession","经济衰退","recede 后退 的名词"],["commodity","kəˈmɑdədi","n. 商品","commodity prices","商品价格","指原料类大宗商品"],["fluctuate","ˈfləktʃəˌweɪt","v. 波动","prices fluctuate","价格波动","flu = 流动；名词 fluctuation"],["inflation","ɪnˈfleɪʃən","n. 通货膨胀","rate of inflation","通胀率","inflate 充气 → 钱“膨胀”"],["soar","sɔr","v. 飙升；翱翔","prices soar","价格飞涨","近义 rocket, surge"],["bankrupt","ˈbæŋkrəpt","adj. 破产的","go bankrupt","破产","bank + rupt 断裂；名词 bankruptcy"],["revenue","ˈrɛvəˌnu","n. 收入，税收","tax revenue","税收","公司、政府的收入；个人用 income"],["deficit","ˈdɛfəsət","n. 赤字","budget deficit","预算赤字","反义 surplus 盈余"],["stimulate","ˈstɪmjəˌleɪt","v. 刺激","stimulate growth","刺激增长","名词 stimulus"],["subsidy","ˈsəbsədi","n. 补贴","government subsidy","政府补贴","动词 subsidize"],["tariff","ˈtɛrəf","n. 关税","impose a tariff","征收关税","贸易话题高频"],["monopoly","məˈnɑpəli","n. 垄断","have a monopoly on","垄断…","mono- 单一"]]},{"t":"健康与医疗","e":"Health","s":[["Mr. Wang felt constant [fatigue], but he ignored the [symptom] for months.","王先生总是感到疲劳，但几个月里都没把这个症状当回事。"],["Finally a doctor [diagnosed] him with a [chronic] disease related to [obesity].","最后医生诊断出他患有一种与肥胖有关的慢性病。"],["The doctor did not suggest [surgery]. Instead, she [prescribed] some medicine and a new [therapy].","医生没有建议手术，而是开了一些药和一种新疗法。"],["She also explained that good [nutrition] makes the [immune] system stronger.","她还解释说，良好的营养能增强免疫系统。"],["“During a flu [epidemic],” she said, “weak people are easily [infected].”","她说：“流感流行期间，体弱的人很容易被感染。”"]],"g":[["constant","持续的"],["ignored","忽视"],["finally","最后"],["disease","疾病"],["related to","与…有关"],["suggest","建议"],["instead","反而"],["medicine","药"],["explained","解释"],["system","系统"],["flu","流感"],["weak","虚弱的"],["easily","容易地"]],"w":[["fatigue","fəˈtiɡ","n. 疲劳","mental fatigue","精神疲劳","比 tiredness 正式"],["symptom","ˈsɪm(p)təm","n. 症状","symptoms of flu","流感症状","也指“征兆”"],["diagnose","ˌdaɪəɡˈnoʊz","v. 诊断","be diagnosed with","被诊断出患…","名词 diagnosis"],["chronic","ˈkrɑnɪk","adj. 慢性的，长期的","chronic disease","慢性病","chron = 时间；反义 acute"],["obesity","oʊˈbisədi","n. 肥胖","childhood obesity","儿童肥胖","形容词 obese"],["surgery","ˈsərdʒ(ə)ri","n. 手术","have surgery","做手术","surgeon 外科医生"],["prescribe","priˈskraɪb","v. 开药；规定","prescribe medicine","开药","名词 prescription 处方"],["therapy","ˈθɛrəpi","n. 疗法","physical therapy","物理治疗","therapist 治疗师"],["nutrition","nuˈtrɪʃən","n. 营养","good nutrition","良好营养","形容词 nutritious"],["immune","ɪˈmjun","adj. 免疫的","immune system","免疫系统","名词 immunity"],["epidemic","ˌɛpəˈdɛmɪk","n. 流行病","a flu epidemic","流感流行","全球性的叫 pandemic"],["infect","ɪnˈfɛk(t)","v. 感染","be infected with","感染上…","名词 infection；形容词 infectious"]]},{"t":"心理与情绪","e":"Psychology","s":[["Anna has a calm [temperament], but exams fill her with [anxiety].","安娜性情平和，但考试让她充满焦虑。"],["When she fails, she feels [frustrated] and her [self-esteem] drops.","一失败她就感到沮丧，自尊心下降。"],["Last year she even suffered from [depression].","去年她甚至患上了抑郁症。"],["A psychologist taught her that people [perceive] the same event in different ways.","一位心理医生告诉她，人们对同一件事的感知各不相同。"],["Through [cognitive] training, she learned to control the [impulse] to give up. Her [obsession] with perfect scores slowly disappeared.","通过认知训练，她学会了控制想放弃的冲动，对满分的执念慢慢消失。"],["Now she is more [optimistic] and [resilient], and small progress [motivates] her every day.","现在她更乐观、更有韧性，每天的小进步都在激励她。"]],"g":[["calm","平静的"],["exams","考试"],["fails","失败"],["drops","下降"],["suffered from","患上"],["psychologist","心理医生"],["event","事件"],["training","训练"],["control","控制"],["give up","放弃"],["perfect scores","满分"],["disappeared","消失"],["progress","进步"]],"w":[["temperament","ˈtɛmp(ə)rəmənt","n. 气质，性情","a calm temperament","平和的性情","注意不是 temperature"],["anxiety","æŋˈzaɪədi","n. 焦虑","feel anxiety about","对…焦虑","形容词 anxious"],["frustrate","ˈfrəˌstreɪt","v. 使沮丧，挫败","feel frustrated","感到沮丧","名词 frustration"],["self-esteem","ˌsɛlfəˈstim","n. 自尊","low self-esteem","自卑","esteem = 尊重"],["depression","dəˈprɛʃən","n. 抑郁；萧条","suffer from depression","患抑郁症","de- 向下 + press 压"],["perceive","pərˈsiv","v. 感知，认为","perceive A as B","把A看作B","名词 perception"],["cognitive","ˈkɑɡnədɪv","adj. 认知的","cognitive ability","认知能力","和 recognize 同根"],["impulse","ˈɪmˌpəls","n. 冲动","on impulse","一时冲动","形容词 impulsive"],["obsession","əbˈsɛʃən","n. 痴迷，执念","obsession with","对…的痴迷","be obsessed with"],["optimistic","ˌɑptəˈmɪstɪk","adj. 乐观的","be optimistic about","对…乐观","反义 pessimistic"],["resilient","rəˈzɪliənt","adj. 有韧性的，能恢复的","a resilient economy","有韧性的经济","名词 resilience"],["motivate","ˈmoʊdəˌveɪt","v. 激励","motivate students","激励学生","名词 motivation"]]},{"t":"社会问题","e":"Society","s":[["[Poverty] is not only about money.","贫困不只是钱的问题。"],["Poor children are often [deprived] of education, and [unemployment] follows them later.","穷人家的孩子常常被剥夺受教育的机会，长大后又面临失业。"],["Some [minority] groups also face [prejudice] and [discrimination] at work.","一些少数群体在工作中还会遭遇偏见和歧视。"],["As [inequality] grows, the most [vulnerable] people, such as the [homeless], are [marginalized].","随着不平等加剧，无家可归者等最弱势的人被边缘化。"],["A good [welfare] system helps, but it is not enough.","良好的福利制度有帮助，但还不够。"],["Every citizen can give time or money to [charity].","每个公民都可以为慈善事业出时间或出钱。"]],"g":[["education","教育"],["follows","跟随"],["groups","群体"],["face","面对"],["grows","增长"],["such as","例如"],["system","制度"],["enough","足够"],["citizen","公民"]],"w":[["poverty","ˈpɑvərdi","n. 贫困","live in poverty","生活贫困","poor 的名词"],["deprive","dəˈpraɪv","v. 剥夺","deprive sb of sth","剥夺某人的…","固定搭配 of"],["unemployment","ˌənəmˈplɔɪmənt","n. 失业","unemployment rate","失业率","un- + employ + -ment"],["minority","məˈnɔrədi","n. 少数，少数群体","ethnic minority","少数民族","minor 较小的；反义 majority"],["prejudice","ˈprɛdʒədəs","n. 偏见","prejudice against","对…的偏见","pre- 预先 + judge 判断"],["discrimination","dəˌskrɪməˈneɪʃən","n. 歧视","racial discrimination","种族歧视","动词 discriminate against"],["inequality","ˌɪniˈkwɑlədi","n. 不平等","social inequality","社会不平等","in- 不 + equality"],["vulnerable","ˈvəlnər(ə)bəl","adj. 脆弱的，易受伤害的","be vulnerable to","易受…伤害","写作高频词"],["homeless","ˈhoʊmləs","adj. 无家可归的","the homeless","无家可归者","the + 形容词 = 一类人"],["marginalize","ˈmɑrdʒənəˌlaɪz","v. 使边缘化","marginalized groups","边缘群体","margin 边缘 + -ize"],["welfare","ˈwɛlˌfɛr","n. 福利","social welfare","社会福利","well + fare 过得好"],["charity","ˈtʃɛrədi","n. 慈善；慈善机构","give to charity","向慈善捐款","形容词 charitable"]]},{"t":"职场与求职","e":"Workplace","s":[["After an [internship], Chen became a [candidate] for a full-time job.","实习结束后，陈成了一个全职岗位的候选人。"],["The company wanted to [recruit] someone with a good [qualification], and she proved to be [competent].","公司想招一个资历好的人，而她证明了自己能胜任。"],["Her manager [supervised] a big project with a tight [deadline].","她的经理负责监管一个期限很紧的大项目。"],["The [workload] was heavy, and there was little [incentive] to stay.","工作量很大，却没什么让人留下的激励。"],["She tried to [negotiate] a higher salary but failed.","她试着谈更高的薪水，没有成功。"],["A year later she [resigned] and became an [entrepreneur].","一年后她辞职，成了一名创业者。"]],"g":[["became","成为"],["full-time","全职的"],["company","公司"],["proved","证明"],["manager","经理"],["project","项目"],["tight","紧的"],["heavy","重的"],["salary","薪水"],["failed","失败"]],"w":[["internship","ˈɪnˌtərnˌʃɪp","n. 实习","do an internship","实习","intern 实习生"],["candidate","ˈkæn(d)əˌdeɪt","n. 候选人，应聘者","a job candidate","求职者","也指考生"],["recruit","rəˈkrut","v. 招聘","recruit new staff","招新员工","名词 recruitment"],["qualification","ˌkwɑləfəˈkeɪʃən","n. 资格，资历","academic qualifications","学历","动词 qualify"],["competent","ˈkɑmpəd(ə)nt","adj. 能胜任的","a competent manager","称职的经理","名词 competence"],["supervise","ˈsupərˌvaɪz","v. 监督，指导","supervise a project","监管项目","super- 在上 + vis 看；supervisor 主管"],["deadline","ˈdɛdˌlaɪn","n. 截止期限","meet a deadline","赶上期限","miss a deadline 错过期限"],["workload","ˈwərkˌloʊd","n. 工作量","a heavy workload","繁重的工作量","work + load 负担"],["incentive","ɪnˈsɛn(t)ɪv","n. 激励，动机","financial incentive","经济激励","近义 motivation"],["negotiate","nəˈɡoʊʃiˌeɪt","v. 谈判，协商","negotiate a deal","谈成交易","名词 negotiation"],["resign","rəˈzaɪn","v. 辞职","resign from a post","辞去职务","名词 resignation"],["entrepreneur","ˌɑntrəprəˈnʊr","n. 创业者，企业家","a young entrepreneur","年轻创业者","来自法语，注意拼写"]]},{"t":"媒体与信息","e":"Media","s":[["A [rumor] about a famous singer [circulated] online last week.","上周，一条关于某著名歌手的谣言在网上流传。"],["An [anonymous] user posted it, and several websites put it in their [headlines].","发帖的是一名匿名用户，好几家网站把它放上了头条。"],["The [coverage] was clearly [biased], and many details were [exaggerated].","这些报道明显带有偏见，许多细节被夸大了。"],["One careful [journalist] decided to [verify] the story and found it was false.","一位认真的记者决定核实这件事，发现是假的。"],["The case is still [controversial]: some say the singer wanted [publicity].","此事至今仍有争议：有人说是歌手想博取关注。"],["Readers who [subscribe] to serious newspapers were not fooled.","订阅严肃报纸的读者没有上当。"]],"g":[["famous","著名的"],["singer","歌手"],["online","在网上"],["posted","发布"],["several","几个"],["websites","网站"],["clearly","明显地"],["details","细节"],["careful","认真的"],["decided","决定"],["false","假的"],["case","事件"],["serious","严肃的"],["fooled","被骗"]],"w":[["rumor","ˈrumər","n. 谣言","spread a rumor","散布谣言","英式拼写 rumour"],["circulate","ˈsərkjəleɪt","v. 流传；循环","rumors circulate","谣言流传","circle 圆 → 转圈传"],["anonymous","əˈnɑnəməs","adj. 匿名的","an anonymous letter","匿名信","an- 无 + onym 名字"],["headline","ˈhɛdˌlaɪn","n. 标题，头条","make the headlines","上头条","head + line"],["coverage","ˈkəv(ə)rɪdʒ","n. 新闻报道；覆盖范围","media coverage","媒体报道","动词 cover 报道"],["biased","ˈbaɪəst","adj. 有偏见的","be biased against","对…有偏见","名词 bias"],["exaggerate","ɪɡˈzædʒəˌreɪt","v. 夸大","exaggerate the facts","夸大事实","名词 exaggeration"],["journalist","ˈdʒərnələst","n. 记者","a freelance journalist","自由记者","journal 报刊 + -ist"],["verify","ˈvɛrəˌfaɪ","v. 核实","verify the facts","核实事实","ver = 真（very 同根）"],["controversial","ˌkɑntrəˈvərsiəl","adj. 有争议的","a controversial issue","有争议的问题","名词 controversy"],["publicity","pəˈblɪsədi","n. 曝光度，宣传","seek publicity","博取关注","public + -ity"],["subscribe","səbˈskraɪb","v. 订阅","subscribe to a magazine","订阅杂志","sub- 在下 + scrib 写"]]},{"t":"法律与犯罪","e":"Law","s":[["The new [legislation] on food safety is strict.","新的食品安全立法很严格。"],["Police will [enforce] it, and any company that [violates] it will be [prosecuted].","警方将强制执行，任何违反的公司都会被起诉。"],["Last month the [defendant], a factory owner, was tried for a serious [offence]. Three workers [testified] against him.","上个月，被告（一名工厂老板）因一项严重的违法行为受审，三名工人出庭作证指控他。"],["The [verdict] was clear: the [penalty] was a huge fine, and he had to [compensate] the victims.","判决很明确：处以巨额罚款，并且他必须赔偿受害者。"],["He argued that his business was [legitimate], but the judge disagreed.","他辩称自己的生意是合法的，但法官不认同。"],["Some people now want to [abolish] the old, weaker rules.","现在有人希望废除旧的、较宽松的规定。"]],"g":[["food safety","食品安全"],["strict","严格的"],["police","警察"],["company","公司"],["factory owner","工厂老板"],["was tried","受审"],["serious","严重的"],["against","反对"],["clear","明确的"],["huge fine","巨额罚款"],["victims","受害者"],["argued","辩称"],["judge","法官"],["disagreed","不同意"],["weaker","较弱的"]],"w":[["legislation","ˌlɛdʒəˈsleɪʃən","n. 立法，法规","pass legislation","通过立法","leg = 法律（legal 同根）"],["enforce","ɪnˈfɔrs","v. 强制执行","enforce the law","执法","en- + force 力量"],["violate","ˈvaɪəˌleɪt","v. 违反；侵犯","violate the rules","违反规定","名词 violation"],["prosecute","ˈprɑsəˌkjut","v. 起诉","be prosecuted for","因…被起诉","名词 prosecution"],["defendant","dəˈfɛnd(ə)nt","n. 被告","the defendant","被告","defend 辩护；反义 plaintiff 原告"],["offence","əˈfɛn(t)s","n. 违法行为；冒犯","a criminal offence","刑事犯罪","美式拼写 offense"],["testify","ˈtɛstəˌfaɪ","v. 作证","testify in court","出庭作证","和 test, testimony（证词）同根"],["verdict","ˈvərdɪk(t)","n. 判决，裁决","reach a verdict","作出裁决","ver 真 + dict 说 → 说出真相"],["penalty","ˈpɛnlti","n. 处罚，罚金","death penalty","死刑","和 punish, pain 同源"],["compensate","ˈkɑmpənˌseɪt","v. 赔偿；弥补","compensate for the loss","赔偿损失","名词 compensation"],["legitimate","ləˈdʒɪdəmət","adj. 合法的，正当的","a legitimate reason","正当理由","leg = 法律"],["abolish","əˈbɑlɪʃ","v. 废除","abolish a law","废除法律","名词 abolition"]]},{"t":"科学研究","e":"Research","s":[["The team noticed a strange [phenomenon]: plants near the road grew faster.","研究团队注意到一个奇怪的现象：路边的植物长得更快。"],["They [speculated] that light at night was the cause and formed a [hypothesis].","他们推测原因是夜间的灯光，并提出了一个假说。"],["To get [empirical] evidence, they controlled every [variable] in the lab.","为获得实证证据，他们在实验室里控制了每一个变量。"],["The [preliminary] results showed a strong [correlation] between light and growth, and the [statistical] analysis supported it.","初步结果显示光照与生长之间有很强的相关性，统计分析也支持这一点。"],["Still, the evidence was not [conclusive]. Other labs must [replicate] the experiment to [validate] the [methodology].","不过证据还不是决定性的，其他实验室必须重复这项实验，来验证这套研究方法。"]],"g":[["noticed","注意到"],["strange","奇怪的"],["plants","植物"],["cause","原因"],["formed","形成"],["evidence","证据"],["controlled","控制"],["lab","实验室"],["results","结果"],["growth","生长"],["analysis","分析"],["supported","支持"],["experiment","实验"]],"w":[["phenomenon","fəˈnɑməˌnɑn","n. 现象","a natural phenomenon","自然现象","复数 phenomena"],["speculate","ˈspɛk(j)əˌleɪt","v. 推测；投机","speculate about","推测…","spec 看 → 看着猜；名词 speculation"],["hypothesis","haɪˈpɑθəsəs","n. 假说","test a hypothesis","检验假说","复数 hypotheses"],["empirical","ɪmˈpɪrək(ə)l","adj. 实证的，凭经验的","empirical evidence","实证证据","和 experience 意思相通"],["variable","ˈvɛriəb(ə)l","n. 变量 adj. 多变的","control the variables","控制变量","vary 变化 + -able"],["preliminary","prəˈlɪməˌnɛri","adj. 初步的","preliminary results","初步结果","pre- 在前"],["correlation","ˌkɔrəˈleɪʃən","n. 相关性","correlation between A and B","A与B的相关性","co- 共同 + relation"],["statistical","stəˈtɪstəkəl","adj. 统计的","statistical data","统计数据","名词 statistics"],["conclusive","kənˈklusɪv","adj. 决定性的，确凿的","conclusive evidence","确凿证据","conclude 得出结论"],["replicate","ˈrɛpləˌkeɪt","v. 重复，复制","replicate a study","重复一项研究","re- 再；近义 repeat, copy"],["validate","ˈvæləˌdeɪt","v. 验证，证实","validate a theory","验证理论","valid 有效的"],["methodology","ˌmɛθəˈdɑlədʒi","n. 方法论，研究方法","research methodology","研究方法","method + -ology 学"]]},{"t":"城市生活","e":"City Life","s":[["Life in a [metropolitan] area is exciting but tiring.","大都市的生活令人兴奋，也让人疲惫。"],["[Skyscrapers] rise in the center, and population [density] is high.","市中心摩天大楼林立，人口密度很高。"],["Because of traffic [congestion], many people [commute] two hours a day from a [suburb] or the [outskirts].","由于交通拥堵，许多人每天从郊区或城市边缘通勤两个小时。"],["The city is improving its [infrastructure]: new subway lines can [accommodate] a million riders, and old streets are being [renovated] for [pedestrians].","城市正在改善基础设施：新地铁线可容纳一百万乘客，老街道正在为行人翻修。"],["Good [urban] planning makes a crowded city livable.","好的城市规划能让拥挤的城市变得宜居。"]],"g":[["area","地区"],["exciting","令人兴奋的"],["tiring","累人的"],["rise","耸立"],["center","中心"],["population","人口"],["traffic","交通"],["improving","改善"],["subway lines","地铁线"],["riders","乘客"],["planning","规划"],["crowded","拥挤的"],["livable","宜居的"]],"w":[["metropolitan","ˌmɛtrəˈpɑlətn","adj. 大都市的","metropolitan area","大都市区","名词 metropolis"],["skyscraper","ˈskaɪˌskreɪpər","n. 摩天大楼","a glass skyscraper","玻璃摩天楼","sky + scrape 刮 → 刮到天"],["density","ˈdɛn(t)sədi","n. 密度","population density","人口密度","形容词 dense"],["congestion","kənˈdʒɛstʃən","n. 拥堵","traffic congestion","交通拥堵","近义 traffic jam，更正式"],["commute","kəˈmjut","v. 通勤","commute to work","通勤上班","commuter 通勤者"],["suburb","ˈsəbərb","n. 郊区","live in the suburbs","住在郊区","sub- 在下 + urb 城市"],["outskirts","ˈaʊtˌskərts","n. 市郊，边缘地带","on the outskirts of","在…的边缘","out + skirt 裙边"],["infrastructure","ˈɪnfrəˌstrək(t)ʃər","n. 基础设施","improve infrastructure","改善基础设施","infra- 在下 + structure"],["accommodate","əˈkɑməˌdeɪt","v. 容纳；提供住宿","accommodate 500 people","容纳500人","名词 accommodation 住宿"],["renovate","ˈrɛnəˌveɪt","v. 翻新，整修","renovate a house","翻新房子","re- + nov 新"],["pedestrian","pəˈdɛstriən","n. 行人","pedestrian street","步行街","ped = 脚（pedal 踏板）"],["urban","ˈərbən","adj. 城市的","urban planning","城市规划","反义 rural 乡村的"]]},{"t":"文化与传统","e":"Culture","s":[["The village is proud of its cultural [heritage].","这个村子以自己的文化遗产为荣。"],["Its [ethnic] songs and [folklore] have been [preserved] for centuries.","这里的民族歌曲和民间传说已保存了数百年。"],["Every spring, an ancient [ritual] is held by the river.","每年春天，河边都会举行一场古老的仪式。"],["Tourists come to see [authentic] [craftsmanship], which young people [inherit] from their grandparents.","游客前来观看地道的手工技艺，年轻人从祖辈那里继承了这些技艺。"],["The [indigenous] language, however, is in danger, because Mandarin [prevails] at school.","然而当地的土著语言正面临危险，因为学校里通行的是普通话。"],["Elders hope cultural [diversity] will remain their [legacy].","长者们希望文化多样性能作为他们留给后人的财富延续下去。"]],"g":[["village","村庄"],["proud of","为…骄傲"],["cultural","文化的"],["centuries","世纪"],["ancient","古老的"],["is held","举行"],["tourists","游客"],["grandparents","祖父母"],["language","语言"],["in danger","处于危险"],["Mandarin","普通话"],["elders","长者"],["remain","保持"]],"w":[["heritage","ˈhɛrədɪdʒ","n. 遗产","cultural heritage","文化遗产","和 inherit 同根"],["ethnic","ˈɛθnɪk","adj. 民族的，种族的","ethnic group","民族","名词 ethnicity"],["folklore","ˈfoʊkˌlɔr","n. 民间传说，民俗","local folklore","当地民间传说","folk 民间 + lore 知识"],["preserve","prəˈzərv","v. 保存，保护","preserve traditions","保存传统","名词 preservation"],["ritual","ˈrɪtʃ(əw)əl","n. 仪式","a religious ritual","宗教仪式","也指“例行习惯”"],["authentic","ɔˈθɛn(t)ɪk","adj. 真正的，地道的","authentic Chinese food","地道中餐","反义 fake"],["craftsmanship","ˈkræf(t)sm(ə)nˌʃɪp","n. 手艺，工艺","fine craftsmanship","精湛工艺","craft 手艺 + man + -ship"],["inherit","ɪnˈhɛrət","v. 继承","inherit a fortune","继承一笔财产","名词 inheritance"],["indigenous","ɪnˈdɪdʒənəs","adj. 本土的，土著的","indigenous people","土著居民","近义 native"],["prevail","priˈveɪl","v. 盛行；获胜","peace prevails","和平占上风","形容词 prevalent 普遍的"],["diversity","dəˈvərsədi","n. 多样性","cultural diversity","文化多样性","形容词 diverse"],["legacy","ˈlɛɡəsi","n. 遗产，遗留之物","leave a legacy","留下遗产","多指精神上的遗产"]]},{"t":"人际关系","e":"Relationships","s":[["Tom and Jack were [intimate] friends with [mutual] trust.","汤姆和杰克曾是互相信任的亲密朋友。"],["Then Tom felt Jack had [betrayed] him, and he became [hostile].","后来汤姆觉得杰克背叛了他，态度变得充满敌意。"],["Their quarrel [alienated] other friends too.","两人的争吵也让其他朋友疏远了。"],["Jack was [reluctant] to apologize at first. Later he wrote a [sincere] letter, and Tom showed some [sympathy].","杰克起初不愿道歉，后来写了一封真诚的信，汤姆也表示了一些体谅。"],["Both made a [compromise] and were finally [reconciled].","双方各让一步，终于和好。"],["They learned to be more [considerate] and to [tolerate] each other's faults.","他们学会了更体贴，也学会了容忍对方的缺点。"]],"g":[["trust","信任"],["felt","觉得"],["quarrel","争吵"],["apologize","道歉"],["at first","起初"],["later","后来"],["letter","信"],["finally","最终"],["faults","缺点"]],"w":[["intimate","ˈɪn(t)əmət","adj. 亲密的","intimate friends","密友","名词 intimacy"],["mutual","ˈmjutʃ(əw)əl","adj. 相互的，共同的","mutual understanding","相互理解","mutual friend 共同的朋友"],["betray","bəˈtreɪ","v. 背叛；泄露","betray a friend","背叛朋友","名词 betrayal"],["hostile","ˈhɑst(ə)l","adj. 敌对的","be hostile to","对…有敌意","名词 hostility"],["alienate","ˈeɪliəˌneɪt","v. 使疏远","alienate one's friends","使朋友疏远","alien 外来的、陌生的"],["reluctant","rəˈləkt(ə)nt","adj. 不情愿的","be reluctant to do","不愿做","近义 unwilling"],["sincere","sɪnˈsɪr","adj. 真诚的","a sincere apology","真诚的道歉","信末 Sincerely"],["sympathy","ˈsɪmpəθi","n. 同情，体谅","feel sympathy for","同情…","sym- 共同 + path 感情"],["compromise","ˈkɑmprəˌmaɪz","n./v. 妥协","reach a compromise","达成妥协","com- 共同 + promise"],["reconcile","ˈrɛkənˌsaɪl","v. 使和解；调和","be reconciled with","与…和解","名词 reconciliation"],["considerate","kənˈsɪd(ə)rət","adj. 体贴的","be considerate of others","体谅他人","别混 considerable 相当大的"],["tolerate","ˈtɑləˌreɪt","v. 容忍","tolerate mistakes","容忍错误","名词 tolerance；形容词 tolerant"]]},{"t":"政府与政治","e":"Politics","s":[["The new [coalition] government promised to fight [corruption] and cut [bureaucracy].","新的联合政府承诺打击腐败、削减官僚作风。"],["It plans to [implement] a tax reform and make spending more [transparent].","它计划实施税制改革，让开支更加透明。"],["Under the [constitution], local [authorities] must publish their budgets.","根据宪法，地方当局必须公布预算。"],["Abroad, the country defends its [sovereignty] but prefers [diplomatic] solutions. It refused to join the [sanctions] against its neighbor.","在对外事务上，该国捍卫主权，但倾向于外交途径解决问题，拒绝参与对邻国的制裁。"],["Critics say real [democracy] needs more than promises, and they urge voters to stay [vigilant].","批评者说，真正的民主需要的不只是承诺，并敦促选民保持警惕。"]],"g":[["government","政府"],["promised","承诺"],["fight","打击"],["tax reform","税制改革"],["spending","开支"],["local","地方的"],["publish","公布"],["budgets","预算"],["abroad","在国外"],["defends","捍卫"],["prefers","更喜欢"],["solutions","解决办法"],["refused","拒绝"],["neighbor","邻国"],["critics","批评者"],["urge","敦促"],["voters","选民"]],"w":[["coalition","ˌkoʊəˈlɪʃən","n. 联盟，联合政府","form a coalition","组成联盟","co- 共同"],["corruption","kəˈrəpʃən","n. 腐败","fight corruption","反腐","形容词 corrupt"],["bureaucracy","bjʊˈrɑkrəsi","n. 官僚主义，官僚机构","cut bureaucracy","精简官僚机构","bureau 局 + -cracy 统治"],["implement","ˈɪmpləˌmɛnt","v. 实施，执行","implement a policy","实施政策","名词 implementation"],["transparent","træn(t)ˈspɛrənt","adj. 透明的","a transparent process","透明的流程","trans- 穿过；名词 transparency"],["constitution","ˌkɑn(t)stəˈtuʃən","n. 宪法；体质","amend the constitution","修改宪法","constitute 构成"],["authority","əˈθɔrədi","n. 当局；权威","local authorities","地方当局","作“当局”常用复数"],["sovereignty","ˈsɑvrən(t)i","n. 主权","national sovereignty","国家主权","sovereign 君主、有主权的"],["diplomatic","ˌdɪpləˈmædɪk","adj. 外交的；圆通的","diplomatic relations","外交关系","diplomat 外交官"],["sanction","ˈsæŋ(k)ʃən","n./v. 制裁；批准","impose sanctions on","对…实施制裁","一词两个相反义，看语境"],["democracy","dəˈmɑkrəsi","n. 民主","a modern democracy","现代民主国家","demo 人民 + -cracy 统治"],["vigilant","ˈvɪdʒələnt","adj. 警惕的","stay vigilant","保持警惕","名词 vigilance"]]},{"t":"消费与购物","e":"Consumption","s":[["Online [retail] has changed how we shop.","网络零售改变了我们的购物方式。"],["Shops [lure] customers with every kind of [merchandise], from daily goods to [luxury] bags.","商家用各种商品吸引顾客，从日用品到奢侈品包包。"],["My sister is [extravagant]; she cannot resist a [bargain].","我姐姐花钱大手大脚，一见便宜货就忍不住。"],["I am more [thrifty].","我比较节俭。"],["Before each [transaction], I check the [warranty] and keep the [invoice], so I can ask for a [refund] if something goes wrong.","每次交易前，我都会查看保修条款并留好发票，万一出问题可以要求退款。"],["Good service wins customer [loyalty].","好的服务才能赢得顾客的忠诚。"]],"g":[["online","网上的"],["customers","顾客"],["daily goods","日用品"],["resist","抵挡"],["check","检查"],["goes wrong","出问题"],["service","服务"],["wins","赢得"]],"w":[["retail","ˈriˌteɪl","n. 零售","retail price","零售价","反义 wholesale 批发"],["lure","lʊr","v. 引诱，吸引","lure customers","吸引顾客","也作名词：诱惑"],["merchandise","ˈmərtʃənˌdaɪz","n. 商品（总称）","quality merchandise","优质商品","merchant 商人；不可数"],["luxury","ˈləkʃ(ə)ri","n. 奢侈，奢侈品","luxury goods","奢侈品","形容词 luxurious"],["extravagant","ɪkˈstrævəɡənt","adj. 奢侈的，挥霍的","an extravagant lifestyle","奢侈的生活方式","extra- 超出"],["bargain","ˈbɑrɡ(ə)n","n. 便宜货 v. 讨价还价","a real bargain","真划算","bargain with sb 讲价"],["thrifty","ˈθrɪfti","adj. 节俭的","a thrifty shopper","节俭的购物者","名词 thrift"],["transaction","trænˈzækʃən","n. 交易","online transaction","网上交易","trans- + action"],["warranty","ˈwɔrən(t)i","n. 保修（单）","under warranty","在保修期内","近义 guarantee"],["invoice","ˈɪnˌvɔɪs","n. 发票","issue an invoice","开发票","日常小票叫 receipt"],["refund","ˈriˌfənd","n./v. 退款","get a refund","获得退款","re- 回 + fund 资金"],["loyalty","ˈlɔɪ(ə)lti","n. 忠诚","customer loyalty","客户忠诚度","形容词 loyal"]]},{"t":"灾害与救援","e":"Disaster","s":[["When the volcano [erupted], it was a [catastrophe].","火山喷发是一场大灾难。"],["The ash [devastated] three villages, and many houses [collapsed].","火山灰摧毁了三个村庄，许多房屋倒塌。"],["Luckily there were few [casualties], because people had been [evacuated] to a [shelter] the day before.","幸运的是伤亡很少，因为前一天人们已被疏散到避难所。"],["Falling rocks were still a [hazard], so rescuers took every [precaution].","落石仍是一种危险，所以救援人员采取了一切预防措施。"],["In the [aftermath], [relief] supplies arrived from all over the country.","灾后，救灾物资从全国各地运来。"],["It will take years to [restore] the area.","恢复这一地区需要好几年。"]],"g":[["volcano","火山"],["ash","火山灰"],["villages","村庄"],["luckily","幸运的是"],["falling rocks","落石"],["rescuers","救援人员"],["supplies","物资"],["arrived","到达"],["area","地区"]],"w":[["erupt","əˈrəpt","v. 喷发；爆发","a volcano erupts","火山喷发","e- 向外 + rupt 破裂；名词 eruption"],["catastrophe","kəˈtæstrəfi","n. 大灾难","a natural catastrophe","自然大灾难","比 disaster 更严重"],["devastate","ˈdɛvəˌsteɪt","v. 摧毁；使极度震惊","devastate the city","摧毁城市","形容词 devastating"],["collapse","kəˈlæps","v./n. 倒塌；崩溃","the building collapsed","大楼倒塌","也指经济、身体垮掉"],["casualty","ˈkæʒ(əw)əlti","n. 伤亡人员","heavy casualties","伤亡惨重","常用复数"],["evacuate","əˈvækjəˌweɪt","v. 疏散，撤离","evacuate residents","疏散居民","e- 向外 + vac 空"],["shelter","ˈʃɛltər","n. 避难所；庇护","take shelter","躲避","也作动词：庇护"],["hazard","ˈhæzərd","n. 危险，隐患","a fire hazard","火灾隐患","形容词 hazardous"],["precaution","priˈkɔʃən","n. 预防措施","take precautions","采取预防措施","pre- 预先 + caution 小心"],["aftermath","ˈæftərˌmæθ","n. 后果，余波","in the aftermath of","在…之后","多指灾难、战争之后"],["relief","rəˈlif","n. 救济；宽慰","disaster relief","救灾","动词 relieve"],["restore","rəˈstɔr","v. 恢复，修复","restore order","恢复秩序","名词 restoration"]]},{"t":"性格与品质","e":"Character","s":[["Our team leader is [ambitious] and [diligent].","我们的队长有抱负，也很勤奋。"],["She is [persistent] when problems appear and [conscientious] about every detail.","遇到问题她坚持不懈，对每个细节都认真负责。"],["She is also [versatile]: she can write code, design, and sell.","她还多才多艺：会写代码、做设计、跑销售。"],["People respect her [integrity] and her [candid] advice.","大家敬重她的正直和坦率的建议。"],["She stays [humble], never [arrogant].","她一直很谦逊，从不傲慢。"],["Her only weakness is that she can be [stubborn].","唯一的缺点是有时固执。"],["Her partner is more [cautious], so they balance each other.","她的搭档更谨慎，两人正好互补。"],["Together they have real [charisma].","他们在一起很有感召力。"]],"g":[["team leader","队长"],["appear","出现"],["detail","细节"],["code","代码"],["design","设计"],["respect","尊敬"],["advice","建议"],["weakness","弱点"],["partner","搭档"],["balance","平衡"]],"w":[["ambitious","æmˈbɪʃəs","adj. 有抱负的，有野心的","an ambitious plan","宏大的计划","名词 ambition"],["diligent","ˈdɪlədʒənt","adj. 勤奋的","a diligent student","勤奋的学生","名词 diligence"],["persistent","pərˈsɪstənt","adj. 坚持不懈的；持续的","persistent effort","不懈努力","动词 persist in"],["conscientious","ˌkɑn(t)ʃiˈɛn(t)ʃəs","adj. 认真负责的","a conscientious worker","尽责的员工","别混 conscious 有意识的"],["versatile","ˈvərsədl","adj. 多才多艺的；多用途的","a versatile actor","戏路宽的演员","vers = 转 → 能转向各方面"],["integrity","ɪnˈtɛɡrədi","n. 正直；完整","a man of integrity","正直的人","和 integrate 同根：完整"],["candid","ˈkændəd","adj. 坦率的","a candid opinion","坦率的意见","近义 frank"],["humble","ˈhəmb(ə)l","adj. 谦逊的；卑微的","a humble attitude","谦逊的态度","名词 humility"],["arrogant","ˈɛrəɡənt","adj. 傲慢的","an arrogant tone","傲慢的口气","名词 arrogance"],["stubborn","ˈstəbərn","adj. 固执的","as stubborn as a mule","犟得像头骡子","贬义；褒义用 determined"],["cautious","ˈkɔʃəs","adj. 谨慎的","be cautious about","对…谨慎","名词 caution"],["charisma","kəˈrɪzmə","n. 个人魅力，感召力","personal charisma","个人魅力","形容词 charismatic"]]},{"t":"思考与论证","e":"Argument","s":[["His argument sounded [plausible] at first, but it rested on a false [assumption].","他的论点乍听起来似乎有道理，但建立在一个错误的假设之上。"],["I was [skeptical], because two of his points [contradicted] each other.","我持怀疑态度，因为他有两点互相矛盾。"],["I asked him to [clarify] an [ambiguous] sentence.","我请他澄清一个含糊的句子。"],["From my [perspective], a good essay must be [coherent] and [objective].","在我看来，好文章必须连贯而客观。"],["A [rational] reader will not be [convinced] by emotion alone.","理性的读者不会只被情绪说服。"],["In the end, a classmate [refuted] his main claim with new data.","最后，一位同学用新数据驳倒了他的主要观点。"]],"g":[["argument","论点"],["sounded","听起来"],["rested on","建立在…上"],["false","错误的"],["points","观点"],["sentence","句子"],["essay","文章"],["emotion","情绪"],["alone","仅仅"],["classmate","同学"],["main claim","主要观点"],["data","数据"]],"w":[["plausible","ˈplɔzəb(ə)l","adj. 貌似有理的，可信的","a plausible explanation","说得通的解释","反义 implausible"],["assumption","əˈsəm(p)ʃən","n. 假设，假定","make an assumption","作出假设","动词 assume"],["skeptical","ˈskɛptək(ə)l","adj. 怀疑的","be skeptical about","对…持怀疑","英式 sceptical"],["contradict","ˌkɑntrəˈdɪk(t)","v. 与…矛盾；反驳","contradict oneself","自相矛盾","contra- 相反 + dict 说"],["clarify","ˈklɛrəˌfaɪ","v. 澄清，阐明","clarify a point","澄清一点","clear + -ify；名词 clarification"],["ambiguous","æmˈbɪɡjəwəs","adj. 模棱两可的","an ambiguous answer","含糊的回答","名词 ambiguity"],["perspective","pərˈspɛktɪv","n. 视角，观点","from a new perspective","从新视角","per- 穿过 + spect 看"],["coherent","koʊˈhɪrənt","adj. 连贯的，有条理的","a coherent argument","条理清楚的论证","名词 coherence"],["objective","əbˈdʒɛktɪv","adj. 客观的 n. 目标","an objective view","客观的看法","反义 subjective 主观的"],["rational","ˈræʃ(ə)nəl","adj. 理性的","a rational decision","理性的决定","反义 irrational"],["convince","kənˈvɪn(t)s","v. 使信服，说服","convince sb of sth","使某人相信","形容词 convincing"],["refute","rəˈfjut","v. 驳斥，反驳","refute a claim","驳斥一种说法","写作里比 disagree 更有力"]]},{"t":"变化与趋势","e":"Trends","s":[["Sales [surged] in spring and reached a [peak] in May. Then they [plunged] in a [dramatic] way.","销量在春季激增，五月达到顶峰，随后急剧暴跌。"],["After that came a [gradual] [decline], and the market kept [shrinking].","之后是逐步下滑，市场不断萎缩。"],["For two years, business was [stagnant].","有两年时间生意停滞不前。"],["Meanwhile costs [escalated], and profits [diminished].","与此同时成本不断攀升，利润减少。"],["This year the company managed to [reverse] the trend, and growth is [accelerating] again.","今年公司成功扭转了这一趋势，增长再次加速。"]],"g":[["sales","销量"],["reached","达到"],["market","市场"],["business","生意"],["meanwhile","与此同时"],["costs","成本"],["profits","利润"],["managed to","成功做到"],["trend","趋势"],["growth","增长"]],"w":[["surge","sərdʒ","v./n. 激增，汹涌","a surge in demand","需求激增","图表作文高频"],["peak","pik","n. 顶峰 v. 达到高峰","reach a peak","达到顶峰","peak hours 高峰时段"],["plunge","pləndʒ","v./n. 暴跌；跳入","prices plunged","价格暴跌","近义 plummet"],["dramatic","drəˈmædɪk","adj. 急剧的；戏剧性的","a dramatic change","剧变","副词 dramatically"],["gradual","ˈɡrædʒ(ə)wəl","adj. 逐渐的","a gradual increase","逐步增长","grade 等级 → 一级一级"],["decline","dəˈklaɪn","v./n. 下降；婉拒","a decline in sales","销量下降","de- 向下"],["shrink","ʃrɪŋk","v. 收缩，缩水","a shrinking market","萎缩的市场","shrink – shrank – shrunk"],["stagnant","ˈstæɡnənt","adj. 停滞的","a stagnant economy","停滞的经济","名词 stagnation"],["escalate","ˈɛskəˌleɪt","v. 逐步上升，升级","costs escalate","成本攀升","escalator 自动扶梯"],["diminish","dəˈmɪnɪʃ","v. 减少，削弱","diminishing returns","收益递减","mini = 小"],["reverse","rəˈvərs","v. 逆转，颠倒","reverse a trend","扭转趋势","re- 回 + vers 转"],["accelerate","əkˈsɛləˌreɪt","v. 加速","accelerate growth","加速增长","accelerator 油门"]]},{"t":"全球化","e":"Globalization","s":[["[Globalization] has [integrated] the world economy.","全球化使世界经济融为一体。"],["[Multinational] companies [outsource] production to [emerging] countries, and [domestic] workers worry about their jobs.","跨国公司把生产外包给新兴国家，本国工人担心饭碗不保。"],["Trade [barriers] fall, and millions of [immigrants] move across borders.","贸易壁垒降低，数以百万计的移民跨越国界。"],["Nations are now [interdependent]: a crisis in one place spreads quickly.","各国如今相互依存：一地的危机很快就会蔓延。"],["Yet a few giant firms [dominate] the market, and the [disparity] between rich and poor is growing.","然而少数巨头企业主导着市场，贫富差距不断扩大。"],["Some governments respond by [restricting] imports.","一些政府的对策是限制进口。"]],"g":[["economy","经济"],["production","生产"],["trade","贸易"],["borders","边境"],["nations","国家"],["crisis","危机"],["spreads","蔓延"],["giant firms","巨头公司"],["market","市场"],["governments","政府"],["respond","回应"],["imports","进口"]],"w":[["globalization","ˌɡloʊbələˈzeɪʃən","n. 全球化","economic globalization","经济全球化","global + -ize + -ation"],["integrate","ˈɪn(t)əˌɡreɪt","v. 整合，融入","integrate into society","融入社会","名词 integration"],["multinational","ˌməltiˈnæʃən(ə)l","adj. 跨国的 n. 跨国公司","a multinational company","跨国公司","multi- 多 + national"],["outsource","ˈaʊtˌsɔrs","v. 外包","outsource jobs","把工作外包","out + source 来源"],["emerging","əˈmərdʒɪŋ","adj. 新兴的","emerging markets","新兴市场","动词 emerge 出现"],["domestic","dəˈmɛstɪk","adj. 国内的；家庭的","domestic market","国内市场","GDP 的 D"],["barrier","ˈbɛriər","n. 障碍，壁垒","trade barriers","贸易壁垒","language barrier 语言障碍"],["immigrant","ˈɪməɡrənt","n.（外来）移民","illegal immigrants","非法移民","im- 进入；移出叫 emigrant"],["interdependent","ˌɪn(t)ərdəˈpɛnd(ə)nt","adj. 相互依存的","interdependent economies","相互依存的经济体","inter- 相互 + dependent"],["dominate","ˈdɑməˌneɪt","v. 支配，主导","dominate the market","主导市场","形容词 dominant"],["disparity","dəˈspɛrədi","n. 差距，悬殊","income disparity","收入差距","dis- 不 + par 相等"],["restrict","rəˈstrɪk(t)","v. 限制","restrict access","限制进入","名词 restriction"]]},{"t":"艺术与娱乐","e":"Arts","s":[["The gallery is showing [contemporary] art this month.","这家美术馆本月展出当代艺术。"],["One [abstract] [sculpture] has been called a [masterpiece].","其中一件抽象雕塑被称为杰作。"],["It [portrays] a mother, though you can hardly see a face.","它刻画的是一位母亲，尽管几乎看不出面孔。"],["Critics [acclaim] its [aesthetic] value.","评论家盛赞它的审美价值。"],["In the evening, a new film of an unusual [genre] had its [premiere] there.","晚上，一部类型独特的新片在那里首映。"],["When the sound failed, the lead actor [improvised] a speech, and the audience [applauded].","音响出故障时，男主角即兴发表了一段讲话，观众报以掌声。"],["The night was a [spectacular] success.","这一晚取得了极为精彩的成功。"]],"g":[["gallery","美术馆"],["hardly","几乎不"],["critics","评论家"],["value","价值"],["unusual","不寻常的"],["sound","声音"],["failed","出故障"],["lead actor","男主角"],["speech","讲话"],["audience","观众"],["success","成功"]],"w":[["contemporary","kənˈtɛmpəˌrɛri","adj. 当代的；同时代的","contemporary art","当代艺术","con- 共同 + tempor 时间"],["abstract","ˈæbˌstræk(t)","adj. 抽象的 n. 摘要","abstract painting","抽象画","反义 concrete 具体的"],["sculpture","ˈskəlptʃər","n. 雕塑","a bronze sculpture","青铜雕塑","sculptor 雕塑家"],["masterpiece","ˈmæstərˌpis","n. 杰作","a literary masterpiece","文学杰作","master + piece"],["portray","pɔrˈtreɪ","v. 描绘，刻画","portray a hero","刻画英雄","名词 portrait 肖像"],["acclaim","əˈkleɪm","v./n. 称赞，喝彩","critically acclaimed","广受好评的","claim = 喊"],["aesthetic","ɛsˈθɛdɪk","adj. 审美的，美学的","aesthetic value","审美价值","美式也拼 esthetic"],["genre","ˈʒɑnrə","n. 类型，体裁","a film genre","电影类型","来自法语，读音特殊"],["premiere","priˈmjɛr","n. 首映，首演","world premiere","全球首映","和 prime（首要）同源"],["improvise","ˈɪmprəˌvaɪz","v. 即兴创作；临时凑合","improvise a speech","即兴演讲","名词 improvisation"],["applaud","əˈplɔd","v. 鼓掌；赞许","applaud loudly","热烈鼓掌","名词 applause"],["spectacular","spɛkˈtækjələr","adj. 壮观的，精彩的","a spectacular view","壮丽景色","spect 看 → 值得看"]]},{"t":"学习与记忆","e":"Learning","s":[["To [acquire] a language, you do not need to [memorize] long lists.","要学会一门语言，你不需要背长长的单词表。"],["Words are easier to [retain] when you meet them in context.","在语境中遇到的词更容易记住。"],["Review helps [consolidate] memory, and each [recall] [reinforces] it.","复习有助于巩固记忆，每一次回想都会强化它。"],["Do not let your phone [distract] you.","别让手机分散你的注意力。"],["Short, [intensive] sessions work better than long, tired ones.","短时间的高强度学习，比长时间疲惫的学习更有效。"],["[Immerse] yourself in English songs and films.","让自己沉浸在英文歌曲和电影里。"],["As your vocabulary [accumulates], you will [comprehend] more and become [proficient].","随着词汇量的积累，你会理解得更多，变得熟练。"]],"g":[["language","语言"],["lists","列表"],["context","语境"],["review","复习"],["memory","记忆"],["sessions","学习时段"],["tired","疲惫的"],["vocabulary","词汇量"]],"w":[["acquire","əˈkwaɪ(ə)r","v. 获得，习得","acquire a skill","掌握技能","名词 acquisition"],["memorize","ˈmɛməˌraɪz","v. 记住，背诵","memorize a poem","背一首诗","memory + -ize"],["retain","rəˈteɪn","v. 保留，记住","retain information","记住信息","re- + tain 拿住"],["consolidate","kənˈsɑləˌdeɪt","v. 巩固","consolidate knowledge","巩固知识","con- + solid 坚固"],["recall","rəˈkɔl","v./n. 回想；召回","recall a name","想起一个名字","re- 回 + call"],["reinforce","ˌriənˈfɔrs","v. 加强，强化","reinforce memory","强化记忆","re- + in + force"],["distract","dəˈstræk(t)","v. 分散注意力","distract sb from work","使某人分心","名词 distraction"],["intensive","ɪnˈtɛn(t)sɪv","adj. 密集的，高强度的","intensive training","强化训练","别混 intense 强烈的"],["immerse","ɪˈmərs","v. 沉浸；浸没","be immersed in","沉浸于","名词 immersion"],["accumulate","əˈkjum(j)əˌleɪt","v. 积累","accumulate experience","积累经验","名词 accumulation"],["comprehend","ˌkɑmprəˈhɛnd","v. 理解","comprehend a text","理解文章","reading comprehension 阅读理解"],["proficient","prəˈfɪʃənt","adj. 熟练的，精通的","be proficient in","精通…","名词 proficiency"]]},{"t":"道德与责任","e":"Ethics","s":[["The manager faced a [dilemma].","经理陷入了两难。"],["Firing old workers would save money, but was it [ethical]?","解雇老员工能省钱，但这合乎道德吗？"],["He felt an [obligation] to them, and his [conscience] troubled him.","他觉得对他们负有义务，良心不安。"],["A company that [exploits] its staff cannot [justify] it by profit.","一家剥削员工的公司，不能拿利润来为自己辩护。"],["The public would [condemn] such [hypocrisy], since the firm claims to care about people.","公众会谴责这种虚伪，因为这家公司一向标榜关心员工。"],["Leaders must be [accountable] and respect workers' [dignity].","领导者必须负起责任，尊重员工的尊严。"],["Honesty is a [virtue], and so is [compassion].","诚实是一种美德，同情心也是。"]],"g":[["manager","经理"],["faced","面临"],["firing","解雇"],["save","节省"],["troubled","使不安"],["staff","员工"],["profit","利润"],["public","公众"],["firm","公司"],["claims","声称"],["leaders","领导者"],["respect","尊重"],["honesty","诚实"]],"w":[["dilemma","dəˈlɛmə","n. 两难困境","face a dilemma","面临两难","di- 二：两个都难选"],["ethical","ˈɛθəkəl","adj. 道德的，伦理的","ethical issues","伦理问题","名词 ethics"],["obligation","ˌɑbləˈɡeɪʃən","n. 义务，责任","have an obligation to do","有义务做","动词 oblige"],["conscience","ˈkɑnʃən(t)s","n. 良心","a guilty conscience","内疚","别混 conscious 有意识的"],["exploit","ɪkˈsplɔɪt","v. 剥削；开发利用","exploit workers","剥削工人","名词 exploitation"],["justify","ˈdʒəstəˌfaɪ","v. 证明…正当","justify one's action","为行为辩护","just 公正 + -ify"],["condemn","kənˈdɛm","v. 谴责；判刑","condemn violence","谴责暴力","比 criticize 更重"],["hypocrisy","həˈpɑkrəsi","n. 虚伪","sheer hypocrisy","十足的虚伪","hypocrite 伪君子"],["accountable","əˈkaʊn(t)əbəl","adj. 负有责任的","be accountable for","对…负责","名词 accountability"],["dignity","ˈdɪɡnədi","n. 尊严","human dignity","人的尊严","with dignity 有尊严地"],["virtue","ˈvərtʃu","n. 美德；优点","a moral virtue","道德上的美德","反义 vice 恶习"],["compassion","kəmˈpæʃən","n. 同情，怜悯","show compassion","表示同情","com- 共同 + passion 感受"]]},{"t":"人口与家庭","e":"Family","s":[["The country's [demographic] structure is changing.","这个国家的人口结构正在变化。"],["[Longevity] is rising while the birth rate falls, so the [elderly] depend on a smaller workforce for their [pension].","寿命延长而出生率下降，于是老年人的养老金要依靠越来越少的劳动力。"],["A typical [household] is smaller now, and many children have no [sibling].","如今典型的家庭规模更小，许多孩子没有兄弟姐妹。"],["Parents spend heavily on [upbringing], hoping to [nurture] talent. [Adolescents] feel the pressure.","父母在养育上投入很大，希望培养出人才，青少年因此感到压力。"],["A [spouse] often cares for both children and aging parents.","夫妻中的一方常常要同时照顾孩子和年迈的父母。"],["[Fertility] policies alone cannot solve this; society must [alleviate] the burden on families.","只靠生育政策解决不了这个问题，社会必须减轻家庭的负担。"]],"g":[["structure","结构"],["birth rate","出生率"],["depend on","依靠"],["workforce","劳动力"],["typical","典型的"],["spend heavily","花很多钱"],["talent","人才"],["pressure","压力"],["cares for","照顾"],["aging","年迈的"],["policies","政策"],["solve","解决"],["society","社会"],["burden","负担"]],"w":[["demographic","ˌdɛməˈɡræfɪk","adj. 人口（统计）的","demographic change","人口变化","demo 人民 + graph 记录"],["longevity","lɔnˈdʒɛvədi","n. 长寿，寿命","increase longevity","延长寿命","long + ev 年龄"],["elderly","ˈɛldərli","adj. 年长的","the elderly","老年人","比 old 礼貌"],["pension","ˈpɛnʃən","n. 养老金","live on a pension","靠养老金生活","pensioner 领养老金的人"],["household","ˈhaʊsˌ(h)oʊld","n. 家庭，一户","household income","家庭收入","house + hold"],["sibling","ˈsɪblɪŋ","n. 兄弟姐妹","an older sibling","哥哥或姐姐","不分男女的统称"],["upbringing","ˈəpˌbrɪŋɪŋ","n. 养育，教养","a strict upbringing","严格的家教","来自 bring up 抚养"],["nurture","ˈnərtʃər","v. 培养，养育","nurture talent","培养人才","和 nurse, nutrition 同源"],["adolescent","ˌædlˈɛs(ə)nt","n. 青少年","troubled adolescents","问题少年","名词 adolescence 青春期"],["spouse","spaʊs","n. 配偶","a supportive spouse","支持自己的配偶","不分男女的统称"],["fertility","fərˈtɪlədi","n. 生育力；肥沃","fertility rate","生育率","形容词 fertile"],["alleviate","əˈliviˌeɪt","v. 减轻，缓解","alleviate poverty","减轻贫困","近义 ease, relieve"]]}],[{"t":"语言与交流","e":"Language","s":[["Professor Lin studies [linguistic] change.","林教授研究语言的变化。"],["She grew up speaking a southern [dialect] with a strong [accent], and learned Mandarin at school, so she is [bilingual].","她从小说带浓重口音的南方方言，上学后学了普通话，所以是双语者。"],["She is also [fluent] in English, and her [pronunciation] is clear.","她的英语也很流利，发音清晰。"],["Students admire how [articulate] she is; some call her lectures [eloquent].","学生们佩服她表达清楚，有人说她的课很有口才。"],["She avoids academic [jargon] and sometimes uses [slang], an [idiom], or an old [proverb] to [convey] an idea.","她避免使用学术行话，有时用俚语、习语或一句老谚语来传达想法。"],["Communication is not only [verbal], she says; a [gesture] can change the meaning.","她说，交流不只是言语上的，一个手势就能改变意思。"],["A [literal] translation often fails, because a [metaphor] carries a [nuance] that a dictionary cannot show.","字面翻译常常行不通，因为隐喻带有词典无法体现的细微差别。"],["To [interpret] well, you must understand the culture before you [utter] a word.","要做好口译，开口说出一个词之前必须先理解文化。"]],"g":[["professor","教授"],["grew up","长大"],["southern","南方的"],["Mandarin","普通话"],["admire","钦佩"],["lectures","讲课"],["avoids","避免"],["academic","学术的"],["communication","交流"],["meaning","意思"],["translation","翻译"],["fails","失败"],["carries","带有"],["dictionary","词典"],["culture","文化"]],"w":[["linguistic","lɪŋˈɡwɪstɪk","adj. 语言的，语言学的","linguistic ability","语言能力","名词 linguistics 语言学"],["dialect","ˈdaɪəˌlɛk(t)","n. 方言","a local dialect","当地方言",""],["accent","ˈækˌsɛnt","n. 口音；重音","a strong accent","浓重的口音",""],["bilingual","ˌbaɪˈlɪŋɡw(ə)l","adj. 双语的","bilingual education","双语教育","bi- 二 + lingual 语言"],["fluent","ˈfluənt","adj. 流利的","be fluent in English","英语流利","名词 fluency"],["pronunciation","prəˌnən(t)siˈeɪʃən","n. 发音","correct pronunciation","正确的发音","动词 pronounce，注意拼写少个 o"],["articulate","ɑrˈtɪkjələt","adj. 表达清楚的 v. 清楚表达","an articulate speaker","口齿清楚的演讲者",""],["eloquent","ˈɛləkwənt","adj. 雄辩的，有口才的","an eloquent speech","雄辩的演讲","loqu = 说"],["jargon","ˈdʒɑrɡən","n. 行话，术语","legal jargon","法律术语",""],["slang","slæŋ","n. 俚语","street slang","街头俚语",""],["idiom","ˈɪdiəm","n. 习语，成语","an English idiom","英语习语",""],["proverb","ˈprɑˌvərb","n. 谚语","an old proverb","古老的谚语",""],["convey","kənˈveɪ","v. 传达，表达","convey a message","传达信息",""],["verbal","ˈvərb(ə)l","adj. 言语的，口头的","verbal communication","言语交流","反义 non-verbal"],["gesture","ˈdʒɛstʃər","n. 手势；姿态","make a gesture","做手势",""],["literal","ˈlɪdərəl","adj. 字面的","literal meaning","字面意思","副词 literally"],["metaphor","ˈmɛdəˌfɔr","n. 隐喻，比喻","use a metaphor","使用比喻",""],["nuance","ˈnuˌɑn(t)s","n. 细微差别","subtle nuances","细微的差别",""],["interpret","ɪnˈtərprət","v. 口译；解释","interpret for a guest","为客人口译","interpreter 口译员"],["utter","ˈədər","v. 说出，发出声音","utter a word","说出一个字","也作形容词：完全的"]]},{"t":"旅行","e":"Travel","s":[["Planning a trip starts with an [itinerary].","计划一次旅行从行程表开始。"],["Last summer our [destination] was a small island.","去年夏天我们的目的地是一座小岛。"],["Before [departure], we applied for a [visa], and at the airport we passed through [customs].","出发前我们申请了签证，在机场通过了海关。"],["We stayed at a quiet [resort] in a [coastal] village.","我们住在海边村庄里一家安静的度假村。"],["The road there was [scenic], and the harbor was so [picturesque] that everyone took photos.","去那里的路风景优美，港口美得像画一样，人人都在拍照。"],["From the hill, the view was [breathtaking].","从山上望去，景色令人惊叹。"],["We tasted [exotic] fruit and visited a famous [landmark], an old lighthouse.","我们品尝了异国水果，参观了一处著名地标——一座古老的灯塔。"],["One day we joined an [excursion] to a waterfall and went on a long [hike].","有一天我们参加了去瀑布的短途游，还徒步走了很远。"],["In the evening we took a [stroll] on the beach, and later a short [cruise] around the bay.","傍晚我们在海滩散步，后来又乘船在海湾里短途巡游。"],["I bought a [souvenir] for my mother.","我给妈妈买了一件纪念品。"],["I will never forget the [hospitality] of the local people or the [tranquil] nights.","我永远不会忘记当地人的热情好客和那些宁静的夜晚。"],["It was a [memorable] journey.","那是一次难忘的旅程。"]],"g":[["planning","计划"],["island","岛"],["applied for","申请"],["airport","机场"],["passed through","通过"],["village","村庄"],["harbor","港口"],["view","景色"],["tasted","品尝"],["lighthouse","灯塔"],["joined","参加"],["waterfall","瀑布"],["beach","海滩"],["bay","海湾"],["local","当地的"],["journey","旅程"]],"w":[["itinerary","aɪˈtɪnəˌrɛri","n. 行程，旅行计划","plan an itinerary","安排行程",""],["destination","ˌdɛstəˈneɪʃən","n. 目的地","a tourist destination","旅游目的地",""],["departure","dəˈpɑrtʃər","n. 出发，离开","departure time","出发时间","动词 depart；反义 arrival"],["visa","ˈvizə","n. 签证","apply for a visa","申请签证",""],["customs","ˈkəstəmz","n. 海关","go through customs","过海关","custom 习俗 的复数形式另有此义"],["resort","rəˈzɔrt","n. 度假胜地","a ski resort","滑雪度假村",""],["coastal","ˈkoʊst(ə)l","adj. 沿海的","coastal cities","沿海城市","名词 coast"],["scenic","ˈsinɪk","adj. 风景优美的","a scenic route","风景优美的路线","名词 scenery"],["picturesque","ˌpɪk(t)ʃəˈrɛsk","adj. 风景如画的","a picturesque village","风景如画的村庄","picture + -esque"],["breathtaking","ˈbrɛθˌteɪkɪŋ","adj. 令人惊叹的","a breathtaking view","令人惊叹的景色","take one's breath away"],["exotic","ɪɡˈzɑdɪk","adj. 异国风情的，奇异的","exotic food","异国食物",""],["landmark","ˈlæn(d)ˌmɑrk","n. 地标；里程碑","a famous landmark","著名地标",""],["excursion","ɪkˈskərʒən","n. 短途旅行","a day excursion","一日游",""],["hike","haɪk","n./v. 徒步旅行；大幅上涨","go on a hike","去远足","price hike 涨价"],["stroll","stroʊl","n./v. 散步，闲逛","take a stroll","散步",""],["cruise","kruz","n./v. 乘船游览","go on a cruise","乘游轮旅行",""],["souvenir","ˌsuvəˈnɪr","n. 纪念品","a souvenir shop","纪念品商店","来自法语"],["hospitality","ˌhɑspəˈtælədi","n. 好客，款待","warm hospitality","热情款待","形容词 hospitable"],["tranquil","ˈtræŋkwəl","adj. 宁静的","a tranquil lake","宁静的湖","名词 tranquility"],["memorable","ˈmɛm(ə)rəb(ə)l","adj. 难忘的","a memorable trip","难忘的旅行","memory + -able"]]},{"t":"饮食","e":"Food","s":[["Sichuan [cuisine] is famous around the world.","川菜闻名世界。"],["My uncle, a chef with great [culinary] skill, never follows a written [recipe].","我叔叔是一位烹饪技艺高超的厨师，从不照着写好的菜谱做。"],["He says every [ingredient] must be fresh, and the [seasoning] decides the [flavor].","他说每样食材都必须新鲜，调料决定味道。"],["His dishes are [spicy]; to him, mild food is [bland].","他的菜很辣；在他看来，味道温和的菜就是淡而无味。"],["His restaurant buys [organic] vegetables and offers a [vegetarian] menu without meat or [dairy].","他的餐馆采购有机蔬菜，并提供不含肉类和奶制品的素食菜单。"],["Each dish shows its [calorie] count, and every [beverage] is made in the kitchen.","每道菜都标明卡路里，每种饮料都是厨房自制的。"],["Good smells give customers an [appetite], but each [portion] is small.","香味让顾客胃口大开，但每份的量都不大。"],["His best dish is [roast] duck: the meat is [tender] and the skin is [crisp].","他最拿手的是烤鸭：肉嫩皮脆。"],["He adds ginger to help people [digest] the meal.","他会加姜帮助人们消化。"],["Even the flowers on the plate are [edible].","连盘子上的花都是可以吃的。"]],"g":[["chef","厨师"],["skill","技艺"],["follows","遵循"],["fresh","新鲜的"],["decides","决定"],["dishes","菜肴"],["mild","温和的"],["offers","提供"],["menu","菜单"],["meat","肉"],["count","数量"],["smells","气味"],["customers","顾客"],["duck","鸭"],["skin","皮"],["adds","添加"],["ginger","姜"],["meal","一餐"],["plate","盘子"]],"w":[["cuisine","kwəˈzin","n. 菜肴，烹饪风格","Chinese cuisine","中国菜","来自法语"],["culinary","ˈkələˌnɛri","adj. 烹饪的","culinary skills","烹饪技巧",""],["recipe","ˈrɛsəˌpi","n. 食谱；秘诀","a recipe for soup","汤的做法",""],["ingredient","ɪnˈɡridiənt","n. 原料，食材；要素","fresh ingredients","新鲜食材",""],["seasoning","ˈsizənɪŋ","n. 调味料","add seasoning","加调料","season 作动词：调味"],["flavor","ˈfleɪvər","n. 味道，风味","a strong flavor","浓郁的味道","英式拼写 flavour"],["spicy","ˈspaɪsi","adj. 辛辣的","spicy food","辣的食物","名词 spice 香料"],["bland","blænd","adj. 淡而无味的；平淡的","bland food","淡而无味的食物",""],["organic","ɔrˈɡænɪk","adj. 有机的","organic vegetables","有机蔬菜",""],["vegetarian","ˌvɛdʒəˈtɛriən","adj. 素食的 n. 素食者","a vegetarian diet","素食",""],["dairy","ˈdɛri","n. 乳制品 adj. 乳制的","dairy products","乳制品","别混 diary 日记"],["calorie","ˈkæl(ə)ri","n. 卡路里","low in calories","热量低",""],["beverage","ˈbɛv(ə)rɪdʒ","n. 饮料","alcoholic beverages","含酒精饮料","比 drink 正式"],["appetite","ˈæpəˌtaɪt","n. 食欲，胃口","lose one's appetite","没胃口",""],["portion","ˈpɔrʃən","n. 一份；部分","a large portion","一大份",""],["roast","roʊst","adj. 烤的 v. 烤","roast chicken","烤鸡",""],["tender","ˈtɛndər","adj. 嫩的；温柔的","tender meat","嫩肉",""],["crisp","krɪsp","adj. 脆的；清新的","crisp apples","脆苹果",""],["digest","dəˈdʒɛst","v. 消化；领会","digest food","消化食物","名词 digestion"],["edible","ˈɛdəb(ə)l","adj. 可食用的","edible plants","可食用植物",""]]},{"t":"交通出行","e":"Transport","s":[["Public [transit] in our city is cheap.","我们城市的公共交通很便宜。"],["A [shuttle] bus runs to the airport every ten minutes, and the [fare] is only two yuan.","机场班车每十分钟一趟，票价只要两元。"],["Yesterday I took it to the new [terminal].","昨天我坐它去了新航站楼。"],["On the way, a [vehicle] suddenly changed its [lane] at an [intersection]. Our driver hit the [brake] hard and avoided a [collision].","路上，一辆车在十字路口突然变道，我们的司机猛踩刹车，避免了相撞。"],["Because of the accident, we had to make a [detour] through a [tunnel] and pay a [toll].","因为这起事故，我们不得不绕道穿过一条隧道，还交了通行费。"],["The driver used his phone to [navigate], and he could [steer] the big bus through narrow streets.","司机用手机导航，还能驾驶大巴穿过狭窄的街道。"],["Near the port, I saw [freight] trains carrying [cargo] to a huge [vessel], while a small [ferry] crossed the river.","在港口附近，我看到货运列车正把货物运往一艘巨轮，一艘小渡船正在过河。"],["At the airport, a sign said the city's [aviation] industry is growing: a third [runway] will open next year.","机场的一块牌子上写着，本市的航空业正在发展：第三条跑道明年启用。"]],"g":[["public","公共的"],["runs","运行"],["airport","机场"],["suddenly","突然"],["driver","司机"],["hit","踩"],["avoided","避免"],["accident","事故"],["narrow","狭窄的"],["port","港口"],["carrying","运送"],["huge","巨大的"],["crossed","穿过"],["sign","牌子"],["industry","行业"]],"w":[["transit","ˈtrænzət","n. 公共交通；运输","public transit","公共交通","trans- 穿过"],["shuttle","ˈʃəd(ə)l","n. 班车；往返","a shuttle bus","班车","space shuttle 航天飞机"],["fare","fɛr","n. 车费，票价","bus fare","公交车费",""],["terminal","ˈtərmənəl","n. 航站楼，终点站 adj. 晚期的","an airport terminal","机场航站楼",""],["vehicle","ˈviək(ə)l","n. 车辆；工具","a motor vehicle","机动车",""],["lane","leɪn","n. 车道；小巷","change lanes","变道",""],["intersection","ˌɪn(t)ərˈsɛkʃən","n. 十字路口；交叉","at the intersection","在十字路口","inter- + section"],["brake","breɪk","n. 刹车 v. 刹车","hit the brakes","踩刹车","别混 break"],["collision","kəˈlɪʒ(ə)n","n. 碰撞；冲突","a head-on collision","迎面相撞","动词 collide"],["detour","ˈdiˌtʊr","n. 绕道","make a detour","绕道走",""],["tunnel","ˈtən(ə)l","n. 隧道","a railway tunnel","铁路隧道",""],["toll","toʊl","n. 通行费；伤亡人数","pay a toll","交通行费","death toll 死亡人数"],["navigate","ˈnævəˌɡeɪt","v. 导航；航行","navigate by GPS","用 GPS 导航","名词 navigation"],["steer","stɪr","v. 驾驶，掌舵；引导","steer a car","开车","steering wheel 方向盘"],["freight","freɪt","n. 货运，货物","a freight train","货运列车",""],["cargo","ˈkɑrɡoʊ","n. 货物","a cargo ship","货船",""],["vessel","ˈvɛs(ə)l","n. 船只；容器；血管","a fishing vessel","渔船","blood vessel 血管"],["ferry","ˈfɛri","n. 渡船 v. 摆渡","take a ferry","乘渡船",""],["aviation","ˌeɪviˈeɪʃən","n. 航空","civil aviation","民用航空","avi = 鸟"],["runway","ˈrənˌweɪ","n. 跑道","on the runway","在跑道上",""]]},{"t":"能源","e":"Energy","s":[["For a century the world has run on [fossil] fuels.","一个世纪以来，世界靠化石燃料运转。"],["Companies search for [petroleum] under the sea, [drill] deep wells, [extract] the oil, [refine] it, and send it through a long [pipeline].","公司在海底寻找石油，钻深井，开采原油，加以提炼，再通过长长的管道输送。"],["But these fuels will be [depleted] one day.","但这些燃料总有一天会耗尽。"],["Oil is becoming [scarce], while sunlight and wind are [abundant].","石油日益稀缺，而阳光和风却很充足。"],["Countries with a small oil [reserve] often choose [nuclear] power.","石油储量少的国家常常选择核电。"],["A modern [reactor] is safe, people are told, yet many still fear [radiation].","人们被告知现代反应堆是安全的，但许多人仍然害怕辐射。"],["On the coast, each wind [turbine] can [generate] enough electricity for a thousand homes and send it to the national [grid].","在海岸上，每台风力涡轮机能发出够一千户人家用的电，并送入国家电网。"],["Some regions also use [thermal] energy from under the ground.","有些地区还利用地下的热能。"],["Still, saving energy matters most: we must reduce [consumption], improve [efficiency], and [utilize] every source wisely.","不过节约能源最重要：我们必须减少消耗、提高效率，明智地利用每一种能源。"]],"g":[["century","世纪"],["fuels","燃料"],["search for","寻找"],["wells","井"],["sunlight","阳光"],["modern","现代的"],["fear","害怕"],["coast","海岸"],["electricity","电"],["national","国家的"],["regions","地区"],["matters","重要"],["reduce","减少"],["improve","提高"],["source","来源"],["wisely","明智地"]],"w":[["fossil","ˈfɑs(ə)l","n. 化石","fossil fuels","化石燃料",""],["petroleum","pəˈtroʊliəm","n. 石油","petroleum products","石油产品","petro- 石 + oleum 油"],["drill","drɪl","v. 钻孔；训练 n. 钻；演习","drill for oil","钻探石油","fire drill 消防演习"],["extract","ɪkˈstrækt","v. 提取，开采 n. 摘录","extract oil","开采石油","ex- 向外 + tract 拉"],["refine","rəˈfaɪn","v. 提炼；改进","refine oil","炼油","refinery 炼油厂"],["pipeline","ˈpaɪpˌlaɪn","n. 管道","an oil pipeline","输油管道",""],["deplete","dəˈplit","v. 耗尽","deplete resources","耗尽资源","名词 depletion"],["scarce","skɛrs","adj. 稀缺的","scarce resources","稀缺资源","名词 scarcity"],["abundant","əˈbənd(ə)nt","adj. 丰富的，充足的","abundant resources","丰富的资源","名词 abundance"],["reserve","rəˈzərv","n. 储备；保护区 v. 预订","oil reserves","石油储量","nature reserve 自然保护区"],["nuclear","ˈnukliər","adj. 核的","nuclear power","核电",""],["reactor","riˈæktər","n. 反应堆","a nuclear reactor","核反应堆","react + -or"],["radiation","ˌreɪdiˈeɪʃən","n. 辐射","nuclear radiation","核辐射","动词 radiate"],["turbine","ˈtərˌbaɪn","n. 涡轮机","a wind turbine","风力发电机",""],["generate","ˈdʒɛnəˌreɪt","v. 产生，发（电）","generate electricity","发电","generator 发电机"],["grid","ɡrɪd","n. 电网；网格","the power grid","电网",""],["thermal","ˈθərm(ə)l","adj. 热的，保暖的","thermal energy","热能","therm = 热"],["consumption","kənˈsəm(p)ʃən","n. 消耗，消费","energy consumption","能源消耗","动词 consume"],["efficiency","əˈfɪʃən(t)si","n. 效率","energy efficiency","能效","形容词 efficient"],["utilize","ˈjudlˌaɪz","v. 利用","utilize resources","利用资源","比 use 正式"]]},{"t":"气候","e":"Climate","s":[["The earth's [atmosphere] works like a blanket.","地球的大气层像一条毯子。"],["[Greenhouse] gases trap heat, and the [polar] regions warm fastest.","温室气体把热量困住，极地地区升温最快。"],["In the [Arctic], every [glacier] is starting to [melt], and rising seas may [submerge] small islands.","在北极，每一条冰川都开始融化，上升的海水可能淹没小岛。"],["In [tropical] areas the air is hot and [humid].","热带地区的空气又热又潮湿。"],["More [moisture] [evaporates] from the ocean, so [precipitation] becomes heavier.","更多水汽从海洋蒸发，降水因此变得更猛烈。"],["The [monsoon] arrives late, and each [hurricane] is stronger than the last.","季风来得晚了，飓风一次比一次强。"],["Heavy rain causes soil [erosion] on the hills.","大雨造成山坡水土流失。"],["Even at high [altitude], farmers notice changes: the first [frost] comes weeks later.","即使在高海拔地区，农民也注意到了变化：第一场霜晚了好几周。"],["Countries in the [temperate] zone are not safe either.","温带国家也并不安全。"],["Scientists [forecast] that storms will [intensify] in the coming years.","科学家预测，未来几年风暴还会加剧。"]],"g":[["blanket","毯子"],["gases","气体"],["trap","困住"],["heat","热量"],["regions","地区"],["rising","上升的"],["islands","岛"],["ocean","海洋"],["arrives","到来"],["soil","土壤"],["notice","注意到"],["zone","地带"],["storms","风暴"]],"w":[["atmosphere","ˈætməˌsfɪr","n. 大气层；气氛","the earth's atmosphere","地球大气层","atmo 气 + sphere 球"],["greenhouse","ˈɡrinˌ(h)aʊs","n. 温室","greenhouse gases","温室气体",""],["polar","ˈpoʊlər","adj. 极地的","polar bears","北极熊","名词 pole 极"],["arctic","ˈɑrktɪk","adj. 北极的 n. 北极","the Arctic Ocean","北冰洋","反义 Antarctic 南极"],["glacier","ˈɡleɪʃər","n. 冰川","a melting glacier","融化的冰川",""],["melt","mɛlt","v. 融化","the snow melts","雪融化",""],["submerge","səbˈmərdʒ","v. 淹没，浸入水中","be submerged in water","被水淹没","sub- 下 + merge 沉"],["tropical","ˈtrɑpəkəl","adj. 热带的","tropical rainforest","热带雨林",""],["humid","ˈ(h)juməd","adj. 潮湿的","a humid climate","潮湿的气候","名词 humidity"],["moisture","ˈmɔɪstʃər","n. 水分，湿气","absorb moisture","吸收水分","形容词 moist"],["evaporate","əˈvæpəˌreɪt","v. 蒸发；消失","water evaporates","水蒸发","vapor 蒸汽"],["precipitation","priˌsɪpəˈteɪʃən","n. 降水（量）","annual precipitation","年降水量",""],["monsoon","mɑnˈsun","n. 季风，雨季","the monsoon season","雨季",""],["hurricane","ˈhərəˌkeɪn","n. 飓风","a powerful hurricane","强飓风",""],["erosion","əˈroʊʒ(ə)n","n. 侵蚀","soil erosion","水土流失","动词 erode"],["altitude","ˈældəˌtud","n. 海拔，高度","at high altitude","在高海拔处","alt = 高"],["frost","frɔst","n. 霜，霜冻","a heavy frost","严重霜冻",""],["temperate","ˈtɛmp(ə)rət","adj. 温带的；温和的","temperate climate","温带气候",""],["forecast","ˈfɔrˌkæst","v./n. 预报，预测","weather forecast","天气预报","fore- 预先 + cast"],["intensify","ɪnˈtɛn(t)səˌfaɪ","v. 加剧，增强","competition intensifies","竞争加剧","intense + -ify"]]},{"t":"太空探索","e":"Space","s":[["As a child, Mei loved [astronomy].","小时候，梅就爱上了天文学。"],["With a small [telescope] she studied our [galaxy], read about [cosmic] rays, learned every [constellation], and once watched a total [eclipse].","她用一架小望远镜观察我们的星系，读有关宇宙射线的书，认识了每一个星座，还看过一次日全食。"],["She even followed news about an [asteroid] passing near the earth.","她甚至关注过一颗小行星从地球附近掠过的新闻。"],["Twenty years later she became an [astronaut].","二十年后，她成了一名宇航员。"],["Her [crew] of three trained for a six-month [mission].","她所在的三人机组为一项六个月的任务接受训练。"],["On the day of the flight, the [rocket] stood ready.","飞行当天，火箭矗立待发。"],["After the [launch], powerful engines [propelled] it to a [velocity] of eight kilometers per second, and it entered [orbit].","发射后，强大的发动机把它推进到每秒八公里的速度，进入轨道。"],["Without [gravity], everything floated.","没有重力，一切都飘了起来。"],["Outside was a cold [vacuum].","外面是寒冷的真空。"],["From the window of the [spacecraft], the earth looked small and blue.","从飞船的窗口望去，地球又小又蓝。"],["Her next dream is a [lunar] base, and after that, sending a [probe] to the edge of the solar system.","她的下一个梦想是建一座月球基地，再之后是向太阳系边缘发射一枚探测器。"]],"g":[["rays","射线"],["total","完全的"],["followed","关注"],["passing","经过"],["trained","训练"],["flight","飞行"],["powerful","强大的"],["engines","发动机"],["per second","每秒"],["entered","进入"],["floated","漂浮"],["base","基地"],["edge","边缘"],["solar system","太阳系"]],"w":[["astronomy","əˈstrɑnəmi","n. 天文学","study astronomy","学天文学","astro- 星"],["telescope","ˈtɛləˌskoʊp","n. 望远镜","look through a telescope","用望远镜看","tele- 远 + scope 看"],["galaxy","ˈɡæləksi","n. 星系，银河系","a distant galaxy","遥远的星系",""],["cosmic","ˈkɑzmɪk","adj. 宇宙的","cosmic rays","宇宙射线","名词 cosmos"],["constellation","ˌkɑn(t)stəˈleɪʃən","n. 星座","a bright constellation","明亮的星座","stell = 星"],["eclipse","əˈklɪps","n. 日食，月食","a solar eclipse","日食","lunar eclipse 月食"],["asteroid","ˈæstəˌrɔɪd","n. 小行星","an asteroid belt","小行星带",""],["astronaut","ˈæstrəˌnɔt","n. 宇航员","become an astronaut","成为宇航员","astro- 星 + naut 航行者"],["crew","kru","n. 全体机组（船员）","the flight crew","机组人员",""],["mission","ˈmɪʃən","n. 任务，使命","a space mission","太空任务",""],["rocket","ˈrɑkət","n. 火箭 v. 猛涨","launch a rocket","发射火箭","prices rocket 物价飞涨"],["launch","lɔn(t)ʃ","v./n. 发射；发起，推出","launch a satellite","发射卫星","launch a product 推出产品"],["propel","prəˈpɛl","v. 推进，推动","propel a boat","推动船前进","propeller 螺旋桨"],["velocity","vəˈlɑsədi","n. 速度","at high velocity","高速","比 speed 正式"],["orbit","ˈɔrbət","n. 轨道 v. 环绕运行","in orbit","在轨道上",""],["gravity","ˈɡrævədi","n. 重力；严重性","the force of gravity","重力",""],["vacuum","ˈvækˌjum","n. 真空；吸尘器","in a vacuum","在真空中","vacuum cleaner 吸尘器"],["spacecraft","ˈspeɪsˌkræf(t)","n. 航天器，飞船","a manned spacecraft","载人飞船","单复数同形"],["lunar","ˈlunər","adj. 月球的","the lunar calendar","农历","luna = 月亮"],["probe","proʊb","n. 探测器；调查 v. 探查","a space probe","太空探测器",""]]},{"t":"互联网","e":"Internet","s":[["Most of us [browse] the internet for hours every day.","我们大多数人每天上网浏览好几个小时。"],["We [scroll] through one [platform] after another, argue on a [forum], and [upload] photos, hoping they will go [viral].","我们刷完一个平台又刷另一个，在论坛上争论，上传照片，盼着它们走红。"],["Every [notification] pulls us back to the screen.","每一条通知都把我们拉回屏幕前。"],["Apps are designed to be [interactive], and for some users this leads to [addiction].","应用被设计得很有互动性，对一些用户来说这会导致上瘾。"],["There is another problem: [privacy].","还有另一个问题：隐私。"],["Last year a [hacker] caused a data [breach] at a large bank.","去年，一名黑客造成一家大银行的数据泄露。"],["He sent [malicious] links through [spam] emails. Many people lost money in the [scam].","他通过垃圾邮件发送恶意链接，许多人在这场骗局中损失了钱。"],["Experts give simple advice: use a strong [password], [install] updates, turn on the [firewall], and keep a [backup] of important files.","专家给出的建议很简单：使用强密码，安装更新，打开防火墙，给重要文件留一份备份。"],["[Cybersecurity] is everyone's job.","网络安全人人有责。"]],"g":[["argue","争论"],["hoping","希望"],["pulls","拉"],["screen","屏幕"],["designed","设计"],["users","用户"],["leads to","导致"],["caused","造成"],["data","数据"],["links","链接"],["experts","专家"],["advice","建议"],["updates","更新"],["turn on","打开"],["files","文件"]],"w":[["browse","braʊz","v. 浏览","browse the web","浏览网页","browser 浏览器"],["scroll","skroʊl","v. 滚动（屏幕）n. 卷轴","scroll down","向下滚动",""],["platform","ˈplætˌfɔrm","n. 平台；站台","a social media platform","社交媒体平台",""],["forum","ˈfɔrəm","n. 论坛","an online forum","网上论坛",""],["upload","ˌəpˈloʊd","v. 上传","upload a file","上传文件","反义 download"],["viral","ˈvaɪrəl","adj. 病毒式传播的","go viral","走红","来自 virus"],["notification","ˌnoʊdəfəˈkeɪʃən","n. 通知","a push notification","推送通知","动词 notify"],["interactive","ˌɪn(t)ərˈæktɪv","adj. 互动的","an interactive game","互动游戏","inter- + active"],["addiction","əˈdɪkʃən","n. 上瘾","internet addiction","网瘾","be addicted to"],["privacy","ˈpraɪvəsi","n. 隐私","protect privacy","保护隐私","形容词 private"],["hacker","ˈhækər","n. 黑客","a computer hacker","电脑黑客","动词 hack"],["breach","britʃ","n. 泄露；违反 v. 违反","a data breach","数据泄露","breach of contract 违约"],["malicious","məˈlɪʃəs","adj. 恶意的","malicious software","恶意软件","mal- 坏"],["spam","spæm","n. 垃圾邮件","spam email","垃圾邮件",""],["scam","skæm","n. 骗局 v. 诈骗","an online scam","网络骗局",""],["password","ˈpæsˌwərd","n. 密码","enter a password","输入密码",""],["install","ɪnˈstɔl","v. 安装","install software","安装软件","名词 installation"],["firewall","ˈfaɪ(ə)rˌwɔl","n. 防火墙","set up a firewall","设置防火墙",""],["backup","ˈbækˌəp","n. 备份；后援","make a backup","做备份","动词短语 back up"],["cybersecurity","ˈsaɪbərsəˌkjʊrədi","n. 网络安全","cybersecurity threats","网络安全威胁","cyber- 网络"]]},{"t":"理财与投资","e":"Finance","s":[["My father kept all his [savings] in one bank.","我父亲把所有积蓄都存在一家银行。"],["He made a [deposit] every month and never liked to [withdraw] money.","他每个月存一笔钱，从来不喜欢取钱。"],["But when our [currency] began to [depreciate], he realized that cash is a weak [asset].","但当我们的货币开始贬值时，他意识到现金是一种很弱的资产。"],["An adviser helped him build a [portfolio] and [diversify] it: some government [bonds], some [equity] in large companies.","一位顾问帮他建立了投资组合并使之多元化：一些政府债券，一些大公司的股权。"],["Stock prices are [volatile], the adviser warned, but a [shareholder] receives a [dividend] each year, and the [yield] is higher than bank interest.","顾问提醒说股价波动很大，但股东每年能拿到股息，收益率也比银行利息高。"],["A [broker] handles the trading.","交易由经纪人处理。"],["My father also paid off his [mortgage] early, because he hates [debt].","父亲还提前还清了房贷，因为他讨厌欠债。"],["To him, every loan is a [liability], especially when the house is the [collateral].","在他看来，每笔贷款都是负债，尤其是拿房子做抵押的时候。"],["Once a year he asks an accountant to [audit] the family accounts.","他每年请会计师审计一次家里的账目。"]],"g":[["realized","意识到"],["cash","现金"],["weak","弱的"],["adviser","顾问"],["stock prices","股价"],["warned","警告"],["receives","收到"],["interest","利息"],["handles","处理"],["trading","交易"],["paid off","还清"],["hates","讨厌"],["loan","贷款"],["especially","尤其"],["accountant","会计师"],["accounts","账目"]],"w":[["savings","ˈseɪvɪŋz","n. 积蓄，存款","life savings","毕生积蓄",""],["deposit","dəˈpɑzət","n. 存款；押金 v. 存入","make a deposit","存款",""],["withdraw","wɪðˈdrɔ","v. 取（钱）；撤回","withdraw money","取钱","名词 withdrawal"],["currency","ˈkərən(t)si","n. 货币","foreign currency","外币",""],["depreciate","dəˈpriʃiˌeɪt","v. 贬值","the currency depreciates","货币贬值","反义 appreciate 升值"],["asset","ˈæˌsɛt","n. 资产；有价值的人或物","fixed assets","固定资产",""],["portfolio","pɔrtˈfoʊlioʊ","n. 投资组合；作品集","an investment portfolio","投资组合",""],["diversify","dəˈvərsəˌfaɪ","v. 使多样化","diversify investments","分散投资",""],["bond","bɑnd","n. 债券；纽带","government bonds","国债",""],["equity","ˈɛkwədi","n. 股权；公平","private equity","私募股权",""],["volatile","ˈvɑlədl","adj. 波动大的；易变的","a volatile market","波动大的市场",""],["shareholder","ˈʃɛrˌ(h)oʊldər","n. 股东","a major shareholder","大股东","share 股份 + holder"],["dividend","ˈdɪvəˌdɛnd","n. 股息，红利","pay a dividend","派发股息","divide 分"],["yield","jild","n. 收益，产量 v. 产出；屈服","a high yield","高收益",""],["broker","ˈbroʊkər","n. 经纪人","a stock broker","股票经纪人",""],["mortgage","ˈmɔrɡɪdʒ","n. 抵押贷款，房贷","pay off a mortgage","还清房贷","t 不发音"],["debt","dɛt","n. 债务","be in debt","欠债","b 不发音"],["liability","ˌlaɪəˈbɪlədi","n. 负债；责任","assets and liabilities","资产与负债","形容词 liable"],["collateral","kəˈlædərəl","n. 抵押物","use a house as collateral","用房子做抵押",""],["audit","ˈɔdət","v./n. 审计","audit the accounts","审计账目","auditor 审计员"]]},{"t":"企业管理","e":"Management","s":[["The [corporate] [headquarters] was quiet that morning.","那天早上，公司总部很安静。"],["A new chief [executive] had arrived.","新任首席执行官到了。"],["The [board] had [appointed] her to change a company with a rigid [hierarchy] and no clear [strategy].","董事会任命她来改变这家等级森严、没有清晰战略的公司。"],["The first item on her [agenda] was a [merger] with a rival.","她议程上的第一项是与一家竞争对手合并。"],["She also planned the [acquisition] of a small software firm, which would become a [subsidiary].","她还计划收购一家小型软件公司，使其成为子公司。"],["Next, she began to [restructure] the company and [streamline] its departments.","接着，她开始重组公司，精简各个部门。"],["The [personnel] office had to [allocate] staff to new teams.","人事部门必须把员工分配到新团队。"],["She learned to [delegate] tasks, asked managers to [coordinate] with each other, and chose one person to [oversee] each project.","她学会了下放任务，要求经理们相互协调，并为每个项目选定一人负责监督。"],["At first, [morale] was low.","起初士气低落。"],["But she listened, and step by step the team reached a [consensus].","但她善于倾听，团队一步步达成了共识。"]],"g":[["chief","首席的"],["arrived","到达"],["rigid","僵化的"],["item","项目"],["rival","竞争对手"],["planned","计划"],["software","软件"],["firm","公司"],["departments","部门"],["staff","员工"],["tasks","任务"],["managers","经理"],["project","项目"],["step by step","一步步"],["reached","达成"]],"w":[["corporate","ˈkɔrp(ə)rət","adj. 公司的","corporate culture","企业文化","名词 corporation"],["headquarters","ˈhɛdˌkwɔrdərz","n. 总部","the company headquarters","公司总部","缩写 HQ"],["executive","ɪɡˈzɛkjədɪv","n. 主管，高管 adj. 执行的","chief executive officer","首席执行官","CEO 的 E"],["board","bɔrd","n. 董事会；木板","the board of directors","董事会",""],["appoint","əˈpɔɪnt","v. 任命；约定","appoint a manager","任命经理","名词 appointment"],["hierarchy","ˈhaɪ(ə)ˌrɑrki","n. 等级制度","a strict hierarchy","严格的等级制度",""],["strategy","ˈstrædədʒi","n. 战略，策略","a marketing strategy","营销策略","形容词 strategic"],["agenda","əˈdʒɛndə","n. 议程","on the agenda","在议程上",""],["merger","ˈmərdʒər","n. 合并","a merger of two firms","两家公司合并","动词 merge"],["acquisition","ˌækwəˈzɪʃən","n. 收购；获得","mergers and acquisitions","并购",""],["subsidiary","səbˈsɪdiˌɛri","n. 子公司 adj. 附属的","a wholly owned subsidiary","全资子公司",""],["restructure","ˌriˈstrəktʃər","v. 重组","restructure a company","重组公司","re- + structure"],["streamline","ˈstrimˌlaɪn","v. 精简，使效率更高","streamline the process","简化流程",""],["personnel","ˌpərsnˈɛl","n. 人员；人事部门","the personnel department","人事部","别混 personal 个人的"],["allocate","ˈæləˌkeɪt","v. 分配","allocate resources","分配资源","名词 allocation"],["delegate","ˈdɛləˌɡeɪt","v. 委派，下放 n. 代表","delegate tasks","分派任务",""],["coordinate","koʊˈɔrdəˌneɪt","v. 协调","coordinate efforts","协调行动","名词 coordination"],["oversee","ˌoʊvərˈsi","v. 监督","oversee a project","监督项目","over + see"],["morale","məˈræl","n. 士气","boost morale","提振士气","别混 moral 道德的"],["consensus","kənˈsɛn(t)səs","n. 共识","reach a consensus","达成共识",""]]},{"t":"市场营销","e":"Marketing","s":[["How do you build a [brand]?","怎样打造一个品牌？"],["First, register a [trademark] and design a simple [logo]. Then write a [slogan] that is short and [catchy].","首先注册商标，设计一个简洁的标志，然后写一句简短又好记的口号。"],["A marketing [campaign] usually includes a TV [commercial] and a [billboard] in the city center.","一场营销活动通常包括电视广告和市中心的广告牌。"],["Many firms pay a [celebrity] to [endorse] the product, or they [sponsor] a sports team.","许多公司花钱请名人为产品代言，或者赞助一支运动队。"],["But fame is not enough; a company needs [credibility].","但光有名气不够，公司还需要信誉。"],["So smart marketers begin with a [survey].","所以聪明的营销人员先从调查做起。"],["They divide customers into each [segment] and look for a [niche] that big rivals have ignored.","他们把顾客划分成各个细分群体，寻找被大对手忽视的小众市场。"],["They [customize] the product and even the [packaging] to [appeal] to that group.","他们定制产品甚至包装，来吸引那个群体。"],["Advertising can [persuade] people to buy once. Only quality brings them back, so good companies read every piece of [feedback].","广告能说服人们买一次，只有质量才能让他们回头，所以好公司会读每一条反馈。"]],"g":[["register","注册"],["design","设计"],["includes","包括"],["firms","公司"],["product","产品"],["fame","名气"],["marketers","营销人员"],["divide","划分"],["customers","顾客"],["rivals","对手"],["ignored","忽视"],["group","群体"],["advertising","广告"],["quality","质量"]],"w":[["brand","brænd","n. 品牌","a famous brand","名牌",""],["trademark","ˈtreɪdˌmɑrk","n. 商标","a registered trademark","注册商标",""],["logo","ˈloʊɡoʊ","n. 标志，徽标","a company logo","公司标志",""],["slogan","ˈsloʊɡən","n. 口号，标语","an advertising slogan","广告语",""],["catchy","ˈkɛtʃi","adj. 好记的，朗朗上口的","a catchy tune","好记的曲调","catch + -y"],["campaign","kæmˈpeɪn","n. 活动，运动","an advertising campaign","广告宣传活动",""],["commercial","kəˈmərʃəl","n. 商业广告 adj. 商业的","a TV commercial","电视广告",""],["billboard","ˈbɪlˌbɔrd","n. 广告牌","a roadside billboard","路边广告牌",""],["celebrity","səˈlɛbrədi","n. 名人","a TV celebrity","电视名人",""],["endorse","ɪnˈdɔrs","v. 代言；认可","endorse a product","为产品代言","名词 endorsement"],["sponsor","ˈspɑn(t)sər","v. 赞助 n. 赞助商","sponsor an event","赞助活动",""],["credibility","ˌkrɛdəˈbɪlədi","n. 可信度，信誉","lose credibility","失去信誉","cred = 相信"],["survey","ˈsərˌveɪ","n./v. 调查","conduct a survey","做调查",""],["segment","ˈsɛɡm(ə)nt","n. 部分；细分市场","a market segment","细分市场",""],["niche","nɪtʃ","n. 小众市场；合适的位置","a niche market","小众市场",""],["customize","ˈkəstəˌmaɪz","v. 定制","customize a product","定制产品","custom + -ize"],["packaging","ˈpækədʒɪŋ","n. 包装","plastic packaging","塑料包装",""],["appeal","əˈpil","v. 吸引；呼吁 n. 吸引力","appeal to young people","吸引年轻人",""],["persuade","pərˈsweɪd","v. 说服","persuade sb to do","说服某人做","名词 persuasion"],["feedback","ˈfidˌbæk","n. 反馈","customer feedback","客户反馈","不可数"]]},{"t":"农业与乡村","e":"Agriculture","s":[["My grandfather lived all his life in a [rural] county.","我祖父一辈子生活在一个乡村县城。"],["It was an [agricultural] region, and he was proud to be a [peasant].","那是个农业地区，他以身为农民而自豪。"],["He [cultivated] a small piece of land by the river.","他在河边耕种一小块地。"],["In spring he would [plough] the field and [sow] the seeds.","春天他犁田、播种。"],["The [crop] needed [irrigation] in the dry months.","旱季里庄稼需要灌溉。"],["He used little [fertilizer] and no [pesticide]; he pulled out every [weed] by hand.","他很少用化肥，也不用农药，杂草都是用手一棵棵拔掉。"],["When the rice was [ripe], the whole family joined the [harvest].","稻子成熟时，全家人一起收割。"],["The [grain] was stored in a [barn].","粮食存放在谷仓里。"],["Behind the house was an [orchard] of pear trees.","屋后有一片梨树果园。"],["He also kept some [livestock], and the sheep would [graze] on the [pasture] by the hill.","他还养了一些牲畜，羊群在山边的牧场上吃草。"],["He often told us about the [famine] of his childhood, and why no rice should be wasted.","他常给我们讲他童年时的饥荒，以及为什么一粒米都不该浪费。"]],"g":[["county","县"],["region","地区"],["proud","自豪的"],["field","田地"],["seeds","种子"],["pulled out","拔掉"],["rice","稻子"],["whole","整个"],["stored","储存"],["pear","梨"],["sheep","羊"],["childhood","童年"],["wasted","浪费"]],"w":[["rural","ˈrʊr(ə)l","adj. 乡村的","rural areas","农村地区","反义 urban"],["agricultural","ˌæɡrəˈkəltʃ(ə)rəl","adj. 农业的","agricultural products","农产品","名词 agriculture"],["peasant","ˈpɛz(ə)nt","n. 农民","a poor peasant","贫苦农民",""],["cultivate","ˈkəltəˌveɪt","v. 耕种；培养","cultivate the land","耕地","cultivate a habit 养成习惯"],["plough","plaʊ","v. 犁（地）n. 犁","plough the field","犁地","美式拼写 plow"],["sow","soʊ","v. 播种","sow seeds","播种","sow – sowed – sown"],["crop","krɑp","n. 庄稼；收成","a rice crop","水稻作物",""],["irrigation","ˌɪrəˈɡeɪʃən","n. 灌溉","an irrigation system","灌溉系统","动词 irrigate"],["fertilizer","ˈfərdəˌlaɪzər","n. 肥料","chemical fertilizer","化肥","fertile 肥沃的"],["pesticide","ˈpɛstəˌsaɪd","n. 杀虫剂，农药","spray pesticide","喷农药","pest 害虫 + -cide 杀"],["weed","wid","n. 杂草 v. 除草","pull out weeds","拔草",""],["ripe","raɪp","adj. 成熟的","ripe fruit","成熟的水果","动词 ripen"],["harvest","ˈhɑrvəst","n./v. 收获，收割","a good harvest","好收成",""],["grain","ɡreɪn","n. 谷物；颗粒","grain production","粮食生产",""],["barn","bɑrn","n. 谷仓","store hay in a barn","把干草存在谷仓",""],["orchard","ˈɔrtʃərd","n. 果园","an apple orchard","苹果园",""],["livestock","ˈlaɪvˌstɑk","n. 牲畜","raise livestock","饲养牲畜",""],["graze","ɡreɪz","v. 吃草，放牧；擦伤","cattle graze","牛吃草",""],["pasture","ˈpæstʃər","n. 牧场","green pasture","绿色牧场",""],["famine","ˈfæmən","n. 饥荒","suffer a famine","遭受饥荒",""]]},{"t":"住房","e":"Housing","s":[["When Sara got a job in Shanghai, she had to [relocate].","萨拉在上海找到工作后，不得不搬家。"],["A real [estate] agent showed her a [property] that had been [vacant] for months. It was in a quiet [residential] [neighborhood].","一位房地产中介带她看了一处空置了好几个月的房产，位于一个安静的住宅小区。"],["The [landlord] wanted a new [tenant] quickly, so he offered a one-year [lease] and agreed to pay each [utility] bill.","房东想尽快找到新租客，于是提供了一年的租约，并同意支付各项水电费账单。"],["The flat was not [spacious]. In fact it was [cramped] and a little [shabby], but Sara liked it.","公寓并不宽敞，实际上很拥挤，还有点破旧，但萨拉喜欢。"],["She [furnished] it herself and put flowers on the [balcony].","她自己添置了家具，在阳台上摆了花。"],["Problems soon appeared. Water came into the [basement], and a pipe began to [leak].","问题很快出现了：地下室进了水，一根水管开始漏水。"],["The [plumbing] was old, and the landlord was slow with [maintenance].","管道系统很旧，房东维修又拖拉。"],["When Sara complained, he even tried to [evict] her.","萨拉投诉时，他甚至想把她赶走。"],["In the end the law was on her side.","最后法律站在了她这边。"]],"g":[["agent","中介"],["showed","带看"],["quiet","安静的"],["offered","提供"],["agreed","同意"],["bill","账单"],["flat","公寓"],["in fact","事实上"],["appeared","出现"],["pipe","管子"],["complained","投诉"],["law","法律"],["side","一边"]],"w":[["relocate","riˈloʊˌkeɪt","v. 搬迁，重新安置","relocate to another city","搬到另一个城市","re- + locate"],["estate","əˈsteɪt","n. 房地产；财产；庄园","real estate","房地产",""],["property","ˈprɑpərdi","n. 房产；财产；性质","private property","私人财产",""],["vacant","ˈveɪkənt","adj. 空着的；空缺的","a vacant room","空房间","名词 vacancy"],["residential","ˌrɛzəˈdɛn(t)ʃ(ə)l","adj. 住宅的","a residential area","住宅区","resident 居民"],["neighborhood","ˈneɪbərˌ(h)ʊd","n. 街区，邻近地区","a quiet neighborhood","安静的街区",""],["landlord","ˈlæn(d)ˌlɔrd","n. 房东","pay the landlord","付房租给房东",""],["tenant","ˈtɛnənt","n. 租客","a new tenant","新租客",""],["lease","lis","n. 租约 v. 租","sign a lease","签租约",""],["utility","juˈtɪlədi","n. 公用事业（水电气）；效用","utility bills","水电费账单",""],["spacious","ˈspeɪʃəs","adj. 宽敞的","a spacious room","宽敞的房间","space + -ious"],["cramped","kræm(p)t","adj. 狭窄拥挤的","a cramped flat","狭小的公寓",""],["shabby","ˈʃæbi","adj. 破旧的","a shabby coat","破旧的外套",""],["furnish","ˈfərnɪʃ","v. 布置家具；提供","a furnished flat","带家具的公寓","furniture 家具"],["balcony","ˈbælkəni","n. 阳台","on the balcony","在阳台上",""],["basement","ˈbeɪsm(ə)nt","n. 地下室","in the basement","在地下室","base + -ment"],["leak","lik","v./n. 漏；泄露","a pipe leaks","管子漏水","leak a secret 泄密"],["plumbing","ˈpləmɪŋ","n. 管道系统","fix the plumbing","修水管","plumber 水管工，b 不发音"],["maintenance","ˈmeɪnt(ə)nən(t)s","n. 维护，保养","car maintenance","汽车保养","动词 maintain"],["evict","əˈvɪk(t)","v. 驱逐（租客）","evict a tenant","赶走租客","名词 eviction"]]},{"t":"体育运动","e":"Sports","s":[["Liu is not a professional [athlete].","刘不是职业运动员。"],["He plays in an [amateur] football [league].","他在一个业余足球联赛踢球。"],["Last month his team reached the final of a city [tournament].","上个月，他的球队打进了一项城市锦标赛的决赛。"],["The [stadium] was full, and every [spectator] began to [cheer].","体育场座无虚席，每位观众都开始欢呼。"],["Their [opponent] had won three years in a row, so Liu's team was the [underdog].","对手已经连续三年夺冠，所以刘的球队是不被看好的一方。"],["The [referee] was strict and called every [foul].","裁判很严格，每个犯规都吹。"],["In the first half, Liu's team showed great [stamina].","上半场，刘的球队体力充沛。"],["He made one long [sprint] after another; he is small but [agile].","他一次次长距离冲刺；他个子小，但很敏捷。"],["In the second half, [endurance] decided the game.","下半场，耐力决定了比赛。"],["Despite an [injury] to their captain, they did not accept [defeat].","尽管队长受伤，他们没有接受失败。"],["One late goal brought [triumph].","最后时刻的一个进球带来了胜利。"],["They lifted the [trophy], then shook hands with the other team.","他们举起奖杯，然后和对方球队握手。"],["That, the coach said, is [sportsmanship].","教练说，这就是体育精神。"]],"g":[["professional","职业的"],["reached","进入"],["final","决赛"],["in a row","连续"],["strict","严格的"],["half","半场"],["decided","决定"],["despite","尽管"],["captain","队长"],["accept","接受"],["goal","进球"],["lifted","举起"],["shook hands","握手"],["coach","教练"]],"w":[["athlete","ˈæθ(ə)ˌlit","n. 运动员","a professional athlete","职业运动员","形容词 athletic"],["amateur","ˈæmədər","adj. 业余的 n. 业余爱好者","an amateur player","业余选手","反义 professional"],["league","liɡ","n. 联赛；联盟","a football league","足球联赛",""],["tournament","ˈtərnəmənt","n. 锦标赛","a tennis tournament","网球锦标赛",""],["stadium","ˈsteɪdiəm","n. 体育场","a football stadium","足球场",""],["spectator","ˈspɛkˌteɪdər","n. 观众","a crowd of spectators","一群观众","spect = 看；看电视的叫 viewer"],["cheer","tʃɪr","v./n. 欢呼，喝彩","cheer for the team","为球队加油","cheer up 振作起来"],["opponent","əˈpoʊnənt","n. 对手；反对者","beat an opponent","击败对手","oppose 反对"],["underdog","ˈəndərˌdɔɡ","n. 不被看好的一方，弱者","support the underdog","支持弱者",""],["referee","ˌrɛfəˈri","n. 裁判","a football referee","足球裁判",""],["foul","faʊl","n. 犯规 adj. 恶臭的；肮脏的","commit a foul","犯规","foul play 不正当行为"],["stamina","ˈstæmənə","n. 体力，耐力","have great stamina","体力充沛",""],["sprint","sprɪnt","n./v. 冲刺，短跑","a 100-metre sprint","百米短跑",""],["agile","ˈædʒəl","adj. 敏捷的","an agile player","敏捷的球员","名词 agility"],["endurance","ɪnˈdʊrən(t)s","n. 耐力，忍耐力","physical endurance","身体耐力","动词 endure"],["injury","ˈɪndʒ(ə)ri","n. 伤，损伤","a knee injury","膝伤","动词 injure"],["defeat","dəˈfit","n. 失败 v. 击败","accept defeat","接受失败",""],["triumph","ˈtraɪəmf","n. 胜利，巨大成功 v. 获胜","a great triumph","伟大的胜利","形容词 triumphant"],["trophy","ˈtroʊfi","n. 奖杯","win a trophy","赢得奖杯",""],["sportsmanship","ˈspɔrtsmənˌʃɪp","n. 体育精神","show good sportsmanship","展现体育精神",""]]},{"t":"文学","e":"Literature","s":[["At sixty, the [novelist] finally won a major [literary] prize.","六十岁时，这位小说家终于获得了一项重要的文学奖。"],["She had written [fiction] all her life, as well as one [memoir] and a [biography] of her teacher.","她一生都在写小说，还写过一本回忆录和一本关于她老师的传记。"],["Her first [draft] is always written by hand.","她的初稿总是手写的。"],["When the [manuscript] is finished, her [editor] reads it line by line.","手稿完成后，编辑逐行审读。"],["In her new book the [plot] is simple: the [protagonist], a village doctor, returns home after forty years.","在她的新书里，情节很简单：主人公是一位乡村医生，四十年后回到家乡。"],["The [narrative] moves slowly, but the [prose] is [vivid].","叙事节奏缓慢，但文笔生动。"],["Readers enjoy her gentle [irony] and her [satire] of small-town officials.","读者喜欢她温和的反讽，以及她对小镇官员的讽刺。"],["The story ends in [tragedy], yet fans are already asking for a [sequel].","故事以悲剧收场，但书迷已经在期待续集了。"],["She also writes [verse], and an [anthology] of her poems will appear next spring.","她也写诗，一本诗选将于明年春天出版。"],["An [excerpt] was printed in today's newspaper.","今天的报纸刊登了其中一段节选。"]],"g":[["finally","终于"],["major","重要的"],["prize","奖"],["as well as","以及"],["by hand","用手"],["finished","完成"],["line by line","逐行"],["returns","回到"],["gentle","温和的"],["officials","官员"],["fans","书迷"],["poems","诗"],["appear","出版"],["printed","刊登"]],"w":[["novelist","ˈnɑvələst","n. 小说家","a famous novelist","著名小说家","novel + -ist"],["literary","ˈlɪdəˌrɛri","adj. 文学的","a literary prize","文学奖","名词 literature"],["fiction","ˈfɪkʃən","n. 小说，虚构作品","science fiction","科幻小说","反义 non-fiction"],["memoir","ˈmɛmˌwɑr","n. 回忆录","write a memoir","写回忆录","和 memory 同源"],["biography","baɪˈɑɡrəfi","n. 传记","a biography of Lincoln","林肯传","bio- 生命 + graph 写"],["draft","dræft","n. 草稿 v. 起草","a first draft","初稿",""],["manuscript","ˈmænjəˌskrɪp(t)","n. 手稿","an unpublished manuscript","未出版的手稿","manu 手 + script 写"],["editor","ˈɛdədər","n. 编辑","a newspaper editor","报纸编辑","动词 edit"],["plot","plɑt","n. 情节；阴谋","the plot of the film","电影的情节",""],["protagonist","prəˈtæɡənəst","n. 主人公，主角","the female protagonist","女主角",""],["narrative","ˈnɛrədɪv","n. 叙事，叙述","a first-person narrative","第一人称叙事","动词 narrate"],["prose","proʊz","n. 散文","write in prose","用散文体写","和 verse 相对"],["vivid","ˈvɪvəd","adj. 生动的，鲜明的","a vivid description","生动的描写","viv = 活"],["irony","ˈaɪrəni","n. 反讽；讽刺意味","a touch of irony","一丝讽刺","形容词 ironic"],["satire","ˈsæˌtaɪ(ə)r","n. 讽刺（作品）","political satire","政治讽刺",""],["tragedy","ˈtrædʒədi","n. 悲剧","end in tragedy","以悲剧收场","反义 comedy"],["sequel","ˈsikwəl","n. 续集","a sequel to the film","电影续集","sequ = 跟随"],["verse","vərs","n. 诗，韵文；诗节","written in verse","用诗体写成",""],["anthology","ænˈθɑlədʒi","n. 选集","an anthology of poems","诗选",""],["excerpt","ˈɛkˌsərpt","n. 节选，摘录","an excerpt from a novel","小说节选",""]]}],[{"t":"历史","e":"History","s":[["The team studying [archaeology] began to [excavate] the hill in May.","考古队五月开始发掘这座小山。"],["Under the [ruins] of a wall they found a [relic]: a bronze cup.","在一堵墙的废墟下，他们发现了一件遗物：一只青铜杯。"],["It came from an [ancient] [civilization] that began as a small [tribe].","它来自一个古老的文明，这个文明最初只是一个小部落。"],["People here still call its founder their [ancestor].","这里的人至今仍称它的创建者为祖先。"],["The first [dynasty] lasted three hundred years.","第一个王朝延续了三百年。"],["Each [emperor] sat on a golden [throne], and the longest [reign] was sixty years.","每位皇帝都坐在金色的宝座上，最长的统治达六十年。"],["The [empire] grew as its armies [conquered] new [territory] and built a [colony] across the sea.","帝国随着军队征服新领土、在海外建立殖民地而扩张。"],["But it depended on [slavery].","但它依赖奴隶制。"],["A great [rebellion] finally [overthrew] the last ruler.","一场大起义最终推翻了最后一位统治者。"],["Today only a stone [monument] remains.","今天只剩下一座石碑。"]],"g":[["bronze","青铜"],["founder","创建者"],["lasted","持续"],["golden","金色的"],["armies","军队"],["depended on","依赖"],["ruler","统治者"],["remains","留存"]],"w":[["archaeology","ˌɑrkiˈɑlədʒi","n. 考古学","study archaeology","学考古","archaeologist 考古学家"],["excavate","ˈɛkskəˌveɪt","v. 发掘，挖掘","excavate a site","发掘遗址","ex- 向外 + cav 洞"],["ruins","ˈruɪnz","n. 废墟","the ruins of a temple","寺庙废墟","动词 ruin 毁坏"],["relic","ˈrɛlɪk","n. 遗物，遗迹","a cultural relic","文物",""],["ancient","ˈeɪn(t)ʃənt","adj. 古代的","ancient history","古代史","反义 modern"],["civilization","ˌsɪvələˈzeɪʃən","n. 文明","ancient civilization","古代文明","civil + -ize + -ation"],["tribe","traɪb","n. 部落","a native tribe","土著部落","形容词 tribal"],["ancestor","ˈænˌsɛstər","n. 祖先","worship ancestors","祭祖","反义 descendant"],["dynasty","ˈdaɪnəsti","n. 朝代，王朝","the Tang Dynasty","唐朝",""],["emperor","ˈɛmp(ə)rər","n. 皇帝","the last emperor","末代皇帝","empire 的统治者"],["throne","θroʊn","n. 王位，宝座","come to the throne","登基",""],["reign","reɪn","n./v. 统治（时期）","during his reign","在他统治期间","g 不发音，同 rain"],["empire","ˈɛmˌpaɪ(ə)r","n. 帝国","the Roman Empire","罗马帝国",""],["conquer","ˈkɑŋkər","v. 征服","conquer a country","征服一个国家","名词 conquest"],["territory","ˈtɛrəˌtɔri","n. 领土；领域","enemy territory","敌方领土","terr = 土地"],["colony","ˈkɑləni","n. 殖民地；群体","a former colony","前殖民地","形容词 colonial"],["slavery","ˈsleɪv(ə)ri","n. 奴隶制","abolish slavery","废除奴隶制","slave 奴隶"],["rebellion","rəˈbɛljən","n. 叛乱，起义","an armed rebellion","武装起义","动词 rebel"],["overthrow","ˌoʊvərˈθroʊ","v./n. 推翻","overthrow a government","推翻政府","over + throw"],["monument","ˈmɑnjəm(ə)nt","n. 纪念碑，历史遗迹","a national monument","国家纪念碑",""]]},{"t":"信仰与哲学","e":"Belief","s":[["What is the meaning of life?","生命的意义是什么？"],["[Philosophy] asks why our [existence] matters, and it seeks [wisdom] through reason.","哲学追问我们的存在为何重要，并通过理性寻求智慧。"],["[Religion] answers with [faith].","宗教则以信仰作答。"],["Each has its own [doctrine] and its [sacred] books.","每种宗教都有自己的教义和神圣的经书。"],["In the mountain [temple] near my town, a [monk] rises at four to [worship].","在我家乡附近山上的寺庙里，一位僧人四点起床做礼拜。"],["He [prays], then [meditates] for hours.","他祈祷，然后冥想几个小时。"],["He says the [spiritual] life frees the [soul], which is [eternal], while the body is [mortal].","他说精神生活能解放灵魂，灵魂是永恒的，而肉体终有一死。"],["My grandmother believes in [destiny] and in many a [superstition]; she tells me every old [myth].","我祖母相信命运，也相信许多迷信；她给我讲每一个古老的神话。"],["I live in a [secular] age, but I still listen.","我生活在一个世俗的时代，但我仍然愿意听。"]],"g":[["meaning","意义"],["matters","重要"],["seeks","寻求"],["reason","理性"],["rises","起床"],["frees","解放"],["believes in","相信"],["age","时代"]],"w":[["philosophy","fəˈlɑsəfi","n. 哲学","Chinese philosophy","中国哲学","philo 爱 + sophy 智慧"],["existence","ɪɡˈzɪst(ə)n(t)s","n. 存在","come into existence","开始存在","动词 exist"],["wisdom","ˈwɪzdəm","n. 智慧","words of wisdom","至理名言","形容词 wise"],["religion","rəˈlɪdʒ(ə)n","n. 宗教","freedom of religion","宗教自由","形容词 religious"],["faith","feɪθ","n. 信仰；信任","have faith in","对…有信心","形容词 faithful"],["doctrine","ˈdɑktrən","n. 教义，学说","religious doctrine","宗教教义",""],["sacred","ˈseɪkrəd","adj. 神圣的","a sacred place","圣地",""],["temple","ˈtɛmp(ə)l","n. 寺庙","a Buddhist temple","佛寺",""],["monk","məŋk","n. 僧侣","a Buddhist monk","和尚","女性叫 nun"],["worship","ˈwərʃəp","v./n. 崇拜，做礼拜","worship God","敬拜上帝",""],["pray","preɪ","v. 祈祷","pray for peace","祈求和平","名词 prayer"],["meditate","ˈmɛdəˌteɪt","v. 冥想，沉思","meditate daily","每天冥想","名词 meditation"],["spiritual","ˈspɪrətʃ(əw)əl","adj. 精神的，心灵的","spiritual life","精神生活","名词 spirit"],["soul","soʊl","n. 灵魂","body and soul","身心",""],["eternal","əˈtərn(ə)l","adj. 永恒的","eternal life","永生","名词 eternity"],["mortal","ˈmɔrdl","adj. 终有一死的；致命的","all men are mortal","人皆有一死","mort = 死；反义 immortal"],["destiny","ˈdɛstəni","n. 命运","control one's destiny","掌握命运","近义 fate"],["superstition","ˌsupərˈstɪʃən","n. 迷信","an old superstition","古老的迷信","形容词 superstitious"],["myth","mɪθ","n. 神话；错误观念","Greek myths","希腊神话",""],["secular","ˈsɛkjələr","adj. 世俗的，非宗教的","secular education","世俗教育",""]]},{"t":"战争与和平","e":"War","s":[["In spring the [military] of a larger state [invaded] its small neighbor.","春天，一个大国的军队入侵了它的小邻国。"],["Thousands of [troops] crossed the border with heavy [weapons].","成千上万的部队携带重型武器越过边境。"],["A [missile] hit the power station, and a [bomb] destroyed a bridge.","一枚导弹击中了发电站，一颗炸弹炸毁了一座桥。"],["Every [civilian] who could [flee] became a [refugee].","凡是能逃的平民都成了难民。"],["The capital was under [siege] for a month.","首都被围困了一个月。"],["Soldiers defended an old [fortress], and the [combat] was fierce.","士兵们守卫着一座古老的堡垒，战斗十分激烈。"],["Many suffered a serious [wound].","许多人受了重伤。"],["The enemy would not [retreat], and the city refused to [surrender].","敌人不肯撤退，这座城市也拒绝投降。"],["At last a powerful [ally] demanded a [ceasefire].","最后，一个强大的盟国要求停火。"],["A peace [treaty] was signed in autumn.","秋天签署了和平条约。"],["Years later, a [veteran] wrote: modern [warfare] has no winners.","多年后，一位老兵写道：现代战争没有赢家。"]],"g":[["state","国家"],["neighbor","邻国"],["crossed","越过"],["border","边境"],["power station","发电站"],["destroyed","摧毁"],["capital","首都"],["soldiers","士兵"],["defended","守卫"],["fierce","激烈的"],["suffered","遭受"],["enemy","敌人"],["refused","拒绝"],["demanded","要求"],["signed","签署"]],"w":[["military","ˈmɪləˌtɛri","n. 军队 adj. 军事的","military service","兵役",""],["invade","ɪnˈveɪd","v. 入侵","invade a country","入侵一个国家","名词 invasion"],["troop","trup","n. 部队，军队","send troops","派兵","常用复数"],["weapon","ˈwɛpən","n. 武器","nuclear weapons","核武器",""],["missile","ˈmɪs(ə)l","n. 导弹","launch a missile","发射导弹",""],["bomb","bɑm","n. 炸弹 v. 轰炸","a time bomb","定时炸弹","b 不发音"],["civilian","səˈvɪljən","n. 平民 adj. 民用的","civilian casualties","平民伤亡",""],["flee","fli","v. 逃跑，逃离","flee the country","逃离该国","flee – fled – fled"],["refugee","ˌrɛfjəˈdʒi","n. 难民","a refugee camp","难民营","refuge 避难所"],["siege","si(d)ʒ","n. 围困，包围","under siege","被围困",""],["fortress","ˈfɔrtrəs","n. 堡垒，要塞","a stone fortress","石头堡垒","fort = 强"],["combat","ˈkɑmˌbæt","n./v. 战斗；防止","combat crime","打击犯罪",""],["wound","wɪnd","n. 伤口 v. 使受伤","a gunshot wound","枪伤","多指武器造成的伤"],["retreat","rəˈtrit","v./n. 撤退","retreat from the city","从城里撤退","re- 回"],["surrender","səˈrɛndər","v./n. 投降；放弃","surrender to the enemy","向敌人投降",""],["ally","ˈæˌlaɪ","n. 盟友，同盟国 v. 结盟","a close ally","亲密盟友","名词 alliance"],["ceasefire","ˈsisˌfaɪ(ə)r","n. 停火","agree to a ceasefire","同意停火","cease 停止 + fire"],["treaty","ˈtridi","n. 条约","sign a treaty","签署条约",""],["veteran","ˈvɛdərən","n. 老兵；老手","a war veteran","退伍老兵",""],["warfare","ˈwɔrˌfɛr","n. 战争，作战","modern warfare","现代战争",""]]},{"t":"犯罪与侦查","e":"Crime","s":[["A [burglary] was reported on Monday.","星期一有人报了一起入室盗窃案。"],["The [theft] of a painting shocked the museum.","一幅画被盗，震惊了博物馆。"],["A [detective] came to [investigate].","一名侦探前来调查。"],["The first [clue] was a [fingerprint] on the window, and the [forensic] team found a hair.","第一条线索是窗户上的一枚指纹，法医小组还找到了一根头发。"],["A [witness] had seen a tall man at midnight.","一名目击者午夜时看到过一个高个子男人。"],["The main [suspect] was a guard, but he had an [alibi] and no clear [motive].","主要嫌疑人是一名保安，但他有不在场证明，也没有明显的动机。"],["Then police [arrested] an art dealer and [detained] him for two days.","随后警方逮捕了一名画商，拘留了两天。"],["He finally [confessed]: it was insurance [fraud], and he had paid a [bribe] to the guard.","他最终招供：这是一起保险诈骗，他还向保安行了贿。"],["The [jury] needed only an hour to [convict] him.","陪审团只用了一个小时就判他有罪。"],["He was [imprisoned] for five years, without [bail].","他被判入狱五年，不得保释。"]],"g":[["reported","报案"],["painting","画"],["shocked","使震惊"],["museum","博物馆"],["hair","头发"],["midnight","午夜"],["guard","保安"],["police","警方"],["art dealer","画商"],["insurance","保险"]],"w":[["burglary","ˈbərɡləri","n. 入室盗窃","commit burglary","入室盗窃","burglar 窃贼"],["theft","θɛft","n. 偷窃","car theft","偷车","thief 小偷"],["detective","dəˈtɛktɪv","n. 侦探","a private detective","私家侦探","动词 detect"],["investigate","ɪnˈvɛstəˌɡeɪt","v. 调查","investigate a case","调查案件","名词 investigation"],["clue","klu","n. 线索","look for clues","寻找线索","have no clue 一无所知"],["fingerprint","ˈfɪŋɡərˌprɪnt","n. 指纹","leave fingerprints","留下指纹",""],["forensic","fəˈrɛnzɪk","adj. 法医的","forensic evidence","法医证据",""],["witness","ˈwɪtnəs","n. 目击者 v. 目睹","an eye witness","目击证人",""],["suspect","ˈsəsˌpɛk(t)","n. 嫌疑人 v. 怀疑","the main suspect","主要嫌疑人","形容词 suspicious"],["alibi","ˈæləˌbaɪ","n. 不在场证明","have an alibi","有不在场证明",""],["motive","ˈmoʊdɪv","n. 动机","a motive for the crime","犯罪动机",""],["arrest","əˈrɛst","v./n. 逮捕","be arrested for theft","因盗窃被捕","under arrest 被捕"],["detain","dəˈteɪn","v. 拘留；耽搁","detain a suspect","拘留嫌疑人","名词 detention"],["confess","kənˈfɛs","v. 坦白，承认","confess to a crime","认罪","名词 confession"],["fraud","frɔd","n. 诈骗","credit card fraud","信用卡诈骗",""],["bribe","braɪb","n. 贿赂 v. 行贿","take a bribe","受贿","名词 bribery"],["jury","ˈdʒʊri","n. 陪审团","the jury's verdict","陪审团的裁决",""],["convict","kənˈvɪkt","v. 判…有罪","be convicted of murder","被判谋杀罪","名词 conviction"],["imprison","ɪmˈprɪz(ə)n","v. 监禁","be imprisoned for life","被终身监禁","im- + prison"],["bail","beɪl","n. 保释（金）","be released on bail","被保释",""]]},{"t":"基因与生物","e":"Biology","s":[["Under a [microscope], a drop of water is a busy world.","在显微镜下，一滴水就是一个繁忙的世界。"],["Each [cell] is a tiny living [organism].","每个细胞都是一个微小的活的有机体。"],["Some [bacteria] help us; a [virus] or a [parasite] can make us ill.","有些细菌对我们有益，而病毒或寄生虫会让我们生病。"],["Inside the cell, each [gene] carries [genetic] information on a [chromosome].","在细胞内部，每个基因在染色体上携带遗传信息。"],["A small [mutation] may drive [evolution] and, over time, create a new [species].","一个小小的突变可能推动进化，久而久之产生新物种。"],["Scientists can now [clone] a sheep from one cell, grow an [embryo] in the lab, and repair damaged [tissue].","科学家如今能用一个细胞克隆出一只羊，在实验室里培育胚胎，修复受损的组织。"],["One day a new [organ] may be grown for a [transplant].","有一天，或许能培育出新的器官用于移植。"],["Meanwhile a [vaccine] prevents disease, an [antibiotic] kills bacteria, and one changed [protein] can save a life.","与此同时，疫苗能预防疾病，抗生素能杀死细菌，一种被改变的蛋白质就能挽救一条生命。"]],"g":[["drop","滴"],["tiny","微小的"],["living","活的"],["ill","生病的"],["carries","携带"],["information","信息"],["drive","推动"],["create","产生"],["sheep","羊"],["lab","实验室"],["repair","修复"],["damaged","受损的"],["prevents","预防"],["disease","疾病"]],"w":[["microscope","ˈmaɪkrəˌskoʊp","n. 显微镜","under a microscope","在显微镜下","micro- 微小 + scope 看"],["cell","sɛl","n. 细胞；牢房；电池","blood cells","血细胞",""],["organism","ˈɔrɡəˌnɪzəm","n. 有机体，生物","a living organism","活的生物体",""],["bacteria","bækˈtɪriə","n. 细菌（复数）","harmful bacteria","有害细菌","单数 bacterium"],["virus","ˈvaɪrəs","n. 病毒","a computer virus","电脑病毒",""],["parasite","ˈpɛrəˌsaɪt","n. 寄生虫","a parasite in the body","体内寄生虫",""],["gene","dʒin","n. 基因","a human gene","人类基因",""],["genetic","dʒəˈnɛdɪk","adj. 基因的，遗传的","genetic engineering","基因工程","名词 genetics"],["chromosome","ˈkroʊməˌsoʊm","n. 染色体","the X chromosome","X 染色体",""],["mutation","mjuˈteɪʃən","n. 突变","a gene mutation","基因突变","动词 mutate"],["evolution","ˌɛvəˈluʃən","n. 进化；演变","the theory of evolution","进化论","动词 evolve"],["species","ˈspiʃiz","n. 物种","endangered species","濒危物种","单复数同形"],["clone","kloʊn","v./n. 克隆","clone an animal","克隆动物",""],["embryo","ˈɛmbriˌoʊ","n. 胚胎","a human embryo","人类胚胎",""],["tissue","ˈtɪʃu","n.（生物）组织；纸巾","muscle tissue","肌肉组织",""],["organ","ˈɔrɡ(ə)n","n. 器官；风琴","organ donation","器官捐献",""],["transplant","ˈtræn(t)sˌplænt","n./v. 移植","a heart transplant","心脏移植","trans- 转移 + plant"],["vaccine","vækˈsin","n. 疫苗","a flu vaccine","流感疫苗","动词 vaccinate"],["antibiotic","ˌæn(t)iˌbaɪˈɑdɪk","n. 抗生素","take antibiotics","服用抗生素","anti- 抗 + bio 生命"],["protein","ˈproʊˌtin","n. 蛋白质","high in protein","富含蛋白质",""]]},{"t":"情感","e":"Emotions","s":[["Old photos fill me with [affection] and [gratitude].","老照片让我心里充满爱意和感激。"],["I remember the [delight] of summer, the [thrill] of my first bike, my [awe] at the sea.","我记得夏天的快乐，第一辆自行车带来的兴奋，面对大海时的敬畏。"],["This [nostalgia] is a sweet [longing].","这种怀旧是一种甜蜜的思念。"],["Other feelings are harder.","另一些情感则更难面对。"],["As a boy I felt [envy] of my clever brother; I was [jealous] and began to [resent] him.","小时候我嫉妒聪明的哥哥，心怀妒意，开始怨恨他。"],["I treated him with [contempt], and once, in a [rage], I broke his model plane.","我对他不屑一顾，有一次在盛怒之下弄坏了他的飞机模型。"],["I still remember my [dread] that night, my [panic] when Father came home, and then the [guilt].","我至今记得那晚的恐惧，父亲回家时的惊慌，以及之后的内疚。"],["My [remorse] lasted for years.","我的悔恨持续了多年。"],["When Father died, our [grief] brought us together.","父亲去世时，悲痛让我们走到一起。"],["We [mourned] him side by side.","我们并肩哀悼他。"],["In my [despair], it was my brother who [consoled] me.","在我绝望的时候，安慰我的正是哥哥。"]],"g":[["fill","充满"],["feelings","情感"],["clever","聪明的"],["treated","对待"],["model plane","飞机模型"],["lasted","持续"],["brought together","使团聚"],["side by side","并肩"]],"w":[["affection","əˈfɛkʃən","n. 喜爱，感情","show affection","表达爱意","形容词 affectionate"],["gratitude","ˈɡrædəˌtud","n. 感激","express gratitude","表达感激","形容词 grateful"],["delight","dəˈlaɪt","n. 高兴，乐事 v. 使高兴","with delight","高兴地","形容词 delighted"],["thrill","θrɪl","n. 兴奋，激动 v. 使兴奋","the thrill of winning","获胜的兴奋","thriller 惊悚片"],["awe","ɔ","n. 敬畏","in awe of","敬畏…","awesome 原义：令人敬畏的"],["nostalgia","nəˈstældʒə","n. 怀旧，乡愁","feel nostalgia for","怀念…","形容词 nostalgic"],["longing","ˈlɔŋɪŋ","n. 渴望，思念","a longing for home","对家的思念","动词 long for"],["envy","ˈɛnvi","n./v. 羡慕，嫉妒","be full of envy","满怀嫉妒","形容词 envious"],["jealous","ˈdʒɛləs","adj. 嫉妒的","be jealous of","嫉妒…","名词 jealousy"],["resent","rəˈzɛnt","v. 怨恨，愤恨","resent being treated unfairly","怨恨受到不公对待","名词 resentment"],["contempt","kənˈtɛm(p)t","n. 轻蔑，蔑视","hold sb in contempt","蔑视某人",""],["rage","reɪdʒ","n. 狂怒 v. 发怒","fly into a rage","勃然大怒",""],["dread","drɛd","n./v. 恐惧，害怕","dread the exam","害怕考试","形容词 dreadful"],["panic","ˈpænɪk","n./v. 恐慌","in a panic","惊慌失措","过去式 panicked"],["guilt","ɡɪlt","n. 内疚；有罪","a sense of guilt","内疚感","形容词 guilty"],["remorse","rəˈmɔrs","n. 悔恨","feel remorse for","为…悔恨",""],["grief","ɡrif","n. 悲痛","be overcome with grief","悲痛欲绝","动词 grieve"],["mourn","mɔrn","v. 哀悼","mourn the dead","哀悼逝者",""],["despair","dəˈspɛr","n./v. 绝望","in despair","绝望地","形容词 desperate"],["console","kənˈsoʊl","v. 安慰","console a friend","安慰朋友","名词 consolation"]]},{"t":"时间","e":"Time","s":[["Our project [schedule] is strict, and the manager is always [punctual].","我们的项目日程很严格，经理总是很准时。"],["[Prior] to the launch, nothing may be [postponed].","在发布之前，任何事都不得推迟。"],["One report is already [overdue].","有一份报告已经逾期。"],["A [temporary] worker wrote an [interim] version; the [permanent] staff will finish it.","一名临时工写了一个过渡版本，正式员工会把它完成。"],["The [duration] of the test is six weeks, a short [span].","测试时长六周，时间跨度很短。"],["Data are recorded at an [interval] of ten minutes.","数据每隔十分钟记录一次。"],["After an hour has [elapsed], the system saves the [sequence] in [chronological] order.","一小时过去后，系统按时间顺序保存这一序列。"],["Two tests cannot be [simultaneous]; each [subsequent] test waits for the last.","两项测试不能同时进行，每项后续测试都要等上一项结束。"],["A deadline is [imminent], and the [forthcoming] review worries everyone.","截止日期迫在眉睫，即将到来的评审让每个人都担心。"],["It is an [annual] event, yet the stress feels [perpetual].","这是一年一度的事，可压力感觉永无止境。"]],"g":[["project","项目"],["strict","严格的"],["manager","经理"],["launch","发布"],["report","报告"],["version","版本"],["staff","员工"],["recorded","记录"],["system","系统"],["saves","保存"],["order","顺序"],["review","评审"],["worries","使担心"],["event","事件"],["stress","压力"]],"w":[["schedule","ˈskɛˌdʒul","n. 日程，时间表 v. 安排","ahead of schedule","提前","behind schedule 落后于计划"],["punctual","ˈpəŋ(k)(t)ʃ(əw)əl","adj. 准时的","be punctual for class","准时上课","名词 punctuality"],["prior","ˈpraɪ(ə)r","adj. 先前的；优先的","prior to","在…之前","名词 priority"],["postpone","ˌpoʊs(t)ˈpoʊn","v. 推迟","postpone a meeting","推迟会议","post- 后 + pone 放"],["overdue","ˌoʊvərˈdu","adj. 逾期的","an overdue bill","逾期账单","over + due"],["temporary","ˈtɛmpəˌrɛri","adj. 临时的","a temporary job","临时工作","tempor = 时间"],["interim","ˈɪn(t)ərəm","adj. 临时的，过渡的 n. 过渡期","an interim report","中期报告","in the interim 在此期间"],["permanent","ˈpərm(ə)nənt","adj. 永久的","a permanent job","固定工作","反义 temporary"],["duration","dʊˈreɪʃən","n. 持续时间","for the duration of","在…整个期间","dur = 持续"],["span","spæn","n. 时间跨度；范围 v. 跨越","a life span","寿命","attention span 注意力持续时间"],["interval","ˈɪn(t)ərv(ə)l","n. 间隔","at regular intervals","每隔一段时间",""],["elapse","əˈlæps","v.（时间）流逝","three years elapsed","三年过去了",""],["sequence","ˈsikwən(t)s","n. 顺序；一系列","in sequence","按顺序","sequ = 跟随"],["chronological","ˌkrɑnəˈlɑdʒək(ə)l","adj. 按时间顺序的","in chronological order","按时间顺序","chron = 时间"],["simultaneous","ˌsaɪməlˈteɪniəs","adj. 同时的","simultaneous interpretation","同声传译","副词 simultaneously"],["subsequent","ˈsəbsəkwənt","adj. 随后的","subsequent events","后来的事","sub- + sequ 跟随"],["imminent","ˈɪmənənt","adj. 即将发生的","imminent danger","迫在眉睫的危险","别混 eminent 杰出的"],["forthcoming","ˌfɔrθˈkəmɪŋ","adj. 即将到来的","the forthcoming election","即将举行的选举",""],["annual","ˈænj(əw)əl","adj. 每年的，年度的","annual income","年收入","ann = 年"],["perpetual","pərˈpɛtʃ(əw)əl","adj. 永久的，没完没了的","perpetual noise","没完没了的噪音",""]]},{"t":"程度与评价","e":"Degree","s":[["The new policy brought [substantial] change.","新政策带来了重大变化。"],["A [considerable] number of jobs were created, at [tremendous] cost.","创造了相当多的就业岗位，代价也是巨大的。"],["The budget was [immense], and the plan covered a [vast] area.","预算十分庞大，计划覆盖了广阔的地区。"],["Its effect on small towns was [profound].","它对小城镇的影响是深远的。"],["Experts agree that timing is [crucial] and public support is [vital].","专家一致认为，时机至关重要，公众支持必不可少。"],["There was [ample] money but not [adequate] planning.","资金很充裕，但规划不够充分。"],["Is the funding [sufficient]?","拨款够用吗？"],["Some call it [excessive].","有人说它过多了。"],["Growth so far is [moderate], and the gain for farmers is [marginal].","到目前为止增长是适度的，农民的收益微乎其微。"],["In some villages the change is [minimal], even [negligible].","在一些村庄，变化极小，甚至可以忽略不计。"],["Critics say these are not [trivial] problems, and that the study behind the plan was [superficial].","批评者说这些并不是琐碎的问题，而且计划背后的研究很肤浅。"],["They want [drastic] action; a few demand [radical] reform.","他们希望采取严厉的行动，少数人要求进行彻底的改革。"]],"g":[["policy","政策"],["created","创造"],["cost","代价"],["budget","预算"],["covered","覆盖"],["effect","影响"],["experts","专家"],["timing","时机"],["support","支持"],["funding","拨款"],["growth","增长"],["gain","收益"],["critics","批评者"],["action","行动"],["reform","改革"]],"w":[["substantial","ˌsəbˈstæn(t)ʃəl","adj. 大量的，重大的","a substantial amount","相当大的数量","substance 物质"],["considerable","kənˈsɪd(ə)rəb(ə)l","adj. 相当大的","a considerable distance","相当远的距离","别混 considerate 体贴的"],["tremendous","trəˈmɛndəs","adj. 巨大的；极好的","a tremendous effort","巨大的努力",""],["immense","ɪˈmɛn(t)s","adj. 巨大的","immense pressure","巨大的压力",""],["vast","væst","adj. 广阔的，大量的","the vast majority","绝大多数",""],["profound","prəˈfaʊnd","adj. 深远的，深刻的","a profound effect","深远的影响",""],["crucial","ˈkruʃ(ə)l","adj. 至关重要的","a crucial decision","关键的决定",""],["vital","ˈvaɪd(ə)l","adj. 极其重要的；有活力的","play a vital role","起重要作用","vit = 生命"],["ample","ˈæmp(ə)l","adj. 充足的","ample time","充足的时间",""],["adequate","ˈædəkwət","adj. 足够的，适当的","adequate food","足够的食物","反义 inadequate"],["sufficient","səˈfɪʃənt","adj. 足够的","sufficient evidence","充分的证据","反义 insufficient"],["excessive","ɪkˈsɛsɪv","adj. 过多的","excessive drinking","过量饮酒","名词 excess"],["moderate","ˈmɑd(ə)rət","adj. 适度的，中等的","moderate exercise","适度锻炼",""],["marginal","ˈmɑrdʒənəl","adj. 微小的；边缘的","a marginal improvement","微小的改善","margin 边缘"],["minimal","ˈmɪnəm(ə)l","adj. 极小的，最低限度的","minimal cost","最低成本","minimum 的形容词"],["negligible","ˈnɛɡlədʒəb(ə)l","adj. 可以忽略的","a negligible risk","微不足道的风险","neglect 忽视"],["trivial","ˈtrɪviəl","adj. 琐碎的","trivial matters","琐事",""],["superficial","ˌsupərˈfɪʃəl","adj. 肤浅的，表面的","a superficial understanding","肤浅的理解","super- 上 + face"],["drastic","ˈdræstɪk","adj. 严厉的，剧烈的","take drastic measures","采取严厉措施",""],["radical","ˈrædək(ə)l","adj. 彻底的，激进的","radical changes","彻底的变革","rad = 根"]]},{"t":"原因与结果","e":"Cause","s":[["Why do students burn out?","学生为什么会精疲力竭？"],["Stress is one [factor], but the [underlying] cause is deeper.","压力是一个因素，但根本原因更深。"],["Some experts [attribute] it to exams.","有些专家把它归因于考试。"],["Others say it [stems] from fear of failure.","另一些人说它源于对失败的恐惧。"],["Much pressure [derives] from family hopes.","很多压力来自家庭的期望。"],["A bad grade can [trigger] anxiety, and harsh words [provoke] anger.","一次糟糕的成绩会引发焦虑，严厉的话会激起愤怒。"],["Lack of sleep may [induce] illness.","缺觉可能诱发疾病。"],["The [consequence] is serious, and a poor [outcome] seems [inevitable].","后果很严重，糟糕的结局似乎不可避免。"],["Yet schools can help.","不过学校可以帮忙。"],["Small classes [facilitate] discussion; sports [enhance] mood; clubs [foster] friendship; praise can [boost] confidence.","小班教学便于讨论，运动能改善情绪，社团能促进友谊，表扬能增强自信。"],["Noise and phones [hinder] study, long hours [impede] rest, and constant ranking will [undermine] trust.","噪音和手机妨碍学习，长时间学习妨碍休息，不停地排名会破坏信任。"],["Blame only [aggravates] the problem. Kindness can [mitigate] it.","责备只会使问题恶化，善意能缓解它。"]],"g":[["burn out","精疲力竭"],["stress","压力"],["failure","失败"],["pressure","压力"],["grade","成绩"],["harsh","严厉的"],["anger","愤怒"],["lack","缺乏"],["illness","疾病"],["discussion","讨论"],["mood","情绪"],["praise","表扬"],["confidence","自信"],["constant","不停的"],["ranking","排名"],["trust","信任"],["blame","责备"],["kindness","善意"]],"w":[["factor","ˈfæktər","n. 因素","a key factor","关键因素",""],["underlying","ˌəndərˈlaɪɪŋ","adj. 根本的，潜在的","the underlying cause","根本原因",""],["attribute","əˈtrɪˌbjut","v. 把…归因于 n. 属性","attribute success to luck","把成功归因于运气","固定搭配 to"],["stem","stɛm","v. 起源于 n. 茎","stem from","源于",""],["derive","dəˈraɪv","v. 源于；获得","derive from","源自","derive pleasure from 从…获得乐趣"],["trigger","ˈtrɪɡər","v. 引发 n. 扳机","trigger a crisis","引发危机",""],["provoke","prəˈvoʊk","v. 激起，挑衅","provoke anger","激起愤怒","形容词 provocative"],["induce","ɪnˈdus","v. 诱发；劝诱","induce sleep","催眠",""],["consequence","ˈkɑn(t)səkwən(t)s","n. 后果","as a consequence","因此",""],["outcome","ˈaʊtˌkəm","n. 结果","the final outcome","最终结果","come out 的名词"],["inevitable","ɪnˈɛvɪdəb(ə)l","adj. 不可避免的","an inevitable result","必然的结果",""],["facilitate","fəˈsɪləˌteɪt","v. 促进，使便利","facilitate learning","促进学习","facility 设施"],["enhance","ɪnˈhæn(t)s","v. 提高，增强","enhance quality","提高质量",""],["foster","ˈfɔstər","v. 培养，促进；收养","foster creativity","培养创造力",""],["boost","bust","v./n. 提升，促进","boost sales","促进销售",""],["hinder","ˈhɪndər","v. 阻碍","hinder progress","阻碍进步","名词 hindrance"],["impede","ɪmˈpid","v. 妨碍","impede traffic","妨碍交通","ped = 脚"],["undermine","ˌəndərˈmaɪn","v. 逐渐削弱，破坏","undermine confidence","削弱信心","under + mine 挖"],["aggravate","ˈæɡrəˌveɪt","v. 使恶化；激怒","aggravate the situation","使情况恶化",""],["mitigate","ˈmɪdəˌɡeɪt","v. 减轻，缓和","mitigate the damage","减轻损害",""]]},{"t":"大学生活","e":"Campus","s":[["On his first day on [campus], Wei carried his bags to the [dormitory].","到校园的第一天，伟把行李搬进了宿舍。"],["Like every [freshman], he was nervous.","和每个新生一样，他很紧张。"],["The [faculty] of engineering is large, and the [dean] gave a welcome speech.","工程学院很大，院长致了欢迎辞。"],["In the first [semester] he has a [lecture] each morning and a small [tutorial] twice a week.","第一学期他每天上午有一堂大课，每周有两次小班辅导课。"],["He chose music as an [elective], but physics is a [prerequisite] for later courses.","他选了音乐作选修课，但物理是后续课程的先修课。"],["Each [assignment] counts, and [attendance] is checked.","每次作业都计分，还要查出勤。"],["Grades go on his [transcript].","成绩会记在成绩单上。"],["After his [bachelor] degree, he hopes to become a [postgraduate], and perhaps earn a [doctorate].","拿到学士学位后，他希望读研究生，也许再拿个博士学位。"],["That means writing a long [dissertation] under a [mentor], learning to [cite] sources correctly, and winning a [fellowship] to pay for it.","那意味着要在导师指导下写一篇长长的学位论文，学会正确引用资料，还要争取到一份研究奖学金来支付费用。"]],"g":[["carried","搬"],["bags","行李"],["nervous","紧张的"],["engineering","工程"],["welcome speech","欢迎辞"],["physics","物理"],["courses","课程"],["counts","计分"],["grades","成绩"],["degree","学位"],["earn","获得"],["sources","资料"],["correctly","正确地"]],"w":[["campus","ˈkæmpəs","n. 校园","on campus","在校园里",""],["dormitory","ˈdɔrməˌtɔri","n. 宿舍","a student dormitory","学生宿舍","口语 dorm"],["freshman","ˈfrɛʃmən","n. 大一新生","a college freshman","大学新生",""],["faculty","ˈfæk(ə)lti","n. 院系；全体教员；能力","the faculty of law","法学院",""],["dean","din","n. 院长，系主任","the dean of the college","学院院长",""],["semester","səˈmɛstər","n. 学期","the spring semester","春季学期","英式 term"],["lecture","ˈlɛk(t)ʃər","n. 讲座，课 v. 讲课","give a lecture","讲课","lecturer 讲师"],["tutorial","tuˈtɔriəl","n. 辅导课；教程","a weekly tutorial","每周辅导课","tutor 导师"],["elective","əˈlɛktɪv","n. 选修课 adj. 选修的","an elective course","选修课","elect 选"],["prerequisite","priˈrɛkwəzət","n. 先决条件，先修课","a prerequisite for the course","该课程的先修条件","pre- + require"],["assignment","əˈsaɪnmənt","n. 作业；任务","hand in an assignment","交作业","动词 assign"],["attendance","əˈtɛnd(ə)n(t)s","n. 出勤，出席","class attendance","上课出勤","动词 attend"],["transcript","ˈtrænzˌkrɪpt","n. 成绩单；文字记录","an academic transcript","成绩单","trans- + script 写"],["bachelor","ˈbætʃ(ə)lər","n. 学士；单身汉","a bachelor's degree","学士学位",""],["postgraduate","ˌpoʊs(t)ˈɡrædʒəwət","n. 研究生 adj. 研究生的","a postgraduate student","研究生","post- 后 + graduate"],["doctorate","ˈdɑkt(ə)rət","n. 博士学位","earn a doctorate","获得博士学位",""],["dissertation","ˌdɪsərˈteɪʃən","n. 学位论文","a doctoral dissertation","博士论文",""],["mentor","ˈmɛnˌtɔr","n. 导师，指导者","a wise mentor","睿智的导师",""],["cite","saɪt","v. 引用","cite a source","引用资料","名词 citation"],["fellowship","ˈfɛloʊˌʃɪp","n. 研究奖学金；友谊","win a fellowship","获得研究奖学金",""]]},{"t":"人体","e":"Body","s":[["The human [skeleton] has 206 bones.","人体骨骼有 206 块骨头。"],["The [skull] protects the brain, the [spine] holds us upright, and each [rib] guards the chest.","颅骨保护大脑，脊柱让我们直立，每根肋骨都护着胸腔。"],["Every [limb] bends at a [joint] and is moved by [muscle].","每条肢体在关节处弯曲，由肌肉带动。"],["A [nerve] carries signals in an instant; a [reflex] needs no thought.","神经瞬间传递信号，反射动作不需要思考。"],["The [lung] takes in oxygen.","肺吸入氧气。"],["The [liver] cleans the blood, and each [kidney] removes waste.","肝脏净化血液，每个肾脏排出废物。"],["An [artery] carries blood from the heart; a [vein] brings it back.","动脉把血液从心脏送出，静脉把它带回来。"],["A doctor feels your [pulse] to check your [circulation].","医生通过摸脉搏来检查你的血液循环。"],["Pain in the [abdomen] should not be ignored.","腹部疼痛不应被忽视。"],["Good [posture] protects the back, [sweat] cools the skin, and exercise strengthens the [respiratory] system.","良好的姿势保护背部，汗水给皮肤降温，锻炼能增强呼吸系统。"]],"g":[["bones","骨头"],["protects","保护"],["brain","大脑"],["upright","直立的"],["guards","护卫"],["chest","胸腔"],["bends","弯曲"],["signals","信号"],["instant","瞬间"],["oxygen","氧气"],["removes","排出"],["waste","废物"],["heart","心脏"],["pain","疼痛"],["ignored","忽视"],["cools","使凉爽"],["skin","皮肤"],["strengthens","增强"]],"w":[["skeleton","ˈskɛlətn","n. 骨骼；骨架","a human skeleton","人体骨骼",""],["skull","skəl","n. 颅骨，头骨","a broken skull","头骨骨折",""],["spine","spaɪn","n. 脊柱","a spine injury","脊柱损伤","形容词 spinal"],["rib","rɪb","n. 肋骨","a broken rib","肋骨骨折",""],["limb","lɪm","n. 肢体；大树枝","an artificial limb","假肢","b 不发音"],["joint","dʒɔɪnt","n. 关节 adj. 联合的","knee joint","膝关节","joint venture 合资企业"],["muscle","ˈməs(ə)l","n. 肌肉","build muscle","增肌","c 不发音"],["nerve","nərv","n. 神经；勇气","nerve cells","神经细胞","形容词 nervous"],["reflex","ˈriˌflɛks","n. 反射（动作）","quick reflexes","反应快",""],["lung","ləŋ","n. 肺","lung cancer","肺癌",""],["liver","ˈlɪvər","n. 肝脏","liver disease","肝病",""],["kidney","ˈkɪdni","n. 肾脏","kidney failure","肾衰竭",""],["artery","ˈɑrdəri","n. 动脉；干线","a blocked artery","动脉阻塞",""],["vein","veɪn","n. 静脉；纹理","a blood vein","静脉血管",""],["pulse","pəls","n. 脉搏","take one's pulse","量脉搏",""],["circulation","ˌsərkjəˈleɪʃən","n. 循环；流通；发行量","blood circulation","血液循环","动词 circulate"],["abdomen","ˈæbdəmən","n. 腹部","pain in the abdomen","腹痛",""],["posture","ˈpɑstʃər","n. 姿势","good posture","良好的姿势",""],["sweat","swɛt","n. 汗 v. 出汗","wipe off the sweat","擦汗",""],["respiratory","ˈrɛsp(ə)rəˌtɔri","adj. 呼吸的","respiratory disease","呼吸道疾病","spir = 呼吸"]]},{"t":"疾病与治疗","e":"Illness","s":[["The village [clinic] has one [physician] and a small [ward].","村里的诊所有一名医生和一间小病房。"],["An [ambulance] comes from the city when needed.","需要时，救护车从城里赶来。"],["Most patients have a common problem: an [allergy], [asthma], or [diabetes].","大多数病人得的是常见病：过敏、哮喘或糖尿病。"],["Last year the doctor found a [tumor] early and saved a life; another man survived a [stroke].","去年医生及早发现了一个肿瘤，救了一条命；另一个人中风后活了下来。"],["In winter, [pneumonia] and lung [inflammation] are frequent.","冬天，肺炎和肺部炎症很常见。"],["Flu is [contagious], so during an [outbreak] sick people stay in [quarantine] at home, and everyone is taught basic [hygiene].","流感有传染性，所以疫情暴发期间病人要在家隔离，人人都要学基本的卫生知识。"],["The doctor explains each [dose] carefully: one [pill] twice a day, or an [injection] once a week.","医生会仔细说明每次的剂量：一天两次、每次一片，或者每周打一针。"],["The [pharmacy] is next door.","药房就在隔壁。"],["With rest, she says, [recovery] is usually quick.","她说，只要休息好，康复通常很快。"]],"g":[["patients","病人"],["common","常见的"],["saved","挽救"],["survived","活下来"],["frequent","常见的"],["flu","流感"],["basic","基本的"],["explains","解释"],["carefully","仔细地"],["next door","隔壁"],["rest","休息"]],"w":[["clinic","ˈklɪnɪk","n. 诊所","a dental clinic","牙科诊所","形容词 clinical 临床的"],["physician","fəˈzɪʃən","n. 内科医生，医生","a family physician","家庭医生","别混 physicist 物理学家"],["ward","wɔrd","n. 病房","a children's ward","儿科病房",""],["ambulance","ˈæmbjələn(t)s","n. 救护车","call an ambulance","叫救护车",""],["allergy","ˈælərdʒi","n. 过敏","a food allergy","食物过敏","be allergic to"],["asthma","ˈæzmə","n. 哮喘","an asthma attack","哮喘发作","th 不发音"],["diabetes","ˌdaɪəˈbidiz","n. 糖尿病","type 2 diabetes","二型糖尿病",""],["tumor","ˈtumər","n. 肿瘤","a brain tumor","脑瘤","英式 tumour"],["stroke","stroʊk","n. 中风；一击；笔画","suffer a stroke","中风",""],["pneumonia","nuˈmoʊnjə","n. 肺炎","catch pneumonia","得肺炎","p 不发音"],["inflammation","ˌɪnfləˈmeɪʃən","n. 炎症","reduce inflammation","消炎","flame 火焰"],["contagious","kənˈteɪdʒəs","adj. 接触传染的","a contagious disease","传染病","近义 infectious"],["outbreak","ˈaʊtˌbreɪk","n. 爆发","an outbreak of flu","流感爆发","break out 的名词"],["quarantine","ˈkwɔrənˌtin","n./v. 隔离检疫","in quarantine","被隔离",""],["hygiene","ˈhaɪˌdʒin","n. 卫生","personal hygiene","个人卫生","形容词 hygienic"],["dose","doʊs","n. 剂量，一剂","a high dose","大剂量",""],["pill","pɪl","n. 药丸，药片","take a pill","吃药","sleeping pill 安眠药"],["injection","ɪnˈdʒɛkʃən","n. 注射","give an injection","打针","动词 inject"],["pharmacy","ˈfɑrməsi","n. 药房；药学","a hospital pharmacy","医院药房","pharmacist 药剂师"],["recovery","rəˈkəv(ə)ri","n. 康复；恢复","make a full recovery","完全康复","动词 recover"]]},{"t":"建筑","e":"Architecture","s":[["The [architect] spread a [blueprint] on the table.","建筑师把蓝图铺在桌上。"],["To [construct] a library on soft ground, she said, we need a deep [foundation] of [concrete] and [steel].","她说，要在松软的地面上建造一座图书馆，我们需要用混凝土和钢材打一个很深的地基。"],["The roof will be [timber], the walls red [brick], and the floor white [marble].","屋顶用木材，墙用红砖，地面用白色大理石。"],["At the entrance, each stone [pillar] supports an [arch], and a glass [dome] lets in light.","在入口处，每根石柱支撑着一道拱门，玻璃穹顶让光线透进来。"],["The [facade] is simple.","建筑正面很简洁。"],["The [interior] is warm, while the [exterior] matches the old street.","内部温暖，外部则与老街相协调。"],["A long [corridor] leads to a spiral [staircase].","一条长走廊通向螺旋楼梯。"],["She loves [symmetry] and [durable] materials.","她喜欢对称和耐用的材料。"],["“Do not [demolish] the old gate,” she added. “Build around it.”","她补充说：“不要拆掉那座旧门，围着它建。”"]],"g":[["spread","铺开"],["library","图书馆"],["soft","松软的"],["ground","地面"],["roof","屋顶"],["floor","地面"],["entrance","入口"],["supports","支撑"],["lets in","让…进入"],["matches","与…相配"],["leads to","通向"],["spiral","螺旋的"],["materials","材料"],["gate","大门"]],"w":[["architect","ˈɑrkəˌtɛk(t)","n. 建筑师","a famous architect","著名建筑师","名词 architecture 建筑学"],["blueprint","ˈbluˌprɪnt","n. 蓝图","a blueprint for reform","改革蓝图","blue + print"],["construct","kənˈstrək(t)","v. 建造；构建","construct a bridge","建桥","名词 construction"],["foundation","faʊnˈdeɪʃən","n. 地基；基础；基金会","lay a foundation","打基础","动词 found 创立"],["concrete","ˈkɑnˌkrit","n. 混凝土 adj. 具体的","a concrete wall","混凝土墙","反义 abstract"],["steel","stil","n. 钢","stainless steel","不锈钢","别混 steal 偷"],["timber","ˈtɪmbər","n. 木材","a timber house","木屋",""],["brick","brɪk","n. 砖","a brick wall","砖墙",""],["marble","ˈmɑrbəl","n. 大理石；弹珠","a marble floor","大理石地板",""],["pillar","ˈpɪlər","n. 柱子；支柱","a stone pillar","石柱",""],["arch","ɑrtʃ","n. 拱门，拱形 v. 拱起","a stone arch","石拱门",""],["dome","doʊm","n. 圆屋顶，穹顶","a glass dome","玻璃穹顶",""],["facade","fəˈsɑd","n. 建筑物正面；表象","the facade of a building","建筑物正面","来自法语，c 读 s"],["interior","ɪnˈtɪriər","n. 内部 adj. 内部的","interior design","室内设计",""],["exterior","ɪkˈstɪriər","n. 外部 adj. 外部的","the exterior of a house","房子外部",""],["corridor","ˈkɔrədər","n. 走廊","at the end of the corridor","在走廊尽头",""],["staircase","ˈstɛrˌkeɪs","n. 楼梯","a spiral staircase","螺旋楼梯","stair + case"],["symmetry","ˈsɪmətri","n. 对称","perfect symmetry","完美对称","sym- 共同 + metr 测量"],["durable","ˈdʊrəb(ə)l","adj. 耐用的","durable goods","耐用品","dur = 持续"],["demolish","dəˈmɑlɪʃ","v. 拆除；推翻","demolish a building","拆除建筑","名词 demolition"]]},{"t":"自然地理","e":"Geography","s":[["Asia is the largest [continent].","亚洲是最大的洲。"],["Most of it lies in the northern [hemisphere], far from the [equator], and its climate changes with [latitude].","它大部分位于北半球，远离赤道，气候随纬度而变化。"],["The [terrain] is varied.","地形多种多样。"],["In the west, a high [plateau] rises; its highest [summit] is covered with snow.","西部耸立着一片高原，最高峰被积雪覆盖。"],["Along each [ridge], a [cliff] drops into a deep [canyon].","沿着每道山脊，悬崖直落进深深的峡谷。"],["Rivers run through a green [valley] into a wide [basin], and form a [delta] before the sea.","河流穿过绿色的山谷，流入宽阔的盆地，入海前形成三角洲。"],["There is [swamp] in the south and [prairie] in the north.","南方有沼泽，北方有大草原。"],["In the [desert], life gathers around each [oasis].","在沙漠里，生命聚集在每一片绿洲周围。"],["A long [peninsula] reaches into the ocean; a narrow [strait] separates it from an island with a coral [reef].","一个长长的半岛伸入大洋，一道狭窄的海峡把它和一座有珊瑚礁的岛屿隔开。"]],"g":[["lies","位于"],["northern","北方的"],["climate","气候"],["varied","多样的"],["rises","耸立"],["covered","覆盖"],["drops","落下"],["run through","流过"],["wide","宽阔的"],["form","形成"],["gathers","聚集"],["reaches","延伸"],["narrow","狭窄的"],["separates","分隔"],["island","岛"],["coral","珊瑚"]],"w":[["continent","ˈkɑnt(ə)nənt","n. 大陆，洲","the Asian continent","亚洲大陆","形容词 continental"],["hemisphere","ˈhɛməˌsfɪr","n. 半球","the southern hemisphere","南半球","hemi- 半 + sphere 球"],["equator","əˈkweɪdər","n. 赤道","near the equator","靠近赤道","equ = 相等"],["latitude","ˈlædəˌtud","n. 纬度","at high latitude","在高纬度","经度 longitude"],["terrain","təˈreɪn","n. 地形","rough terrain","崎岖的地形","terr = 土地"],["plateau","plæˈtoʊ","n. 高原；停滞期","the Tibetan Plateau","青藏高原","来自法语"],["summit","ˈsəmət","n. 山顶；峰会","reach the summit","登顶","a summit meeting 峰会"],["ridge","rɪdʒ","n. 山脊","a mountain ridge","山脊",""],["cliff","klɪf","n. 悬崖","a steep cliff","陡峭的悬崖",""],["canyon","ˈkænjən","n. 峡谷","the Grand Canyon","大峡谷",""],["valley","ˈvæli","n. 山谷；流域","a river valley","河谷",""],["basin","ˈbeɪsn","n. 盆地；盆","the Sichuan Basin","四川盆地",""],["delta","ˈdɛltə","n. 三角洲","the Yangtze River Delta","长江三角洲",""],["swamp","swɑmp","n. 沼泽 v. 使应接不暇","a tropical swamp","热带沼泽","be swamped with work 忙不过来"],["prairie","ˈprɛri","n. 大草原","the open prairie","开阔的草原",""],["desert","ˈdɛzərt","n. 沙漠 v. 抛弃","the Sahara Desert","撒哈拉沙漠","别混 dessert 甜点"],["oasis","oʊˈeɪsəs","n. 绿洲","an oasis in the desert","沙漠绿洲","复数 oases"],["peninsula","pəˈnɪn(t)s(ə)lə","n. 半岛","the Korean Peninsula","朝鲜半岛","pen 几乎 + insula 岛"],["strait","streɪt","n. 海峡","the Taiwan Strait","台湾海峡","别混 straight"],["reef","rif","n. 礁","a coral reef","珊瑚礁",""]]},{"t":"野生动植物","e":"Wildlife","s":[["The park protects [wildlife] of every kind: a large [mammal] like the elephant, a [reptile] like the crocodile, and every tiny [insect].","这座公园保护着各种野生动物：大象这样的大型哺乳动物，鳄鱼这样的爬行动物，以及每一种微小的昆虫。"],["A lion is a [predator]; a zebra is its [prey].","狮子是捕食者，斑马是它的猎物。"],["Zebras move in a [herd], birds in a [flock].","斑马成群活动，鸟儿成群飞行。"],["In spring, birds build a [nest], eggs [hatch], and many animals [breed].","春天，鸟儿筑巢，蛋孵化，许多动物繁殖。"],["In autumn some birds [migrate] south, while bears [hibernate].","秋天，一些鸟向南迁徙，熊则冬眠。"],["Many animals use [camouflage]: white [fur] in snow, a brown [feather] among leaves.","许多动物会伪装：雪地里的白色皮毛，落叶间的棕色羽毛。"],["A sharp [claw] is for hunting.","锋利的爪子是用来捕猎的。"],["When [vegetation] is rich, life is easy.","植被茂盛时，生活很容易。"],["After rain, each [shrub] turns green and flowers [bloom] across the plain.","雨后，每丛灌木都变绿了，鲜花开遍平原。"]],"g":[["protects","保护"],["elephant","大象"],["crocodile","鳄鱼"],["tiny","微小的"],["lion","狮子"],["zebra","斑马"],["bears","熊"],["among","在…之中"],["leaves","树叶"],["sharp","锋利的"],["hunting","捕猎"],["rich","茂盛的"],["plain","平原"]],"w":[["wildlife","ˈwaɪl(d)ˌlaɪf","n. 野生动物","protect wildlife","保护野生动物","wild + life"],["mammal","ˈmæməl","n. 哺乳动物","a marine mammal","海洋哺乳动物",""],["reptile","ˈrɛptl","n. 爬行动物","a cold-blooded reptile","冷血爬行动物",""],["insect","ˈɪnˌsɛk(t)","n. 昆虫","an insect bite","虫咬",""],["predator","ˈprɛdədər","n. 捕食者","a natural predator","天敌",""],["prey","preɪ","n. 猎物 v. 捕食","hunt for prey","捕猎","读音同 pray"],["herd","hərd","n. 兽群 v. 放牧","a herd of cattle","一群牛",""],["flock","flɑk","n.（鸟、羊）群 v. 聚集","a flock of birds","一群鸟",""],["nest","nɛst","n. 巢，窝 v. 筑巢","build a nest","筑巢",""],["hatch","hætʃ","v. 孵化；策划","eggs hatch","蛋孵化",""],["breed","brid","v. 繁殖；饲养 n. 品种","breed in spring","在春天繁殖","breed – bred – bred"],["migrate","ˈmaɪˌɡreɪt","v. 迁徙，移居","migrate south","向南迁徙","名词 migration"],["hibernate","ˈhaɪbərˌneɪt","v. 冬眠","bears hibernate","熊冬眠","名词 hibernation"],["camouflage","ˈkæməˌflɑ(d)ʒ","n./v. 伪装","use camouflage","使用伪装","来自法语"],["fur","fər","n. 毛皮","a fur coat","皮草大衣",""],["feather","ˈfɛðər","n. 羽毛","as light as a feather","轻如鸿毛",""],["claw","klɔ","n. 爪","sharp claws","利爪",""],["vegetation","ˌvɛdʒəˈteɪʃən","n. 植被","thick vegetation","茂密的植被",""],["shrub","ʃrəb","n. 灌木","a flowering shrub","开花的灌木",""],["bloom","blum","v. 开花 n. 花","flowers bloom","花开","in full bloom 盛开"]]}],[{"t":"数学与数字","e":"Math","s":[["Numbers hide in everything.","数字藏在一切事物里。"],["A phone number has eleven [digits].","电话号码有十一位数字。"],["A price like 3.5 has a [decimal] point; half is a [fraction]; a discount is a [percentage].","像 3.5 这样的价格有小数点；一半是一个分数；折扣是一个百分比。"],["A recipe uses a [ratio] of rice to water, and the right [proportion] matters.","菜谱里用到米和水的比率，比例合适很重要。"],["To find the [sum], you add.","求总和要相加。"],["You [multiply] to find an area and [subtract] to find the change.","求面积要相乘，算找零要相减。"],["An [equation] has two equal sides, and a [formula] saves time.","方程有相等的两边，公式能节省时间。"],["Before you [calculate] exactly, [estimate] first: an [approximate] answer catches mistakes.","精确计算之前先估算：一个近似的答案能发现错误。"],["Weather reports give the [probability] of rain.","天气预报会给出下雨的概率。"],["In [geometry], we measure each [angle], the [diameter] of a circle, and [parallel] lines.","在几何学里，我们测量每个角、圆的直径和平行线。"],["Space has three [dimensions].","空间有三个维度。"]],"g":[["hide","藏"],["price","价格"],["point","点"],["discount","折扣"],["recipe","菜谱"],["matters","重要"],["add","相加"],["area","面积"],["change","找零"],["equal","相等的"],["exactly","精确地"],["mistakes","错误"],["measure","测量"],["circle","圆"],["space","空间"]],"w":[["digit","ˈdɪdʒət","n. 数字（0–9）","a six-digit number","六位数","形容词 digital"],["decimal","ˈdɛs(ə)məl","adj. 小数的，十进制的 n. 小数","a decimal point","小数点","dec = 十"],["fraction","ˈfrækʃən","n. 分数；小部分","a fraction of the cost","成本的一小部分","fract = 破碎"],["percentage","pərˈsɛn(t)ɪdʒ","n. 百分比","a high percentage","高比例","percent + -age"],["ratio","ˈreɪʃ(i)oʊ","n. 比率","the ratio of men to women","男女比例",""],["proportion","prəˈpɔrʃən","n. 比例；部分","in proportion to","与…成比例",""],["sum","səm","n. 总和；金额 v. 总结","the sum of 2 and 3","2 与 3 之和","sum up 总结"],["multiply","ˈməltəˌplaɪ","v. 乘；成倍增加","multiply 3 by 4","3 乘以 4","名词 multiplication"],["subtract","səbˈtræk(t)","v. 减去","subtract 2 from 5","5 减 2","sub- 下 + tract 拉"],["equation","əˈkweɪʒən","n. 方程，等式","solve an equation","解方程","equ = 相等"],["formula","ˈfɔrmjələ","n. 公式；配方","a math formula","数学公式","复数 formulas / formulae"],["calculate","ˈkælkjəˌleɪt","v. 计算","calculate the cost","计算成本","calculator 计算器"],["estimate","ˈɛstəˌmeɪt","v./n. 估计","a rough estimate","粗略估计",""],["approximate","əˈprɑksəˌmeɪt","adj. 大约的 v. 接近","an approximate number","大概的数字","副词 approximately"],["probability","ˌprɑbəˈbɪlədi","n. 概率，可能性","a high probability","可能性很大","形容词 probable"],["geometry","dʒiˈɑmətri","n. 几何学","plane geometry","平面几何","geo 地 + metr 测量"],["angle","ˈæŋɡ(ə)l","n. 角；角度","a right angle","直角","from a new angle 从新角度"],["diameter","daɪˈæmədər","n. 直径","10 cm in diameter","直径 10 厘米","半径 radius"],["parallel","ˈpɛrəˌlɛl","adj. 平行的 n. 相似之处","parallel lines","平行线",""],["dimension","dəˈmɛn(t)ʃən","n. 维度；尺寸；方面","three dimensions","三维","3D 的 D"]]},{"t":"物理与化学","e":"Science","s":[["In the school [laboratory], our teacher explained matter.","在学校实验室里，老师给我们讲解物质。"],["Everything is made of [atoms].","万物都由原子构成。"],["Atoms join to form a [molecule].","原子结合形成分子。"],["Inside the atom are smaller [particles], such as the [electron].","原子内部还有更小的粒子，比如电子。"],["Gold is an [element]; water is a [compound] of [oxygen] and [hydrogen].","金是一种元素；水是氧和氢的化合物。"],["We tested an [acid] and watched salt [dissolve].","我们测试了一种酸，观察盐溶解。"],["When a [liquid] is heated, it turns to [vapor], and gas [expands].","液体受热会变成蒸汽，气体会膨胀。"],["Then we studied forces.","接着我们学习了力。"],["[Friction] slows a moving car.","摩擦力让行驶的汽车慢下来。"],["A [magnet] attracts iron.","磁铁吸引铁。"],["We built a simple [circuit] and measured its [voltage].","我们搭了一个简单的电路，测量了它的电压。"],["Finally, light: black cloth [absorbs] it, and a mirror [reflects] it.","最后是光：黑布吸收光，镜子反射光。"]],"g":[["explained","讲解"],["matter","物质"],["join","结合"],["form","形成"],["gold","金"],["tested","测试"],["salt","盐"],["heated","加热"],["gas","气体"],["forces","力"],["slows","使变慢"],["attracts","吸引"],["iron","铁"],["measured","测量"],["cloth","布"],["mirror","镜子"]],"w":[["laboratory","ˈlæbrəˌtɔri","n. 实验室","a research laboratory","研究实验室","口语 lab"],["atom","ˈædəm","n. 原子","a hydrogen atom","氢原子","形容词 atomic"],["molecule","ˈmɑləˌkjul","n. 分子","a water molecule","水分子","形容词 molecular"],["particle","ˈpɑrdək(ə)l","n. 粒子，微粒","dust particles","灰尘颗粒",""],["electron","əˈlɛkˌtrɑn","n. 电子","a free electron","自由电子","形容词 electronic"],["element","ˈɛləmənt","n. 元素；要素","a chemical element","化学元素","形容词 elementary 基础的"],["compound","ˈkɑmˌpaʊnd","n. 化合物 adj. 复合的","a chemical compound","化合物",""],["oxygen","ˈɑksədʒ(ə)n","n. 氧气","lack of oxygen","缺氧",""],["hydrogen","ˈhaɪdrədʒ(ə)n","n. 氢","hydrogen energy","氢能","hydro = 水"],["acid","ˈæsəd","n. 酸 adj. 酸性的","acid rain","酸雨",""],["dissolve","dəˈzɔlv","v. 溶解；解散","dissolve in water","溶于水",""],["liquid","ˈlɪkwəd","n. 液体 adj. 液态的","a clear liquid","透明的液体","固体 solid"],["vapor","ˈveɪpər","n. 蒸汽","water vapor","水蒸气","英式 vapour"],["expand","ɪkˈspænd","v. 膨胀；扩大","expand the business","扩大业务","名词 expansion"],["friction","ˈfrɪkʃən","n. 摩擦（力）；矛盾","reduce friction","减少摩擦",""],["magnet","ˈmæɡnət","n. 磁铁","a strong magnet","强磁铁","形容词 magnetic"],["circuit","ˈsərkət","n. 电路；环形路线","an electric circuit","电路","circ = 圆"],["voltage","ˈvoʊltɪdʒ","n. 电压","high voltage","高压","volt 伏特"],["absorb","əbˈzɔrb","v. 吸收；吸引","absorb water","吸水","be absorbed in 专心于"],["reflect","rəˈflɛk(t)","v. 反射；反映；思考","reflect light","反光","名词 reflection"]]},{"t":"工业制造","e":"Manufacturing","s":[["The factory [manufactures] bicycles.","这家工厂制造自行车。"],["[Raw] materials arrive from each [supplier] on Monday.","原材料每周一从各供应商处运来。"],["Every [component] is checked before workers [assemble] it.","每个零部件都要先检查，工人再进行组装。"],["New [machinery] has replaced old [mechanical] tools, and the [equipment] runs day and night.","新的机器设备取代了旧的机械工具，这些设备日夜运转。"],["The plant's [capacity] is 500 bikes a day, but real [output] is lower.","工厂的产能是每天 500 辆，但实际产量要低一些。"],["To raise [productivity], managers study each [batch].","为了提高生产率，经理们研究每一批产品。"],["Workers [inspect] every frame; a single [defect] means the bike fails the [specification].","工人检查每一个车架；只要有一处缺陷，这辆车就不符合规格。"],["Finished bikes go to the [warehouse].","成品车进入仓库。"],["Software tracks the [inventory], and the [logistics] team plans each [shipment].","软件跟踪库存，物流团队安排每一批货的发运。"],["This month the export [quota] is already full.","这个月的出口配额已经用完了。"]],"g":[["factory","工厂"],["materials","材料"],["arrive","运到"],["checked","检查"],["replaced","取代"],["tools","工具"],["plant","工厂"],["raise","提高"],["managers","经理"],["frame","车架"],["single","单个的"],["fails","不符合"],["finished","完成的"],["tracks","跟踪"],["export","出口"]],"w":[["manufacture","ˌmæn(j)əˈfæk(t)ʃər","v./n. 制造","manufacture cars","制造汽车","manu 手 + fact 做"],["raw","rɔ","adj. 生的；未加工的","raw materials","原材料",""],["supplier","səˈplaɪ(ə)r","n. 供应商","a parts supplier","零件供应商","动词 supply"],["component","kəmˈpoʊnənt","n. 零部件；组成部分","electronic components","电子元件",""],["assemble","əˈsɛmb(ə)l","v. 组装；集合","assemble a car","组装汽车","assembly line 流水线"],["machinery","məˈʃin(ə)ri","n. 机器（总称）","farm machinery","农业机械","不可数"],["mechanical","məˈkænək(ə)l","adj. 机械的","a mechanical problem","机械故障","mechanic 机修工"],["equipment","əˈkwɪpmənt","n. 设备","office equipment","办公设备","不可数"],["capacity","kəˈpæsədi","n. 容量；产能；能力","at full capacity","满负荷",""],["output","ˈaʊtˌpʊt","n. 产量；输出","annual output","年产量","反义 input"],["productivity","ˌprɑdəkˈtɪvədi","n. 生产率","raise productivity","提高生产率","productive 高产的"],["batch","bætʃ","n. 一批","a batch of goods","一批货",""],["inspect","ɪnˈspɛk(t)","v. 检查，视察","inspect the goods","检验货物","in- + spect 看"],["defect","ˈdifɛk(t)","n. 缺陷","a design defect","设计缺陷","形容词 defective"],["specification","ˌspɛsəfəˈkeɪʃən","n. 规格，明细","meet the specifications","符合规格","specify 详细说明"],["warehouse","ˈwɛrˌhaʊs","n. 仓库","a storage warehouse","储物仓库","ware 货物 + house"],["inventory","ˈɪnvənˌtɔri","n. 库存；清单","keep an inventory","保持库存",""],["logistics","ləˈdʒɪstɪks","n. 物流；后勤","a logistics company","物流公司",""],["shipment","ˈʃɪpmənt","n. 一批货物；装运","a shipment of goods","一批货","ship + -ment"],["quota","ˈkwoʊdə","n. 配额，定额","an import quota","进口配额",""]]},{"t":"劳动与就业","e":"Labor","s":[["Choosing an [occupation] is hard.","选择职业很难。"],["Some want a [profession] like law; others prefer [vocational] training.","有人想从事法律这样的专业工作，另一些人更喜欢职业培训。"],["Every [applicant] sends a [resume] when a [vacancy] appears.","一有职位空缺，每个求职者都会寄去简历。"],["A new worker starts on [probation] and then signs a [contract].","新员工先经过试用期，然后签合同。"],["The monthly [wage] may come with a [bonus] and a housing [allowance].","月工资之外可能还有奖金和住房补贴。"],["[Overtime] is paid extra, and the night [shift] pays more.","加班另外付钱，夜班的报酬更高。"],["If conditions are bad, the [union] may call a [strike].","如果工作条件差，工会可能号召罢工。"],["A company cannot [dismiss] staff without reason, but in hard times some become [redundant].","公司不能无故解雇员工，但在困难时期，有些人会被裁员。"],["Many young people now work [freelance], buy their own [insurance], and wonder when they can [retire].","现在许多年轻人做自由职业，自己买保险，不知道什么时候才能退休。"]],"g":[["prefer","更喜欢"],["training","培训"],["appears","出现"],["signs","签"],["monthly","每月的"],["housing","住房"],["extra","额外的"],["conditions","条件"],["staff","员工"],["reason","理由"],["wonder","想知道"]],"w":[["occupation","ˌɑkjəˈpeɪʃən","n. 职业；占领","a dangerous occupation","危险的职业","动词 occupy"],["profession","prəˈfɛʃən","n.（需专业知识的）职业","the medical profession","医疗行业","professional 专业的"],["vocational","voʊˈkeɪʃ(ə)nəl","adj. 职业的","vocational school","职业学校","名词 vocation"],["applicant","ˈæplək(ə)nt","n. 申请人","a job applicant","求职者","动词 apply"],["resume","rəˈzum","n. 简历 v. 重新开始","send a resume","投简历","作动词重音在后"],["vacancy","ˈveɪkən(t)si","n. 空缺职位；空房","fill a vacancy","填补空缺","形容词 vacant"],["probation","proʊˈbeɪʃən","n. 试用期；缓刑","on probation","在试用期",""],["contract","ˈkɑnˌtræk(t)","n. 合同 v. 收缩；感染","sign a contract","签合同",""],["wage","weɪdʒ","n. 工资（按时或周计）","the minimum wage","最低工资","月薪 salary"],["bonus","ˈboʊnəs","n. 奖金","a year-end bonus","年终奖",""],["allowance","əˈlaʊən(t)s","n. 津贴；零花钱","a housing allowance","住房补贴","动词 allow"],["overtime","ˈoʊvərˌtaɪm","n. 加班 adv. 加班地","work overtime","加班",""],["shift","ʃɪft","n. 轮班；转变 v. 转移","the night shift","夜班",""],["union","ˈjunjən","n. 工会；联合","a trade union","工会",""],["strike","straɪk","n. 罢工 v. 罢工；打击","go on strike","举行罢工","strike – struck – struck"],["dismiss","dəˈsmɪs","v. 解雇；不予理会","dismiss an employee","解雇员工","名词 dismissal"],["redundant","rəˈdənd(ə)nt","adj. 被裁员的；多余的","be made redundant","被裁员",""],["freelance","ˈfriˌlæn(t)s","adj. 自由职业的 v. 做自由职业","a freelance writer","自由撰稿人",""],["insurance","ɪnˈʃʊrən(t)s","n. 保险","health insurance","医疗保险","动词 insure"],["retire","rəˈtaɪ(ə)r","v. 退休","retire at sixty","六十岁退休","名词 retirement"]]},{"t":"国际关系","e":"Diplomacy","s":[["The [embassy] was busy all week.","大使馆整个星期都很忙。"],["The [ambassador] received a special [envoy] and a trade [delegation].","大使接待了一位特使和一个贸易代表团。"],["Following [protocol], they met in the great hall.","按照礼宾规程，他们在大厅会面。"],["The two countries have strong [bilateral] ties but no military [alliance]; ours stays [neutral].","两国有牢固的双边关系，但没有军事同盟；我国保持中立。"],["A [border] [dispute] in the region had raised [tension], and a [crisis] seemed near.","该地区的一场边界争端加剧了紧张局势，危机似乎近在眼前。"],["Our government offered to [mediate] but refused to [intervene] with force.","我国政府提出进行调解，但拒绝武力干预。"],["At the UN, a [resolution] was proposed; one member used its [veto], and others would not [ratify] it.","在联合国，有人提出了一项决议；一个成员国行使了否决权，其他国家也不愿批准。"],["Meanwhile, [humanitarian] [aid] reached the camps, and many families asked for [asylum].","与此同时，人道主义援助运抵营地，许多家庭申请庇护。"]],"g":[["received","接待"],["special","特别的"],["trade","贸易"],["following","按照"],["ties","关系"],["region","地区"],["raised","加剧"],["offered","提出"],["refused","拒绝"],["force","武力"],["member","成员"],["reached","到达"],["camps","营地"]],"w":[["embassy","ˈɛmbəsi","n. 大使馆","the Chinese embassy","中国大使馆",""],["ambassador","æmˈbæsədər","n. 大使","the ambassador to France","驻法大使",""],["envoy","ˈɛnˌvɔɪ","n. 使者，特使","a special envoy","特使",""],["delegation","ˌdɛləˈɡeɪʃən","n. 代表团；委派","a trade delegation","贸易代表团","delegate 代表"],["protocol","ˈproʊdəˌkɔl","n. 礼仪；协议","diplomatic protocol","外交礼仪",""],["bilateral","ˌbaɪˈlædərəl","adj. 双边的","bilateral talks","双边会谈","bi- 二 + later 边"],["alliance","əˈlaɪən(t)s","n. 联盟","form an alliance","结盟","ally 盟友"],["neutral","ˈnutr(ə)l","adj. 中立的；中性的","remain neutral","保持中立",""],["border","ˈbɔrdər","n. 边界 v. 接壤","cross the border","越过边界",""],["dispute","dəˈspjut","n./v. 争端，争论","settle a dispute","解决争端",""],["tension","ˈtɛnʃən","n. 紧张（局势）","ease tension","缓和紧张","形容词 tense"],["crisis","ˈkraɪsəs","n. 危机","an economic crisis","经济危机","复数 crises"],["mediate","ˈmidiˌeɪt","v. 调解","mediate a dispute","调解争端","medi = 中间"],["intervene","ˌɪn(t)ərˈvin","v. 干预，介入","intervene in a conflict","干预冲突","名词 intervention"],["resolution","ˌrɛzəˈluʃən","n. 决议；决心；解决","pass a resolution","通过决议","动词 resolve"],["veto","ˈvidoʊ","n./v. 否决","use a veto","行使否决权",""],["ratify","ˈrædəˌfaɪ","v. 正式批准","ratify a treaty","批准条约",""],["humanitarian","hjuˌmænəˈtɛriən","adj. 人道主义的","humanitarian aid","人道主义援助","human + -itarian"],["aid","eɪd","n./v. 援助","foreign aid","外国援助","first aid 急救"],["asylum","əˈsaɪləm","n. 庇护","seek asylum","寻求庇护",""]]},{"t":"选举与公民","e":"Election","s":[["Our country is a [republic] with a [federal] system.","我们国家是一个实行联邦制的共和国。"],["[Parliament] makes laws; the prime [minister] leads the [cabinet].","议会制定法律；总理领导内阁。"],["Every city chooses its own [mayor].","每个城市选出自己的市长。"],["Before an [election], each party [nominates] its candidates.","选举前，各党派提名候选人。"],["On the day, I mark my [ballot] and [vote] in a school hall.","选举当天，我在一所学校的礼堂里填写选票并投票。"],["An early [poll] showed no clear [majority].","早期的民调显示没有明显的多数。"],["The [opposition] won, saying it had a [mandate] for change.","反对党获胜，称自己获得了推动变革的授权。"],["The new leader will be [inaugurated] next month.","新领导人将于下月就职。"],["But [civic] life is more than voting.","但公民生活不只是投票。"],["People sign a [petition], [protest] in the square, or join a [rally].","人们在请愿书上签名，在广场上抗议，或参加集会。"],["My sister, an [activist], says democracy needs noise.","我姐姐是一名活动人士，她说民主需要声音。"]],"g":[["system","制度"],["laws","法律"],["leads","领导"],["party","党派"],["candidates","候选人"],["mark","填写"],["hall","礼堂"],["early","早期的"],["leader","领导人"],["sign","签名"],["square","广场"],["join","参加"],["democracy","民主"],["noise","声音"]],"w":[["republic","rəˈpəblɪk","n. 共和国","the People's Republic of China","中华人民共和国",""],["federal","ˈfɛd(ə)rəl","adj. 联邦的","the federal government","联邦政府",""],["parliament","ˈpɑrləm(ə)nt","n. 议会","a member of parliament","议员","i 不发音"],["minister","ˈmɪnəstər","n. 部长；牧师","the prime minister","总理，首相","ministry 部"],["cabinet","ˈkæb(ə)nət","n. 内阁；橱柜","a cabinet meeting","内阁会议",""],["mayor","ˈmeɪ(ə)r","n. 市长","the mayor of London","伦敦市长",""],["election","əˈlɛkʃən","n. 选举","a general election","大选","动词 elect"],["nominate","ˈnɑməˌneɪt","v. 提名","nominate a candidate","提名候选人","nomin = 名字"],["ballot","ˈbælət","n. 选票；投票","a secret ballot","无记名投票",""],["vote","voʊt","v./n. 投票","vote for a candidate","投票给候选人","voter 选民"],["poll","poʊl","n. 民意调查；投票","an opinion poll","民意调查",""],["majority","məˈdʒɔrədi","n. 大多数","the vast majority","绝大多数","反义 minority"],["opposition","ˌɑpəˈzɪʃən","n. 反对；反对党","the opposition party","反对党","动词 oppose"],["mandate","ˈmænˌdeɪt","n. 授权；命令","a clear mandate","明确的授权",""],["inaugurate","ɪˈnɔɡ(j)əˌreɪt","v. 使就职；开创","inaugurate a president","总统就职","名词 inauguration"],["civic","ˈsɪvɪk","adj. 公民的；城市的","civic duty","公民义务",""],["petition","pəˈtɪʃən","n. 请愿书 v. 请愿","sign a petition","签署请愿书",""],["protest","prəˈtɛst","v./n. 抗议","protest against a law","抗议一项法律",""],["rally","ˈræli","n. 集会 v. 集合；回升","a political rally","政治集会",""],["activist","ˈæktəvəst","n. 活动人士，积极分子","an environmental activist","环保人士","active + -ist"]]},{"t":"税收与财政","e":"Tax","s":[["The government's [fiscal] plan is simple: balance the [budget].","政府的财政计划很简单：平衡预算。"],["The [treasury] depends on [taxation].","国库依靠税收。"],["It will [levy] a new tax on luxury cars and [impose] higher rates on large firms.","政府将对豪华汽车征收一项新税，并对大公司实行更高的税率。"],["Small shops are [exempt], and parents can [deduct] school costs.","小商店可以免税，父母可以扣除教育费用。"],["Some rich people [evade] tax through a legal [loophole].","一些富人通过法律漏洞逃税。"],["Public [expenditure] is rising: a [fund] for hospitals, a [grant] for research.","公共支出在增加：一笔给医院的基金，一笔给科研的拨款。"],["There is no [surplus] this year.","今年没有盈余。"],["After years of [austerity] and one bank [bailout], the [burden] on the ordinary [taxpayer] is heavy.","经过多年的紧缩和一次银行救助，普通纳税人的负担很重。"],["Better [compliance], officials say, means the state need not [incur] more debt.","官员们说，如果大家更守法纳税，国家就不必背上更多债务。"]],"g":[["balance","平衡"],["depends on","依靠"],["luxury","豪华"],["rates","税率"],["firms","公司"],["costs","费用"],["legal","法律的"],["public","公共的"],["rising","上升"],["research","科研"],["ordinary","普通的"],["officials","官员"],["state","国家"],["debt","债务"]],"w":[["fiscal","ˈfɪsk(ə)l","adj. 财政的","fiscal policy","财政政策",""],["budget","ˈbədʒət","n. 预算 v. 编预算","a tight budget","预算紧张",""],["treasury","ˈtrɛʒ(ə)ri","n. 国库，财政部","the national treasury","国库","treasure 财宝"],["taxation","tækˈseɪʃən","n. 税收，征税","a taxation system","税收制度","tax + -ation"],["levy","ˈlɛvi","v./n. 征收（税）","levy a tax on","对…征税",""],["impose","ɪmˈpoʊz","v. 强加；征收","impose a ban","实施禁令","im- + pose 放"],["exempt","ɪɡˈzɛm(p)t","adj. 被免除的 v. 免除","be exempt from tax","免税","名词 exemption"],["deduct","dəˈdək(t)","v. 扣除","deduct tax from pay","从工资中扣税","名词 deduction"],["evade","əˈveɪd","v. 逃避","evade tax","逃税","名词 evasion"],["loophole","ˈlupˌ(h)oʊl","n. 漏洞","a legal loophole","法律漏洞",""],["expenditure","ɪkˈspɛndətʃər","n. 支出","public expenditure","公共支出","动词 expend"],["fund","fənd","n. 基金，资金 v. 资助","raise funds","筹集资金",""],["grant","ɡrænt","n. 拨款 v. 授予；准许","a research grant","研究经费","take for granted 认为理所当然"],["surplus","ˈsərpləs","n. 盈余，过剩","a trade surplus","贸易顺差","反义 deficit"],["austerity","ɔˈstɛrədi","n. 紧缩；简朴","austerity measures","紧缩措施",""],["bailout","ˈbeɪˌlaʊt","n. 紧急救助","a bank bailout","银行救助","bail out 的名词"],["burden","ˈbərd(ə)n","n. 负担 v. 使负担","a heavy burden","沉重的负担",""],["taxpayer","ˈtæksˌpeɪər","n. 纳税人","taxpayers' money","纳税人的钱",""],["compliance","kəmˈplaɪən(t)s","n. 遵守，服从","in compliance with","遵照","动词 comply"],["incur","ɪnˈkər","v. 招致，遭受","incur losses","蒙受损失",""]]},{"t":"说话的动词","e":"Speaking","s":[["At the press conference, the minister [declared] the project a success.","在新闻发布会上，部长宣布该项目取得成功。"],["His office had [proclaimed] it a “new era”.","他的办公室曾宣称它开启了一个“新时代”。"],["He [asserted] that costs were under control.","他断言成本在控制之中。"],["Reporters [alleged] that money was missing.","记者们指称有资金下落不明。"],["One [contended] that the figures were wrong; another [implied] that officials had lied.","一位记者坚称数字有误，另一位暗示官员撒了谎。"],["“What should we [infer] from your silence?” she asked.","她问：“从您的沉默中我们该推断出什么？”"],["The minister [emphasized] his honesty.","部长强调自己是诚实的。"],["He [remarked] that mistakes happen and [acknowledged] some delays.","他说错误在所难免，并承认有些延误。"],["He even [conceded] one error, but [denied] any crime.","他甚至承认了一处失误，但否认有任何违法行为。"],["He [insisted] on his innocence and [urged] patience.","他坚持自己是清白的，并敦促大家耐心。"],["Later, critics [advocated] an inquiry and [proposed] new rules.","后来，批评者主张展开调查，并提议制定新规则。"],["Nobody [objected].","没有人反对。"],["The minister used to [boast] about the project; now people [mock] it, and his supporters only [murmur].","部长过去常常吹嘘这个项目；如今人们嘲笑它，他的支持者也只是小声嘀咕。"]],"g":[["press conference","新闻发布会"],["costs","成本"],["under control","在控制中"],["reporters","记者"],["missing","下落不明"],["figures","数字"],["lied","撒谎"],["silence","沉默"],["honesty","诚实"],["delays","延误"],["error","失误"],["crime","犯罪"],["innocence","清白"],["patience","耐心"],["inquiry","调查"],["supporters","支持者"]],"w":[["declare","dəˈklɛr","v. 宣布，声明","declare war","宣战","名词 declaration"],["proclaim","prəˈkleɪm","v. 宣告，声明","proclaim independence","宣布独立","pro- 向前 + claim 喊"],["assert","əˈsərt","v. 断言，坚称","assert one's rights","维护自己的权利","名词 assertion"],["allege","əˈlɛdʒ","v.（无证据地）指称","allege fraud","指称有欺诈","副词 allegedly 据称"],["contend","kənˈtɛnd","v. 主张；竞争","contend that…","主张…",""],["imply","ɪmˈplaɪ","v. 暗示","imply that…","暗示…","名词 implication"],["infer","ɪnˈfər","v. 推断","infer from the facts","根据事实推断","说话者 imply，听者 infer"],["emphasize","ˈɛmfəˌsaɪz","v. 强调","emphasize the importance","强调重要性","名词 emphasis"],["remark","rəˈmɑrk","v. 说，评论 n. 言论","remark on the weather","谈论天气",""],["acknowledge","əkˈnɑlədʒ","v. 承认；致谢","acknowledge a mistake","承认错误",""],["concede","kənˈsid","v.（不情愿地）承认；让步","concede defeat","认输","名词 concession"],["deny","dəˈnaɪ","v. 否认；拒绝给予","deny a charge","否认指控","名词 denial"],["insist","ɪnˈsɪst","v. 坚持","insist on doing","坚持做",""],["urge","ərdʒ","v. 敦促 n. 强烈欲望","urge sb to do","敦促某人做","形容词 urgent"],["advocate","ˈædvəˌkeɪt","v. 主张，提倡 n. 倡导者","advocate reform","主张改革",""],["propose","prəˈpoʊz","v. 提议；求婚","propose a plan","提出计划","名词 proposal"],["object","əbˈdʒɛk(t)","v. 反对 n. 物体；目标","object to the plan","反对计划","作动词重音在后"],["boast","boʊst","v./n. 吹嘘，夸耀","boast about success","吹嘘成功",""],["mock","mɑk","v. 嘲笑 adj. 模拟的","mock his accent","嘲笑他的口音","mock exam 模拟考试"],["murmur","ˈmərmər","v./n. 低语，咕哝","murmur a reply","低声回答",""]]},{"t":"动作","e":"Movement","s":[["The boy loved to [wander] by the river and [roam] the hills.","这个男孩喜欢在河边闲逛，在山里漫游。"],["One day he saw a rabbit and [dashed] after it.","有一天他看见一只兔子，便飞奔着追过去。"],["He [leaped] over a log, [stumbled] on a stone, and [staggered] to his feet.","他跳过一根木头，被石头绊了一下，摇摇晃晃地站起来。"],["The rabbit hid.","兔子躲了起来。"],["He [crawled] under a bush and [crept] forward.","他爬到灌木丛下，悄悄向前挪动。"],["Suddenly the ground gave way.","突然地面塌了。"],["He began to [slide] down the bank; a bird [glided] above him.","他开始顺着河岸往下滑，一只鸟在他头顶滑翔而过。"],["He [grabbed] a root, but could not [grasp] it firmly.","他抓住一条树根，却握不牢。"],["He [seized] a branch and [clutched] it with both hands.","他又抓住一根树枝，双手紧紧攥住。"],["His bag was [tossed] into the water, as if [hurled] by a giant.","他的包被抛进水里，像是被巨人扔出去的一样。"],["A farmer heard him, [dragged] over a rope, and [hauled] him up.","一位农夫听见了，拖来一根绳子，把他拉了上来。"],["He [shoved] the boy onto the grass and [squeezed] his shoulder: “Go home.”","他把男孩推到草地上，捏了捏他的肩膀：“回家去吧。”"]],"g":[["rabbit","兔子"],["log","木头"],["hid","躲藏"],["bush","灌木丛"],["forward","向前"],["gave way","塌陷"],["bank","河岸"],["root","树根"],["firmly","牢固地"],["branch","树枝"],["giant","巨人"],["rope","绳子"],["shoulder","肩膀"]],"w":[["wander","ˈwɑndər","v. 闲逛，漫游","wander around","四处闲逛","别混 wonder"],["roam","roʊm","v. 漫游，漫步","roam the streets","在街上闲逛","手机“漫游”roaming"],["dash","dæʃ","v. 猛冲 n. 少量；破折号","dash to the door","冲向门口",""],["leap","lip","v./n. 跳跃；激增","leap over a fence","跳过栅栏","leap – leaped/leapt"],["stumble","ˈstəmb(ə)l","v. 绊倒；偶然发现","stumble over a stone","被石头绊倒","stumble upon 偶然发现"],["stagger","ˈstæɡər","v. 摇晃，蹒跚；使震惊","stagger home","摇摇晃晃回家",""],["crawl","krɔl","v. 爬行；缓慢行进","crawl on the floor","在地上爬",""],["creep","krip","v. 蹑手蹑脚地走；爬","creep upstairs","悄悄上楼","creep – crept – crept"],["slide","slaɪd","v./n. 滑动；下滑","slide down","滑下去","slide – slid – slid"],["glide","ɡlaɪd","v. 滑行，滑翔","glide through the air","在空中滑翔",""],["grab","ɡræb","v. 抓取，抢","grab a bag","抓起包",""],["grasp","ɡræsp","v. 抓牢；理解 n. 掌握","grasp the meaning","领会意思",""],["seize","siz","v. 抓住；夺取","seize the chance","抓住机会",""],["clutch","klətʃ","v. 紧握 n. 离合器","clutch a bag","紧抓着包",""],["toss","tɔs","v. 扔，抛","toss a coin","抛硬币",""],["hurl","hərl","v. 猛投","hurl a stone","用力扔石头",""],["drag","dræɡ","v. 拖，拉","drag a chair","拖椅子",""],["haul","hɔl","v. 用力拖；运送","haul a boat","拖船",""],["shove","ʃəv","v. 推，挤","shove sb aside","把某人推到一边",""],["squeeze","skwiz","v. 挤，捏；挤进","squeeze a lemon","挤柠檬",""]]},{"t":"感官","e":"Senses","s":[["I [glanced] at the window and caught a [glimpse] of the sea.","我朝窗外瞥了一眼，瞥见了大海。"],["For a while I [gazed] at the waves.","有一会儿我凝视着海浪。"],["A child [stared] at a boat; an old man [peered] through the fog; the sun's [glare] hurt my eyes.","一个孩子盯着一条船，一位老人透过雾气费力地张望，太阳的强光刺痛了我的眼睛。"],["At dusk the sky began to [glow].","黄昏时天空开始发出柔光。"],["Stars [glittered], and the water [sparkled].","星星闪烁，水面波光粼粼。"],["Then the light grew [dim].","随后光线变暗了。"],["I heard a [faint] [echo] of music and the [shrill] cry of a bird.","我听见微弱的音乐回声和一只鸟尖锐的叫声。"],["The [scent] of pine was [fragrant], mixed with the [odor] of fish.","松树的气味很香，夹杂着鱼的气味。"],["I touched the rock: its [texture] was [smooth] in places and [coarse] in others, and my fingers were [sticky] with salt.","我摸了摸岩石：它的质地有些地方光滑，有些地方粗糙，我的手指被盐弄得黏黏的。"]],"g":[["caught","捕捉到"],["waves","海浪"],["fog","雾"],["hurt","刺痛"],["dusk","黄昏"],["grew","变得"],["cry","叫声"],["pine","松树"],["mixed","混合"],["touched","触摸"],["rock","岩石"],["fingers","手指"]],"w":[["glance","ɡlæn(t)s","v./n. 瞥一眼","glance at the clock","瞥一眼钟","at a glance 一眼就"],["glimpse","ɡlɪm(p)s","n./v. 一瞥，瞥见","catch a glimpse of","瞥见",""],["gaze","ɡeɪz","v./n. 凝视","gaze at the stars","凝视星空",""],["stare","stɛr","v./n. 盯着看","stare at a stranger","盯着陌生人",""],["peer","pɪr","v. 仔细看 n. 同龄人","peer into the dark","向黑暗中张望","peer pressure 同辈压力"],["glare","ɡlɛr","n. 强光；怒视 v. 怒视","the glare of the sun","太阳的强光",""],["glow","ɡloʊ","v./n. 发光，发热","glow in the dark","在黑暗中发光",""],["glitter","ˈɡlɪdər","v./n. 闪烁，闪光","gold glitters","金子闪光",""],["sparkle","ˈspɑrk(ə)l","v./n. 闪耀","eyes sparkle","眼睛发亮",""],["dim","dɪm","adj. 昏暗的 v. 变暗","a dim light","昏暗的光",""],["faint","feɪnt","adj. 微弱的 v. 昏倒","a faint smell","淡淡的气味",""],["echo","ˈɛkoʊ","n. 回声 v. 回响","hear an echo","听到回声",""],["shrill","ʃrɪl","adj. 尖声的，刺耳的","a shrill voice","尖锐的声音",""],["scent","sɛnt","n. 气味，香味","the scent of roses","玫瑰的香味",""],["fragrant","ˈfreɪɡrənt","adj. 芳香的","fragrant flowers","芬芳的花","名词 fragrance"],["odor","ˈoʊdər","n.（难闻的）气味","a strong odor","浓烈的气味","英式 odour"],["texture","ˈtɛk(st)ʃər","n. 质地，口感","a soft texture","柔软的质地",""],["smooth","smuð","adj. 光滑的；顺利的","smooth skin","光滑的皮肤",""],["coarse","kɔrs","adj. 粗糙的；粗俗的","coarse sand","粗沙","读音同 course"],["sticky","ˈstɪki","adj. 黏的","sticky rice","糯米","动词 stick"]]},{"t":"服装与时尚","e":"Fashion","s":[["My aunt always looks [fashionable], but she never follows a [trend].","我姑姑看起来总是很时髦，但她从不追随潮流。"],["She runs a small [boutique].","她经营着一家小精品店。"],["Every [garment] there is made by hand, and each [outfit] is unique.","那里的每件衣服都是手工做的，每套服装都独一无二。"],["Her own [wardrobe] is small.","她自己的衣橱很小。"],["She chooses each [fabric] herself at the [textile] market: [silk] for summer, [wool] for winter, [leather] for bags.","她亲自到纺织品市场挑选每种面料：夏天用丝绸，冬天用羊毛，包用皮革。"],["She trained as a [tailor]. She can [sew] a dress in a day, and every [stitch] is neat.","她受过裁缝训练，一天就能缝好一条裙子，每一针都很整齐。"],["She checks each [collar] and [sleeve] twice.","每个衣领和袖子她都要检查两遍。"],["Her style is [elegant] but [casual].","她的风格优雅又随意。"],["One [accessory], she says, is enough: a scarf or simple [jewelry].","她说，一件配饰就够了：一条围巾，或者简单的首饰。"]],"g":[["aunt","姑姑"],["runs","经营"],["by hand","手工"],["unique","独特的"],["market","市场"],["trained","受训"],["dress","裙子"],["neat","整齐的"],["checks","检查"],["twice","两次"],["style","风格"],["scarf","围巾"]],"w":[["fashionable","ˈfæʃ(ə)nəb(ə)l","adj. 时髦的","fashionable clothes","时髦的衣服","fashion + -able"],["trend","trɛnd","n. 趋势；潮流","follow a trend","追随潮流","形容词 trendy"],["boutique","buˈtik","n. 精品店","a fashion boutique","时装精品店","来自法语"],["garment","ˈɡɑrm(ə)nt","n.（一件）衣服","a woolen garment","羊毛衣物","比 clothes 正式"],["outfit","ˈaʊtˌfɪt","n. 一套服装","a new outfit","一套新衣服",""],["wardrobe","ˈwɔrˌdroʊb","n. 衣柜；全部衣物","a winter wardrobe","冬装",""],["fabric","ˈfæbrɪk","n. 织物，布料","cotton fabric","棉布",""],["textile","ˈtɛkˌstaɪl","n. 纺织品","the textile industry","纺织业",""],["silk","sɪlk","n. 丝绸","a silk scarf","丝巾","the Silk Road 丝绸之路"],["wool","wʊl","n. 羊毛","pure wool","纯羊毛","形容词 woolen"],["leather","ˈlɛðər","n. 皮革","a leather jacket","皮夹克",""],["tailor","ˈteɪlər","n. 裁缝 v. 量身定制","a skilled tailor","手艺好的裁缝","tailor-made 定制的"],["sew","soʊ","v. 缝纫","sew a button on","缝上纽扣","读音同 so"],["stitch","stɪtʃ","n. 一针 v. 缝","a neat stitch","整齐的针脚",""],["collar","ˈkɑlər","n. 衣领；项圈","a shirt collar","衬衫领","white-collar 白领"],["sleeve","sliv","n. 袖子","roll up one's sleeves","卷起袖子",""],["elegant","ˈɛləɡənt","adj. 优雅的","an elegant dress","优雅的裙子","名词 elegance"],["casual","ˈkæʒuəl","adj. 随意的，休闲的","casual clothes","便装","反义 formal"],["accessory","əkˈsɛs(ə)ri","n. 配饰；附件","fashion accessories","时尚配饰",""],["jewelry","ˈdʒu(ə)lri","n. 珠宝，首饰","gold jewelry","金首饰","英式 jewellery"]]},{"t":"家务","e":"Household","s":[["Saturday is [chore] day in our flat.","星期六是我们公寓的家务日。"],["I do the [laundry] with a new [detergent].","我用一种新洗涤剂洗衣服。"],["My roommate [sweeps] the floor and uses a [mop].","室友扫地、拖地。"],["He is [tidy]; I am [messy].","他爱整洁，我比较邋遢。"],["Every [appliance] gets cleaned: the [refrigerator], the [microwave], and the [oven].","每件电器都要清洁：冰箱、微波炉和烤箱。"],["The [kettle] needs washing too, and the kitchen [faucet] is dripping again.","水壶也得洗，厨房的水龙头又在滴水了。"],["We empty each [drawer] and wipe the [cupboard].","我们清空每个抽屉，擦拭橱柜。"],["I turn the [mattress], wash the [pillow] covers, and take down the [curtains].","我把床垫翻个面，洗枕套，取下窗帘。"],["He cleans the [carpet].","他清理地毯。"],["Last, we carry out the [garbage]. Then we order pizza.","最后我们把垃圾拿出去，然后点披萨。"]],"g":[["flat","公寓"],["roommate","室友"],["floor","地板"],["cleaned","清洁"],["washing","洗"],["dripping","滴水"],["empty","清空"],["wipe","擦"],["turn","翻转"],["covers","套子"],["take down","取下"],["carry out","拿出去"],["order","点餐"]],"w":[["chore","tʃɔr","n. 家务活；乏味的事","do the chores","做家务",""],["laundry","ˈlɔndri","n. 待洗的衣物；洗衣店","do the laundry","洗衣服",""],["detergent","dəˈtərdʒənt","n. 洗涤剂","laundry detergent","洗衣液",""],["sweep","swip","v. 扫；席卷","sweep the floor","扫地","sweep – swept – swept"],["mop","mɑp","n. 拖把 v. 拖地","mop the floor","拖地",""],["tidy","ˈtaɪdi","adj. 整洁的 v. 整理","a tidy room","整洁的房间","tidy up 收拾"],["messy","ˈmɛsi","adj. 凌乱的","a messy desk","乱糟糟的桌子","名词 mess"],["appliance","əˈplaɪən(t)s","n. 家用电器","household appliances","家用电器",""],["refrigerator","rəˈfrɪdʒəˌreɪdər","n. 冰箱","put it in the refrigerator","放进冰箱","口语 fridge"],["microwave","ˈmaɪkroʊˌweɪv","n. 微波炉 v. 用微波炉加热","a microwave oven","微波炉","micro- + wave"],["oven","ˈəv(ə)n","n. 烤箱","bake in the oven","用烤箱烤",""],["kettle","ˈkɛd(ə)l","n. 水壶","boil the kettle","烧水",""],["faucet","ˈfɔsət","n. 水龙头","turn off the faucet","关水龙头","英式 tap"],["drawer","drɔr","n. 抽屉","open a drawer","拉开抽屉","draw 拉"],["cupboard","ˈkəbərd","n. 橱柜","a kitchen cupboard","厨房橱柜","p 不发音"],["mattress","ˈmætrəs","n. 床垫","a soft mattress","软床垫",""],["pillow","ˈpɪloʊ","n. 枕头","a feather pillow","羽毛枕",""],["curtain","ˈkərtn","n. 窗帘；幕布","draw the curtains","拉窗帘",""],["carpet","ˈkɑrpət","n. 地毯","a red carpet","红地毯",""],["garbage","ˈɡɑrbɪdʒ","n. 垃圾","take out the garbage","倒垃圾","英式 rubbish"]]},{"t":"恋爱与婚姻","e":"Marriage","s":[["Their [romance] began at university.","他们的恋情始于大学。"],["After a long [courtship], the [couple] announced their [engagement].","经过漫长的恋爱，这对情侣宣布订婚。"],["The [wedding] was held in June.","婚礼在六月举行。"],["The [bride] wore white, and the [groom] forgot his speech.","新娘穿着白色婚纱，新郎忘了自己的致辞。"],["They exchanged a [vow] in a short [ceremony]; a [reception] followed in the garden.","他们在一场简短的仪式上交换了誓言，随后在花园里举行了婚宴。"],["After the [honeymoon], real life began.","蜜月之后，真正的生活开始了。"],["On each [anniversary] they promise again to be [faithful].","每逢结婚纪念日，他们都再次承诺彼此忠诚。"],["Marriage, they say, is a [commitment].","他们说，婚姻是一种承诺。"],["When she was [pregnant], he took [maternity] classes with her.","她怀孕时，他陪她一起上孕产课。"],["They [quarrel] sometimes, like everyone.","和所有人一样，他们有时也吵架。"],["Their neighbors went through a [divorce] and a fight over [custody].","他们的邻居经历了离婚，还为孩子的监护权争执。"],["Next door lives a [widow] who still wears her ring.","隔壁住着一位寡妇，至今仍戴着她的戒指。"]],"g":[["announced","宣布"],["held","举行"],["wore","穿"],["speech","致辞"],["exchanged","交换"],["followed","随后进行"],["promise","承诺"],["marriage","婚姻"],["neighbors","邻居"],["went through","经历"],["ring","戒指"]],"w":[["romance","roʊˈmæn(t)s","n. 恋情；浪漫","a summer romance","夏日恋情","形容词 romantic"],["courtship","ˈkɔrtˌʃɪp","n. 求爱（期），恋爱","a long courtship","漫长的恋爱","court 追求"],["couple","ˈkəp(ə)l","n. 夫妻，情侣；一对","a married couple","已婚夫妇","a couple of 几个"],["engagement","ɪnˈɡeɪdʒm(ə)nt","n. 订婚；约定；参与","an engagement ring","订婚戒指","be engaged to"],["wedding","ˈwɛdɪŋ","n. 婚礼","a wedding dress","婚纱",""],["bride","braɪd","n. 新娘","the bride and groom","新娘和新郎","bridesmaid 伴娘"],["groom","ɡrum","n. 新郎 v. 梳理","the nervous groom","紧张的新郎","也说 bridegroom"],["vow","vaʊ","n. 誓言 v. 发誓","wedding vows","结婚誓言",""],["ceremony","ˈsɛrəˌmoʊni","n. 仪式，典礼","a wedding ceremony","结婚典礼",""],["reception","rəˈsɛpʃən","n. 招待会；接待处","a wedding reception","婚宴","receptionist 前台"],["honeymoon","ˈhəniˌmun","n. 蜜月","go on a honeymoon","度蜜月","honey + moon"],["anniversary","ˌænəˈvərs(ə)ri","n. 周年纪念日","a wedding anniversary","结婚纪念日","ann = 年"],["faithful","ˈfeɪθfəl","adj. 忠诚的","a faithful husband","忠诚的丈夫","faith + -ful"],["commitment","kəˈmɪtm(ə)nt","n. 承诺；投入","make a commitment","作出承诺","动词 commit"],["pregnant","ˈprɛɡnənt","adj. 怀孕的","be six months pregnant","怀孕六个月","名词 pregnancy"],["maternity","məˈtərnədi","n. 母亲身份；产科","maternity leave","产假","mater = 母亲"],["quarrel","ˈkwɔrəl","v./n. 吵架","quarrel with sb","和某人吵架",""],["divorce","dəˈvɔrs","n./v. 离婚","get a divorce","离婚",""],["custody","ˈkəstədi","n. 监护权；拘留","child custody","孩子的监护权",""],["widow","ˈwɪdoʊ","n. 寡妇","a war widow","战争遗孀","鳏夫 widower"]]},{"t":"童年与成长","e":"Childhood","s":[["An [infant] sleeps in a [cradle] while her mother sings a [lullaby].","婴儿睡在摇篮里，妈妈唱着摇篮曲。"],["Soon she is a [toddler], then goes to [nursery] and [kindergarten].","很快她成了学步的幼儿，然后上托儿所和幼儿园。"],["On the [playground] she learns more than in class.","她在操场上学到的东西比在课堂上还多。"],["A child's [curiosity] and [imagination] have no limits.","孩子的好奇心和想象力没有边界。"],["Children are [innocent], but not always good: one is [naughty], another [obedient].","孩子是天真的，但并不总是乖的：有的淘气，有的听话。"],["Parents who give too much [spoil] a child.","给得太多的父母会把孩子宠坏。"],["Children [tease] each other, and a few [bully] the weak.","孩子们互相取笑，少数还会欺负弱小。"],["Some have a harder start: an [orphan] may wait years for a family to [adopt] him, with a legal [guardian] until then.","有些孩子的起点更艰难：孤儿可能要等很多年才有家庭收养他，在那之前由法定监护人照管。"],["Then comes [puberty], and slowly the child becomes [mature].","接着青春期到来，孩子慢慢变得成熟。"]],"g":[["sings","唱"],["soon","很快"],["limits","界限"],["weak","弱小的"],["harder","更艰难的"],["start","起点"],["legal","法定的"],["until then","在那之前"],["slowly","慢慢地"]],"w":[["infant","ˈɪnfənt","n. 婴儿","an infant son","襁褓中的儿子","名词 infancy 婴儿期"],["cradle","ˈkreɪd(ə)l","n. 摇篮；发源地","rock the cradle","摇摇篮","the cradle of civilization 文明的摇篮"],["lullaby","ˈlələˌbaɪ","n. 摇篮曲","sing a lullaby","唱摇篮曲","lull 哄睡"],["toddler","ˈtɑd(ə)lər","n. 学步的幼儿","a two-year-old toddler","两岁的幼儿","toddle 蹒跚学步"],["nursery","ˈnərs(ə)ri","n. 托儿所；苗圃","a day nursery","日间托儿所","nursery rhyme 儿歌"],["kindergarten","ˈkɪndərˌɡɑrtn","n. 幼儿园","go to kindergarten","上幼儿园","来自德语：儿童的花园"],["playground","ˈpleɪˌɡraʊnd","n. 操场，游乐场","a school playground","学校操场",""],["curiosity","ˌkjʊriˈɑsədi","n. 好奇心","out of curiosity","出于好奇","形容词 curious"],["imagination","ɪˌmædʒəˈneɪʃən","n. 想象力","a vivid imagination","丰富的想象力","动词 imagine"],["innocent","ˈɪnəs(ə)nt","adj. 天真的；无罪的","an innocent child","天真的孩子","名词 innocence"],["naughty","ˈnɔdi","adj. 淘气的","a naughty boy","淘气的男孩",""],["obedient","əˈbidiənt","adj. 听话的，顺从的","an obedient dog","听话的狗","动词 obey"],["spoil","spɔɪl","v. 宠坏；破坏；变质","spoil a child","宠坏孩子","a spoiled child"],["tease","tiz","v. 取笑，逗弄","tease a classmate","取笑同学",""],["bully","ˈbʊli","v. 欺负 n. 欺凌者","bully younger kids","欺负年纪小的孩子","名词 bullying 霸凌"],["orphan","ˈɔrf(ə)n","n. 孤儿","a war orphan","战争孤儿","orphanage 孤儿院"],["adopt","əˈdɑpt","v. 收养；采用","adopt a child","收养孩子","别混 adapt 适应"],["guardian","ˈɡɑrdiən","n. 监护人；守护者","a legal guardian","法定监护人","guard + -ian"],["puberty","ˈpjubərdi","n. 青春期","reach puberty","进入青春期",""],["mature","məˈtʃər","adj. 成熟的 v. 成熟","a mature student","成熟的学生","反义 immature"]]},{"t":"音乐","e":"Music","s":[["The city [orchestra] has a new [conductor].","市管弦乐团来了一位新指挥。"],["Tonight they play a [symphony] at a free [concert].","今晚他们在一场免费音乐会上演奏一部交响曲。"],["The [composer] was only twenty when she [composed] it.","作曲家创作它时只有二十岁。"],["The first [melody] is slow.","第一段旋律很慢。"],["Then the [rhythm] changes, the strings play in [harmony], and the [tempo] rises.","接着节奏变了，弦乐和谐地齐奏，速度加快。"],["A flute holds a high [pitch] over one deep [chord].","一支长笛在一个低沉的和弦之上保持着高音。"],["Each [instrument] has its moment.","每件乐器都有自己的时刻。"],["In the last part, a [choir] joins, and a girl sings a [solo].","最后一部分，合唱团加入进来，一个女孩独唱。"],["The [lyric] is simple, and the [tune] stays in your head.","歌词很简单，曲调会留在你脑子里。"],["They [rehearsed] for a month.","他们排练了一个月。"],["The hall was built for [opera], so the [acoustic] quality is perfect.","这座大厅是为歌剧而建的，所以音响效果完美。"]],"g":[["tonight","今晚"],["free","免费的"],["strings","弦乐"],["rises","加快"],["flute","长笛"],["holds","保持"],["deep","低沉的"],["moment","时刻"],["joins","加入"],["stays","停留"],["hall","大厅"],["built","建造"],["quality","质量"],["perfect","完美的"]],"w":[["orchestra","ˈɔrkəstrə","n. 管弦乐队","a symphony orchestra","交响乐团","ch 读 k"],["conductor","kənˈdəktər","n. 指挥；售票员；导体","an orchestra conductor","乐队指挥","动词 conduct"],["symphony","ˈsɪmfəni","n. 交响曲","Beethoven's Fifth Symphony","贝多芬第五交响曲","sym- 共同 + phon 声音"],["concert","ˈkɑn(t)sərt","n. 音乐会","go to a concert","去听音乐会",""],["composer","kəmˈpoʊzər","n. 作曲家","a classical composer","古典作曲家",""],["compose","kəmˈpoʊz","v. 作曲；组成；使平静","compose a song","写歌","be composed of 由…组成"],["melody","ˈmɛlədi","n. 旋律","a sweet melody","甜美的旋律",""],["rhythm","ˈrɪðəm","n. 节奏","a sense of rhythm","节奏感","注意拼写：没有元音字母"],["harmony","ˈhɑrməni","n. 和声；和谐","live in harmony","和睦相处","形容词 harmonious"],["tempo","ˈtɛmpoʊ","n.（音乐）速度；节奏","a fast tempo","快节奏","temp = 时间"],["pitch","pɪtʃ","n. 音高；球场 v. 投","a high pitch","高音",""],["chord","kɔrd","n. 和弦","play a chord","弹和弦","ch 读 k"],["instrument","ˈɪn(t)strəmənt","n. 乐器；仪器；工具","a musical instrument","乐器",""],["choir","ˈkwaɪər","n. 合唱团","a school choir","学校合唱团","读作 /ˈkwaɪər/"],["solo","ˈsoʊˌloʊ","n. 独唱，独奏 adj. 单独的","a piano solo","钢琴独奏","sol = 单独"],["lyric","ˈlɪrɪk","n. 歌词 adj. 抒情的","write the lyrics","写歌词","常用复数"],["tune","tun","n. 曲调 v. 调音","a catchy tune","好记的曲调","out of tune 跑调"],["rehearse","rəˈhərs","v. 排练","rehearse a play","排练话剧","名词 rehearsal"],["opera","ˈɑp(ə)rə","n. 歌剧","Peking opera","京剧",""],["acoustic","əˈkustɪk","adj. 声学的，原声的","an acoustic guitar","原声吉他",""]]}],[{"t":"思维与认知","e":"Thinking","s":[["Human [intellect] is more than memory.","人的智力不只是记忆。"],["[Logic] gives us rules, and careful [reasoning] takes us from facts to conclusions.","逻辑给我们规则，严密的推理带我们从事实走向结论。"],["A scientist must [analyze] data, [evaluate] each claim, and [deduce] what follows.","科学家必须分析数据，评估每一个说法，推断出随之而来的结果。"],["Yet [intuition] matters too: a sudden [insight] often comes in the shower.","但直觉也很重要：突如其来的洞见常常在洗澡时出现。"],["A new [concept] may begin as a vague [notion].","一个新概念可能起初只是一个模糊的想法。"],["Einstein could [conceive] of riding a beam of light; he would [contemplate] one question for years.","爱因斯坦能设想骑在一束光上；他会就一个问题沉思多年。"],["Good thinkers [ponder] slowly.","优秀的思考者慢慢琢磨。"],["They [anticipate] objections and never [presume] they are right.","他们预料到反对意见，从不假定自己是对的。"],["They treat [doubt] as a tool, not a weakness, and they hold each [conviction] lightly.","他们把怀疑当作工具而不是弱点，对每一个信念都不固执。"],["[Awareness] of our own limits makes us wise.","意识到自己的局限使我们明智。"],["Stay [conscious] of your mistakes, and keep your [wit].","对自己的错误保持清醒，并保持你的机智。"]],"g":[["memory","记忆"],["rules","规则"],["facts","事实"],["conclusions","结论"],["claim","说法"],["follows","随之而来"],["sudden","突然的"],["shower","淋浴"],["vague","模糊的"],["beam","光束"],["objections","反对意见"],["treat","对待"],["tool","工具"],["weakness","弱点"],["limits","局限"],["wise","明智的"]],"w":[["intellect","ˈɪn(t)lˌɛk(t)","n. 智力，才智","a man of great intellect","才智过人的人","形容词 intellectual"],["logic","ˈlɑdʒɪk","n. 逻辑","the logic of an argument","论证的逻辑","形容词 logical"],["reasoning","ˈrizənɪŋ","n. 推理","logical reasoning","逻辑推理","动词 reason"],["analyze","ˈænlˌaɪz","v. 分析","analyze data","分析数据","名词 analysis"],["evaluate","əˈvæljʊˌeɪt","v. 评估，评价","evaluate the results","评估结果","value 价值"],["deduce","dəˈdus","v. 推断，演绎","deduce from the facts","从事实推断","名词 deduction"],["intuition","ˌɪntuˈɪʃən","n. 直觉","trust your intuition","相信直觉","形容词 intuitive"],["insight","ˈɪnˌsaɪt","n. 洞察力，深刻见解","gain an insight into","深入了解","in + sight"],["concept","ˈkɑnˌsɛpt","n. 概念","a basic concept","基本概念",""],["notion","ˈnoʊʃən","n. 观念，想法","a vague notion","模糊的想法",""],["conceive","kənˈsiv","v. 构想；怀孕","conceive an idea","构思出一个想法","名词 conception"],["contemplate","ˈkɑn(t)əmˌpleɪt","v. 沉思；考虑","contemplate the future","思考未来",""],["ponder","ˈpɑndər","v. 仔细考虑","ponder a question","琢磨一个问题",""],["anticipate","ænˈtɪsəˌpeɪt","v. 预料，期待","anticipate problems","预料到问题","ante- 在前"],["presume","priˈzum","v. 假定，推测","presume innocence","推定无罪","名词 presumption"],["doubt","daʊt","n./v. 怀疑","without doubt","毫无疑问","b 不发音"],["conviction","kənˈvɪkʃən","n. 坚定的信念；定罪","a strong conviction","坚定的信念",""],["awareness","əˈwɛrnəs","n. 意识，认识","raise awareness","提高意识","形容词 aware"],["conscious","ˈkɑnʃəs","adj. 有意识的；清醒的","be conscious of","意识到","别混 conscience 良心"],["wit","wɪt","n. 机智，风趣","a man of wit","机智的人","形容词 witty"]]},{"t":"态度与立场","e":"Attitude","s":[["When the school proposed longer hours, each teacher took a different [attitude].","学校提出延长课时后，每位老师态度各不相同。"],["The head's [stance] was clear: she was in [favor].","校长的立场很明确：她赞成。"],["A few [approved] at once.","少数人立刻表示同意。"],["Many [opposed] the plan and promised to [resist] it.","许多人反对这个计划，并表示要抵制。"],["Young teachers were ready to [embrace] change; they were [eager], even [keen].","年轻教师乐于接受变化，他们很热切，甚至很起劲。"],["One was [enthusiastic], another [passionate] about new methods.","有一位很热情，另一位对新方法充满激情。"],["Older staff were [hesitant].","年长的教职员工则犹豫不决。"],["Some were simply [indifferent].","有些人干脆漠不关心。"],["One [cynical] voice said nothing would change; a [pessimistic] colleague agreed.","有个愤世嫉俗的声音说什么都不会变，一位悲观的同事表示同意。"],["Parents were [sympathetic] to the teachers but [critical] of the timing.","家长同情老师，但对时机提出批评。"],["I am [inclined] to wait.","我倾向于再等等。"],["To be honest, I feel [ambivalent].","说实话，我心情矛盾。"],["What worries me most is that the board seems [complacent].","最让我担心的是校董会似乎自鸣得意。"]],"g":[["proposed","提出"],["head","校长"],["at once","立刻"],["promised","承诺"],["ready","乐意的"],["methods","方法"],["staff","教职工"],["simply","干脆"],["voice","声音"],["colleague","同事"],["timing","时机"],["to be honest","说实话"],["worries","使担心"],["board","校董会"]],"w":[["attitude","ˈædəˌtud","n. 态度","a positive attitude","积极的态度",""],["stance","stæn(t)s","n. 立场；站姿","take a stance on","对…表明立场",""],["favor","ˈfeɪvər","n. 赞成；帮助 v. 偏爱","be in favor of","赞成","英式 favour"],["approve","əˈpruv","v. 赞成；批准","approve of the plan","赞成这个计划","名词 approval"],["oppose","əˈpoʊz","v. 反对","oppose a plan","反对计划","be opposed to"],["resist","rəˈzɪst","v. 抵制，抵抗","resist change","抵制变化","名词 resistance"],["embrace","əmˈbreɪs","v. 欣然接受；拥抱","embrace change","拥抱变化",""],["eager","ˈiɡər","adj. 渴望的，热切的","be eager to learn","渴望学习",""],["keen","kin","adj. 热衷的；敏锐的","be keen on","热衷于",""],["enthusiastic","ɪnˌθuziˈæstɪk","adj. 热情的","be enthusiastic about","对…热情","名词 enthusiasm"],["passionate","ˈpæʃ(ə)nət","adj. 充满激情的","be passionate about","热爱","名词 passion"],["hesitant","ˈhɛzəd(ə)nt","adj. 犹豫的","be hesitant to speak","不敢开口","动词 hesitate"],["indifferent","ɪnˈdɪf(ə)rənt","adj. 漠不关心的","be indifferent to","对…漠不关心","不是“没有不同”"],["cynical","ˈsɪnək(ə)l","adj. 愤世嫉俗的，怀疑的","a cynical view","愤世嫉俗的看法",""],["pessimistic","ˌpɛsəˈmɪstɪk","adj. 悲观的","be pessimistic about","对…悲观","反义 optimistic"],["sympathetic","ˌsɪmpəˈθɛdɪk","adj. 同情的；赞同的","be sympathetic to","同情","名词 sympathy"],["critical","ˈkrɪdək(ə)l","adj. 批评的；关键的","be critical of","批评","critical thinking 批判性思维"],["inclined","ɪnˈklaɪnd","adj. 倾向于…的","be inclined to agree","倾向于同意","名词 inclination"],["ambivalent","æmˈbɪv(ə)lənt","adj. 矛盾的，摇摆的","feel ambivalent about","对…心情矛盾","ambi- 两边"],["complacent","kəmˈpleɪs(ə)nt","adj. 自满的","grow complacent","变得自满","名词 complacency"]]},{"t":"成功之路","e":"Success","s":[["Great athletes [strive] every day.","伟大的运动员每天都在奋斗。"],["Their [endeavor] is long, and they [persevere] when others stop.","他们的努力是漫长的，别人停下时他们仍坚持不懈。"],["Every [obstacle] teaches something; a [setback] is not the end.","每一个障碍都教会人一些东西；一次挫折并不是终点。"],["Those who [overcome] pain can [accomplish] what seems impossible.","克服了痛苦的人能完成看似不可能的事。"],["Few [attain] the top, but many [fulfill] a private dream.","很少有人登顶，但许多人实现了自己的梦想。"],["To [excel], you need a place where talent can [thrive].","要想出类拔萃，你需要一个能让才华茁壮成长的地方。"],["Young players [flourish] under kind coaches, and clubs [prosper] when they invest in youth.","年轻球员在和善的教练手下茁壮成长，俱乐部投资青年人才就会兴旺。"],["An [outstanding] player soon becomes [prominent].","杰出的球员很快就会崭露头角。"],["After a [distinguished] career, a [renowned] champion gains [prestige].","在卓越的职业生涯之后，著名的冠军会获得声望。"],["But a [reputation] is easy to lose, and [glory] fades fast.","但名声容易失去，荣耀消退得很快。"]],"g":[["athletes","运动员"],["pain","痛苦"],["impossible","不可能的"],["private","个人的"],["talent","才华"],["coaches","教练"],["clubs","俱乐部"],["invest","投资"],["youth","青年"],["career","职业生涯"],["champion","冠军"],["gains","获得"],["fades","消退"]],"w":[["strive","straɪv","v. 努力，奋斗","strive for success","为成功奋斗","strive – strove – striven"],["endeavor","ənˈdɛvər","n./v. 努力，尽力","make every endeavor","尽一切努力","英式 endeavour"],["persevere","ˌpərsəˈvɪr","v. 坚持不懈","persevere in one's studies","坚持学习","名词 perseverance"],["obstacle","ˈɑbztək(ə)l","n. 障碍","overcome an obstacle","克服障碍",""],["setback","ˈsɛtˌbæk","n. 挫折","suffer a setback","遭受挫折","set back 的名词"],["overcome","ˌoʊvərˈkəm","v. 克服，战胜","overcome difficulties","克服困难","over + come"],["accomplish","əˈkɑmplɪʃ","v. 完成，实现","accomplish a task","完成任务","名词 accomplishment"],["attain","əˈteɪn","v. 达到，获得","attain a goal","达到目标",""],["fulfill","fʊlˈfɪl","v. 实现；履行","fulfill a dream","实现梦想","英式 fulfil"],["excel","ɪkˈsɛl","v. 擅长，出类拔萃","excel in sports","擅长体育","excellent 的动词"],["thrive","θraɪv","v. 茁壮成长，兴旺","thrive on challenges","在挑战中成长",""],["flourish","ˈflərɪʃ","v. 繁荣；茁壮成长","business flourishes","生意兴隆","flor = 花"],["prosper","ˈprɑspər","v. 繁荣，成功","the town prospered","小镇繁荣起来","名词 prosperity"],["outstanding","ˌaʊtˈstændɪŋ","adj. 杰出的；未解决的","an outstanding student","优秀的学生","stand out 突出"],["prominent","ˈprɑmən(ə)nt","adj. 著名的；突出的","a prominent scientist","著名科学家",""],["distinguished","dəˈstɪŋɡwɪʃt","adj. 卓越的，杰出的","a distinguished career","卓越的职业生涯",""],["renowned","rəˈnaʊnd","adj. 著名的","be renowned for","因…而著名","名词 renown"],["prestige","prɛˈsti(d)ʒ","n. 声望，威信","gain prestige","赢得声望","形容词 prestigious"],["reputation","ˌrɛpjəˈteɪʃən","n. 名声，名誉","a good reputation","好名声",""],["glory","ˈɡlɔri","n. 荣耀","win glory","赢得荣耀","形容词 glorious"]]},{"t":"解决问题","e":"Solutions","s":[["Traffic is the main [issue] in our town, and each new road adds a [complication].","交通是我们镇的主要问题，每修一条新路又会带来新的麻烦。"],["The problem is [urgent], and the mayor has made it a [priority].","这个问题很紧迫，市长已把它列为优先事项。"],["How should we [tackle] it?","我们该如何应对？"],["First, [address] the cause: too many cars.","首先要针对根源：车太多了。"],["People cannot [cope] with two-hour journeys, and the old bridge cannot [handle] the load.","人们受不了两个小时的路程，那座旧桥也承受不了这样的负荷。"],["One [approach] is a new subway.","一种办法是修新地铁。"],["An [alternative] is more buses; a third [option] is bike lanes.","另一种替代方案是增加公交车；第三种选择是修自行车道。"],["Is a subway [feasible]?","地铁可行吗？"],["Is it financially [viable]?","经济上行得通吗？"],["Buses are more [practical].","公交车更实际。"],["As a short-term [measure], the town will charge for parking.","作为一项短期措施，镇上将收取停车费。"],["This is no complete [remedy].","这并不是彻底的解决办法。"],["To [resolve] the problem, we must [eliminate] bottlenecks.","要解决这个问题，我们必须消除瓶颈。"],["We cannot [eradicate] traffic, but we can [curb] it.","我们无法根除交通拥堵，但可以加以控制。"]],"g":[["traffic","交通"],["adds","增加"],["mayor","市长"],["cause","原因"],["journeys","路程"],["bridge","桥"],["load","负荷"],["subway","地铁"],["lanes","车道"],["financially","经济上"],["short-term","短期的"],["charge","收费"],["parking","停车"],["bottlenecks","瓶颈"]],"w":[["issue","ˈɪʃu","n. 问题；（报刊）期 v. 发布","a key issue","关键问题",""],["complication","ˌkɑmpləˈkeɪʃən","n. 使复杂化的难题；并发症","a further complication","新的麻烦","形容词 complicated"],["urgent","ˈərdʒənt","adj. 紧急的","an urgent need","迫切的需要","名词 urgency"],["priority","praɪˈɔrədi","n. 优先事项","a top priority","头等大事",""],["tackle","ˈtæk(ə)l","v. 处理，对付","tackle a problem","解决问题",""],["address","ˈæˌdrɛs","v. 处理；向…讲话 n. 地址","address an issue","处理问题",""],["cope","koʊp","v. 应付","cope with stress","应对压力","固定搭配 with"],["handle","ˈhændəl","v. 处理 n. 把手","handle a complaint","处理投诉",""],["approach","əˈproʊtʃ","n. 方法 v. 接近","a new approach to","…的新方法",""],["alternative","ɔlˈtərnədɪv","n. 替代选择 adj. 替代的","an alternative to","…的替代品","alter 改变"],["option","ˈɑpʃən","n. 选择","have no option","别无选择","形容词 optional"],["feasible","ˈfizəb(ə)l","adj. 可行的","a feasible plan","可行的计划","名词 feasibility"],["viable","ˈvaɪəb(ə)l","adj. 可行的；能存活的","a viable option","可行的选择",""],["practical","ˈpræktək(ə)l","adj. 实际的，实用的","practical advice","实用的建议",""],["measure","ˈmɛʒər","n. 措施 v. 测量","take measures","采取措施",""],["remedy","ˈrɛmədi","n. 解决办法；药物 v. 补救","a remedy for","…的解决办法",""],["resolve","rəˈzɔlv","v. 解决；决心","resolve a conflict","解决冲突","名词 resolution"],["eliminate","əˈlɪməˌneɪt","v. 消除，淘汰","eliminate poverty","消除贫困",""],["eradicate","əˈrædəˌkeɪt","v. 根除","eradicate a disease","根除疾病","radic = 根"],["curb","kərb","v./n. 抑制，控制","curb inflation","抑制通货膨胀",""]]},{"t":"比较与差异","e":"Comparison","s":[["People love to [compare] twins.","人们喜欢比较双胞胎。"],["In [contrast] to most brothers, Li and Lei [resemble] each other closely.","与大多数兄弟不同，李和雷长得非常像。"],["The [similarity] is striking: their faces are almost [identical], and their test scores are [equivalent].","相似之处很惊人：他们的脸几乎一模一样，考试成绩也相当。"],["Yet they have [distinct] characters, and friends can easily [distinguish] them.","但他们的性格截然不同，朋友们很容易把他们区分开。"],["They [differ] in taste, and their moods [vary].","他们品味不同，情绪也各有变化。"],["Li wears a [uniform] style; Lei does not.","李的穿衣风格始终如一，雷则不然。"],["Li is [consistent]; Lei's actions rarely [correspond] to his words.","李言行一致；雷的行动很少与他说的话相符。"],["Neither is [superior] or [inferior].","两人没有高下之分。"],["Lei's sales [exceed] Li's, but Li's patience [surpasses] his brother's.","雷的销售额超过李，但李的耐心胜过弟弟。"],["Success is [relative].","成功是相对的。"],["Their skills are not [comparable]; each is the other's [counterpart], not his copy.","他们的本领无法相提并论；每个人都是另一个的对应者，而不是复制品。"]],"g":[["twins","双胞胎"],["closely","紧密地"],["striking","惊人的"],["scores","成绩"],["characters","性格"],["taste","品味"],["moods","情绪"],["style","风格"],["rarely","很少"],["sales","销售额"],["patience","耐心"],["skills","本领"],["copy","复制品"]],"w":[["compare","kəmˈpɛr","v. 比较","compare A with B","把 A 与 B 比较","名词 comparison"],["contrast","ˈkɑnˌtræst","n. 对比 v. 对照","in contrast to","与…形成对比",""],["resemble","rəˈzɛmb(ə)l","v. 像，与…相似","resemble one's father","长得像父亲","名词 resemblance"],["similarity","ˌsɪməˈlɛrədi","n. 相似（之处）","a striking similarity","惊人的相似","形容词 similar"],["identical","aɪˈdɛn(t)ək(ə)l","adj. 完全相同的","identical twins","同卵双胞胎",""],["equivalent","əˈkwɪv(ə)lənt","adj. 相等的 n. 对等物","be equivalent to","相当于","equi- 相等 + val 价值"],["distinct","dəˈstɪŋ(k)t","adj. 截然不同的；清楚的","be distinct from","与…截然不同",""],["distinguish","dəˈstɪŋɡwɪʃ","v. 区分","distinguish A from B","区分 A 和 B",""],["differ","ˈdɪfər","v. 不同","differ from","与…不同","名词 difference"],["vary","ˈvɛri","v. 变化，不同","vary from person to person","因人而异","名词 variety"],["uniform","ˈjunəˌfɔrm","adj. 一致的 n. 制服","a uniform standard","统一标准","uni- 一 + form 形式"],["consistent","kənˈsɪst(ə)nt","adj. 一贯的，一致的","be consistent with","与…一致","名词 consistency"],["correspond","ˌkɔrəˈspɑnd","v. 相符；通信","correspond to","与…相符",""],["superior","səˈpɪriər","adj. 更好的，上级的","be superior to","优于","用 to，不用 than"],["inferior","ɪnˈfɪriər","adj. 较差的，下级的","be inferior to","不如","用 to，不用 than"],["exceed","ɪkˈsid","v. 超过","exceed the limit","超过限度",""],["surpass","sərˈpæs","v. 超越，胜过","surpass expectations","超出预期",""],["relative","ˈrɛlədɪv","adj. 相对的 n. 亲戚","relative to","相对于","副词 relatively"],["comparable","ˈkɑmp(ə)rəb(ə)l","adj. 可比较的，类似的","be comparable to","可与…相比",""],["counterpart","ˈkaʊn(t)ərˌpɑrt","n. 对应的人或物","his French counterpart","与他对等的法方人员",""]]},{"t":"规则与许可","e":"Rules","s":[["Every lab has safety [regulations].","每个实验室都有安全规章。"],["A written [guideline] hangs on the wall, and each test follows a [standard].","墙上挂着书面的指导准则，每项测试都遵循一个标准。"],["The first [criterion] is safety.","第一条准则是安全。"],["Training is [mandatory]; extra courses are [voluntary].","培训是强制性的，额外的课程是自愿的。"],["You need a [permit] to enter, a [license] to use the laser, and a [certificate] in first aid.","进入实验室需要许可证，使用激光需要执照，还要有急救证书。"],["Only the director can [authorize] night work, and students need written [consent].","只有主任可以批准夜间工作，学生需要书面同意书。"],["The rules [prohibit] food.","规定禁止带食物。"],["They [forbid] working alone, and they [ban] phones near the machines.","禁止单独工作，禁止在机器附近使用手机。"],["Everyone must [obey].","人人都必须遵守。"],["New staff soon [conform], and visitors must [abide] by the same rules.","新员工很快就会适应，来访者也必须遵守同样的规则。"],["The director is [strict] but not [rigid]: working hours are [flexible].","主任很严格，但并不死板：工作时间是灵活的。"]],"g":[["lab","实验室"],["safety","安全"],["written","书面的"],["hangs","悬挂"],["follows","遵循"],["training","培训"],["extra","额外的"],["enter","进入"],["laser","激光"],["first aid","急救"],["director","主任"],["alone","单独"],["machines","机器"],["staff","员工"],["visitors","来访者"]],"w":[["regulation","ˌrɛɡ(j)əˈleɪʃən","n. 规章，条例","safety regulations","安全规章","动词 regulate"],["guideline","ˈɡaɪdˌlaɪn","n. 指导方针","follow the guidelines","遵循准则","guide + line"],["standard","ˈstændərd","n. 标准 adj. 标准的","meet the standard","达到标准",""],["criterion","kraɪˈtɪriən","n. 标准，准则","the main criterion","主要标准","复数 criteria"],["mandatory","ˈmændəˌtɔri","adj. 强制的","mandatory training","强制培训","近义 compulsory"],["voluntary","ˈvɑlənˌtɛri","adj. 自愿的","voluntary work","志愿工作","volunteer 志愿者"],["permit","ˈpərmɪt","n. 许可证 v. 允许","a work permit","工作许可证","名词 permission"],["license","ˈlaɪsn(t)s","n. 执照，许可证","a driver's license","驾照","英式名词 licence"],["certificate","sərˈtɪfəkət","n. 证书","a birth certificate","出生证明",""],["authorize","ˈɔθəˌraɪz","v. 授权，批准","authorize a payment","批准付款","authority 权力"],["consent","kənˈsɛnt","n./v. 同意","give one's consent","表示同意",""],["prohibit","prəˈhɪbət","v. 禁止","prohibit smoking","禁止吸烟","prohibit sb from doing"],["forbid","fərˈbɪd","v. 禁止","forbid sb to do","禁止某人做","forbid – forbade – forbidden"],["ban","bæn","v./n. 禁止，禁令","ban smoking","禁烟","a ban on …的禁令"],["obey","əˈbeɪ","v. 遵守，服从","obey the rules","遵守规则","名词 obedience"],["conform","kənˈfɔrm","v. 遵守；符合","conform to the rules","遵守规定",""],["abide","əˈbaɪd","v. 遵守；忍受","abide by the law","遵守法律","固定搭配 by"],["strict","strɪk(t)","adj. 严格的","strict rules","严格的规定",""],["rigid","ˈrɪdʒəd","adj. 死板的；坚硬的","rigid rules","死板的规定",""],["flexible","ˈflɛksəb(ə)l","adj. 灵活的；柔韧的","flexible working hours","弹性工作时间","名词 flexibility"]]},{"t":"信息与证据","e":"Evidence","s":[["A good reporter asks for [evidence].","好记者会要求拿出证据。"],["Without [proof], a story is only a rumor.","没有证明，一篇报道只是谣言。"],["She checks each [source]: is it [reliable]?","她核查每一个消息来源：它可靠吗？"],["Are the numbers [accurate] and the dates [precise]?","数字准确吗，日期精确吗？"],["Is the photo [genuine] or [fake]?","照片是真的还是假的？"],["Some people [distort] facts; a few [fabricate] quotes to [mislead] readers.","有些人歪曲事实，少数人捏造引语来误导读者。"],["Officials may [conceal] bad news and mark a report [confidential].","官员可能隐瞒坏消息，把一份报告标为机密。"],["Then an insider may [disclose] it.","然后可能有知情人把它披露出来。"],["Last year a leaked file [revealed] hidden costs and [exposed] a senior manager.","去年，一份泄露的文件揭示了隐藏的成本，并使一名高级经理曝光。"],["The reporter kept every [document] in a private [archive].","这位记者把每份文件都保存在私人档案里。"],["It took months to [compile] the data and one page to [summarize] it.","汇编这些数据花了几个月，概括它只用了一页纸。"]],"g":[["reporter","记者"],["story","报道"],["rumor","谣言"],["checks","核查"],["dates","日期"],["facts","事实"],["quotes","引语"],["officials","官员"],["mark","标记"],["insider","知情人"],["leaked","泄露的"],["hidden","隐藏的"],["costs","成本"],["senior","高级的"],["private","私人的"]],"w":[["evidence","ˈɛvəd(ə)n(t)s","n. 证据","strong evidence","有力的证据","不可数；形容词 evident"],["proof","pruf","n. 证明，证据","proof of identity","身份证明","动词 prove"],["source","sɔrs","n. 来源；消息来源","a reliable source","可靠的消息来源",""],["reliable","rəˈlaɪəb(ə)l","adj. 可靠的","reliable information","可靠的信息","rely + -able"],["accurate","ˈækjərət","adj. 准确的","an accurate description","准确的描述","名词 accuracy"],["precise","priˈsaɪs","adj. 精确的","to be precise","确切地说","名词 precision"],["genuine","ˈdʒɛnjəwən","adj. 真正的；真诚的","genuine leather","真皮",""],["fake","feɪk","adj. 假的 n. 假货 v. 伪造","fake news","假新闻",""],["distort","dəˈstɔrt","v. 歪曲；使变形","distort the truth","歪曲事实","名词 distortion"],["fabricate","ˈfæbrəˌkeɪt","v. 捏造；制造","fabricate evidence","伪造证据",""],["mislead","ˌmɪsˈlid","v. 误导","mislead the public","误导公众","mis- 错 + lead"],["conceal","kənˈsil","v. 隐藏，隐瞒","conceal the truth","隐瞒真相",""],["confidential","ˌkɑnfəˈdɛn(t)ʃ(ə)l","adj. 机密的","confidential information","机密信息","别混 confident 自信的"],["disclose","dəˈskloʊz","v. 披露，透露","disclose details","披露细节","dis- 不 + close 关"],["reveal","rəˈvil","v. 揭示，透露","reveal a secret","泄露秘密","名词 revelation"],["expose","ɪkˈspoʊz","v. 揭露；使暴露","expose a scandal","揭露丑闻","be exposed to 接触"],["document","ˈdɑkjəmənt","n. 文件 v. 记录","a legal document","法律文件",""],["archive","ˈɑrˌkaɪv","n. 档案（馆）v. 存档","the national archives","国家档案馆","ch 读 k"],["compile","kəmˈpaɪl","v. 汇编，编写","compile a report","编写报告",""],["summarize","ˈsəməˌraɪz","v. 总结，概括","summarize the main points","概括要点","名词 summary"]]},{"t":"权力与影响","e":"Power","s":[["Power is the ability to [influence] others.","权力就是影响他人的能力。"],["A leader's words have an [impact]; a tyrant must [exert] force.","领导者的话语有影响力；暴君则必须动用武力。"],["He [manipulates] the media and builds a [dominant] party.","他操纵媒体，建立一个占主导地位的政党。"],["Generals [command] the army.","将军们指挥军队。"],["Such a [regime] depends on one [dictator].","这样的政权依赖一个独裁者。"],["Under [tyranny], the police [oppress] the poor and [suppress] every protest.","在暴政之下，警察压迫穷人，镇压每一次抗议。"],["People are told to [submit].","人们被要求服从。"],["A small circle enjoys [privilege]; this [elite] guards its [status].","一个小圈子享有特权；这些精英守护着自己的地位。"],["Promotion depends on [rank], and each [subordinate] fears his boss.","晋升取决于级别，每个下属都害怕上司。"],["Democracy works differently.","民主的运作方式不同。"],["It tries to [empower] citizens: the law [entitles] everyone to speak.","它努力赋予公民权力：法律使每个人都有权发言。"],["When enough people speak, they can [overwhelm] any ruler.","当足够多的人发声时，他们能压倒任何统治者。"]],"g":[["ability","能力"],["leader","领导者"],["tyrant","暴君"],["force","武力"],["media","媒体"],["party","政党"],["generals","将军"],["army","军队"],["police","警察"],["circle","圈子"],["guards","守护"],["promotion","晋升"],["fears","害怕"],["democracy","民主"],["citizens","公民"],["ruler","统治者"]],"w":[["influence","ˈɪnflʊən(t)s","n./v. 影响","have an influence on","对…有影响","形容词 influential"],["impact","ɪmˈpæk(t)","n./v. 影响；冲击","have an impact on","对…产生影响",""],["exert","ɪɡˈzərt","v. 施加（影响、压力）","exert pressure on","对…施压",""],["manipulate","məˈnɪpjəˌleɪt","v. 操纵；熟练操作","manipulate public opinion","操纵舆论","mani = 手"],["dominant","ˈdɑmənənt","adj. 占主导地位的","a dominant position","主导地位","动词 dominate"],["command","kəˈmænd","v./n. 指挥；命令；掌握","be in command of","指挥",""],["regime","reɪˈʒim","n. 政权；制度","a military regime","军政权","来自法语"],["dictator","ˈdɪkˌteɪdər","n. 独裁者","a military dictator","军事独裁者","dict = 说 → 说了算的人"],["tyranny","ˈtɪrəni","n. 暴政","live under tyranny","生活在暴政下","tyrant 暴君"],["oppress","əˈprɛs","v. 压迫","oppress the poor","压迫穷人","名词 oppression"],["suppress","səˈprɛs","v. 镇压；抑制","suppress a protest","镇压抗议","sup- 下 + press 压"],["submit","səbˈmɪt","v. 服从；提交","submit a report","提交报告","名词 submission"],["privilege","ˈprɪv(ə)lɪdʒ","n. 特权；荣幸","enjoy a privilege","享有特权",""],["elite","ɪˈlit","n. 精英 adj. 精英的","the social elite","社会精英",""],["status","ˈsteɪdəs","n. 地位；状态","social status","社会地位",""],["rank","ræŋk","n. 等级，军衔 v. 排名","a high rank","高级别",""],["subordinate","səˈbɔrdənət","n. 下属 adj. 从属的","treat subordinates fairly","公平对待下属","sub- 下 + ordin 顺序"],["empower","ɪmˈpaʊər","v. 授权，使有能力","empower women","赋予女性权力","em- + power"],["entitle","ɪnˈtaɪd(ə)l","v. 使有权利；给…命名","be entitled to","有权享有",""],["overwhelm","ˌoʊvərˈ(h)wɛlm","v. 压倒；使不知所措","be overwhelmed by work","被工作压得喘不过气","形容词 overwhelming"]]},{"t":"冲突与合作","e":"Conflict","s":[["The [conflict] between the two departments began with a small [clash] over budgets.","两个部门之间的冲突始于一次关于预算的小争执。"],["Nobody wanted to [confront] the problem.","没有人愿意正视这个问题。"],["Then one manager [offended] the other in a meeting.","后来一位经理在会上冒犯了另一位。"],["It was a public [insult], meant to [humiliate] him.","那是一次当众侮辱，意在羞辱他。"],["He wanted [revenge] and soon [retaliated].","他想报复，很快就进行了反击。"],["The [hostility] spread, and each side held a [grudge].","敌意蔓延开来，双方都怀恨在心。"],["Finally the director called a [truce] and asked them to [settle] the matter.","最后主任要求休战，让他们把事情解决。"],["Each made one [concession].","双方各作了一个让步。"],["They agreed to [cooperate] on a new product and to [collaborate] on training.","他们同意在一款新产品上合作，并在培训方面协作。"],["The [partnership] worked.","这种合作关系奏效了。"],["A shared deadline can [unite] people.","共同的截止日期能把人团结起来。"],["Now there is real [solidarity], good [teamwork], and even [rapport] between the two managers.","现在两位经理之间有了真正的团结、良好的团队合作，甚至还有融洽的关系。"]],"g":[["departments","部门"],["budgets","预算"],["manager","经理"],["public","当众的"],["meant to","意在"],["spread","蔓延"],["side","一方"],["director","主任"],["matter","事情"],["agreed","同意"],["product","产品"],["training","培训"],["shared","共同的"],["deadline","截止日期"]],"w":[["conflict","kənˈflɪk(t)","n./v. 冲突","come into conflict with","与…发生冲突",""],["clash","klæʃ","n./v. 冲突，争执","a clash of opinions","意见冲突",""],["confront","kənˈfrənt","v. 面对，对抗","confront a problem","正视问题","名词 confrontation"],["offend","əˈfɛnd","v. 冒犯；违法","offend a customer","冒犯顾客","形容词 offensive"],["insult","ˈɪnˌsəlt","n./v. 侮辱","an insult to","对…的侮辱","作动词重音在后"],["humiliate","(h)juˈmɪliˌeɪt","v. 羞辱","humiliate sb in public","当众羞辱某人","名词 humiliation"],["revenge","rəˈvɛndʒ","n./v. 报复","take revenge on","向…报仇",""],["retaliate","rəˈtæliˌeɪt","v. 报复，反击","retaliate against","对…进行报复",""],["hostility","hɑˈstɪlədi","n. 敌意","open hostility","公开的敌意","形容词 hostile"],["grudge","ɡrədʒ","n. 怨恨 v. 不情愿给","hold a grudge","怀恨在心",""],["truce","trus","n. 休战","call a truce","宣布休战",""],["settle","ˈsɛd(ə)l","v. 解决；定居；安顿","settle a dispute","解决争端","settle down 安定下来"],["concession","kənˈsɛʃən","n. 让步","make a concession","作出让步","动词 concede"],["cooperate","koʊˈɑpəˌreɪt","v. 合作，配合","cooperate with the police","配合警方","名词 cooperation"],["collaborate","kəˈlæbəˌreɪt","v. 协作，合作","collaborate on a project","合作完成项目","co- + labor 劳动"],["partnership","ˈpɑrtnərˌʃɪp","n. 合作关系","in partnership with","与…合作","partner + -ship"],["unite","juˈnaɪt","v. 联合，团结","unite against","联合起来对抗","uni = 一"],["solidarity","ˌsɑləˈdɛrədi","n. 团结","show solidarity with","声援","solid 坚固的"],["teamwork","ˈtimˌwərk","n. 团队合作","good teamwork","良好的团队合作",""],["rapport","ræˈpɔr","n. 融洽的关系","build rapport with","与…建立融洽关系","t 不发音"]]},{"t":"开始与结束","e":"Beginnings","s":[["The meeting will [commence] at nine.","会议将于九点开始。"],["The chair will [initiate] the discussion with a short history: the idea [originated] ten years ago, when the city [established] a small fund.","主席将以一段简短的历史回顾来启动讨论：这个想法起源于十年前，当时市里设立了一笔小额基金。"],["Later we [embarked] on a larger plan and [undertook] three studies.","后来我们着手一个更大的计划，并承担了三项研究。"],["We may now [proceed] to the next stage.","我们现在可以进入下一阶段。"],["Research is [ongoing]; the first [phase] ended in May.","研究仍在进行中；第一阶段已在五月结束。"],["Work was [suspended] twice.","工作曾两次暂停。"],["Bad weather [interrupted] it, and a strike brought it to a [halt].","恶劣天气打断了它，一场罢工又使它陷入停顿。"],["Funding will [cease] in June, so we must not [terminate] contracts early or [abandon] the site.","资金将在六月终止，所以我们不能提前终止合同，也不能放弃那块场地。"],["The city may [discontinue] its support when the agreement [expires].","协议到期后，市里可能会停止支持。"],["To [conclude]: let us [finalize] the budget today and [complete] the report this week.","最后：让我们今天敲定预算，本周完成报告。"]],"g":[["chair","主席"],["discussion","讨论"],["fund","基金"],["studies","研究"],["stage","阶段"],["research","研究"],["twice","两次"],["strike","罢工"],["funding","资金"],["contracts","合同"],["site","场地"],["support","支持"],["agreement","协议"],["budget","预算"]],"w":[["commence","kəˈmɛn(t)s","v. 开始","commence at nine","九点开始","比 begin 正式"],["initiate","ɪˈnɪʃiˌeɪt","v. 发起，开始","initiate a project","启动项目","名词 initiative 主动性"],["originate","əˈrɪdʒəˌneɪt","v. 起源","originate in China","起源于中国","origin 起源"],["establish","əˈstæblɪʃ","v. 建立，设立","establish a company","创办公司","名词 establishment"],["embark","əmˈbɑrk","v. 着手；上船","embark on a journey","踏上旅程","固定搭配 on"],["undertake","ˌəndərˈteɪk","v. 承担，着手做","undertake a task","承担任务","undertake – undertook – undertaken"],["proceed","prəˈsid","v. 继续进行；前进","proceed with the plan","继续执行计划","名词 procedure 程序"],["ongoing","ˈɔnˌɡoʊɪŋ","adj. 进行中的","an ongoing project","进行中的项目","go on 的形容词"],["phase","feɪz","n. 阶段","the first phase","第一阶段",""],["suspend","səˈspɛnd","v. 暂停；悬挂；停职","suspend a service","暂停服务","名词 suspension"],["interrupt","ˌɪn(t)əˈrəpt","v. 打断","interrupt a speaker","打断发言者","inter- + rupt 断"],["halt","hɔlt","n./v. 停止","come to a halt","停下来",""],["cease","sis","v. 停止","cease fire","停火",""],["terminate","ˈtɛrməˌneɪt","v. 终止","terminate a contract","终止合同","terminal 终点"],["abandon","əˈbændən","v. 放弃；抛弃","abandon a plan","放弃计划",""],["discontinue","ˌdɪskənˈtɪnju","v. 停止，中断","discontinue a product","停产","dis- + continue"],["expire","ɪkˈspaɪ(ə)r","v. 到期；断气","the visa expires","签证到期","名词 expiration"],["conclude","kənˈklud","v. 结束；得出结论","conclude a speech","结束演讲","名词 conclusion"],["finalize","ˈfaɪnəˌlaɪz","v. 最终确定","finalize the details","敲定细节","final + -ize"],["complete","kəmˈplit","v. 完成 adj. 完整的","complete a task","完成任务","名词 completion"]]},{"t":"调整与改变","e":"Change","s":[["Small shops must change to survive.","小店必须改变才能生存。"],["Mr. Hu began to [alter] his bakery last year.","胡先生去年开始改造他的面包店。"],["He [modified] the menu, [adjusted] prices, and [adapted] old recipes to new tastes.","他修改了菜单，调整了价格，并把老配方改得适应新口味。"],["He [amended] the opening hours and [revised] his business plan.","他修改了营业时间，修订了经营计划。"],["A designer [transformed] the dark room, and the storeroom was [converted] into a café.","一位设计师彻底改造了昏暗的房间，储藏室被改成了咖啡角。"],["Customers' habits [evolve], he says, and the [transition] to online orders was hard.","他说，顾客的习惯在演变，向网上订单的过渡很艰难。"],["He had to [reform] the way he worked and [overhaul] the kitchen.","他不得不改革自己的工作方式，对厨房进行彻底翻修。"],["New ovens [reshaped] the daily routine.","新烤箱重塑了每天的日程。"],["He [replaced] sugar with honey, [substituted] oil for butter, and [switched] to paper bags.","他用蜂蜜代替了糖，用油替代黄油，并改用纸袋。"],["He will [renew] the lease, [update] the website, and keep trying to [innovate].","他会续签租约，更新网站，并不断尝试创新。"],["Every spring he likes to [refresh] the window display.","每年春天他都喜欢把橱窗陈列翻新一下。"]],"g":[["survive","生存"],["bakery","面包店"],["menu","菜单"],["recipes","配方"],["tastes","口味"],["designer","设计师"],["storeroom","储藏室"],["habits","习惯"],["orders","订单"],["routine","日程"],["honey","蜂蜜"],["butter","黄油"],["lease","租约"],["website","网站"],["display","陈列"]],"w":[["alter","ˈɔltər","v. 改变，改动","alter a plan","改变计划","名词 alteration"],["modify","ˈmɑdəˌfaɪ","v. 修改，调整","modify a design","修改设计","名词 modification"],["adjust","əˈdʒəst","v. 调整；适应","adjust to a new life","适应新生活","名词 adjustment"],["adapt","əˈdæpt","v. 适应；改编","adapt to changes","适应变化","别混 adopt 采纳"],["amend","əˈmɛnd","v. 修正（法律、文件）","amend a law","修正法律","名词 amendment"],["revise","rəˈvaɪz","v. 修订；复习","revise a plan","修订计划","名词 revision"],["transform","træn(t)sˈfɔrm","v. 彻底改变","transform a city","彻底改变一座城市","trans- + form"],["convert","kənˈvərt","v. 转换，改造","convert A into B","把 A 改造成 B","名词 conversion"],["evolve","əˈvɔlv","v. 进化，逐步发展","evolve over time","随时间演变","名词 evolution"],["transition","trænˈzɪʃən","n. 过渡，转变","a transition period","过渡期",""],["reform","rəˈfɔrm","v./n. 改革","economic reform","经济改革","re- + form"],["overhaul","ˌoʊvərˈhɔl","v./n. 彻底检修；全面改革","overhaul the system","全面改革制度",""],["reshape","riˈʃeɪp","v. 重塑","reshape the industry","重塑行业","re- + shape"],["replace","rəˈpleɪs","v. 取代，替换","replace A with B","用 B 替换 A","名词 replacement"],["substitute","ˈsəbstəˌtut","v. 用…代替 n. 替代品","substitute A for B","用 A 代替 B","注意和 replace 的介词相反"],["switch","swɪtʃ","v. 转换，切换 n. 开关","switch to","改用",""],["renew","rəˈnu","v. 续签；更新","renew a contract","续签合同","名词 renewal"],["update","ˌəpˈdeɪt","v./n. 更新","update the software","更新软件",""],["innovate","ˈɪnəˌveɪt","v. 创新","innovate constantly","不断创新","名词 innovation"],["refresh","rəˈfrɛʃ","v. 使焕然一新；提神","refresh one's memory","唤起记忆","refreshing 提神的"]]},{"t":"风险与安全","e":"Safety","s":[["The storm was a real [threat].","这场风暴是真正的威胁。"],["Fishermen know the [peril] of the sea; going out that night was [risky], even [reckless].","渔民们深知大海的凶险；那晚出海很冒险，甚至可以说鲁莽。"],["One captain did not want to [jeopardize] his boat or [endanger] his crew.","一位船长不想让自己的船陷入危险，也不想危及船员。"],["Long [exposure] to cold can kill.","长时间暴露在寒冷中会致命。"],["At six, the coast guard sent an [alert].","六点钟，海岸警卫队发出了警报。"],["The [alarm] sounded in the harbor, but one boat had missed the [warning].","港口响起了警报声，但有一条船没收到警告。"],["At midnight it sent an [emergency] signal.","午夜时它发出了紧急信号。"],["A [rescue] team set out at once.","一支救援队立刻出发。"],["All five men [survived].","五个人全部幸存。"],["They had [escaped] onto a rock and found [refuge] in a cave.","他们逃到一块礁石上，在一个山洞里找到了避难处。"],["Since then the village has tried to [secure] the harbor.","从那以后，村子一直设法让港口更安全。"],["A new wall will [safeguard] the boats and [shield] the houses.","一道新的防波墙将保护船只，遮挡房屋。"],["Volunteers [guard] the coast, and the old lighthouse still [defends] them all.","志愿者守卫着海岸，那座老灯塔仍然保卫着所有人。"]],"g":[["storm","风暴"],["fishermen","渔民"],["captain","船长"],["crew","船员"],["coast guard","海岸警卫队"],["sounded","响起"],["harbor","港口"],["missed","错过"],["midnight","午夜"],["set out","出发"],["rock","礁石"],["cave","山洞"],["volunteers","志愿者"],["lighthouse","灯塔"]],"w":[["threat","θrɛt","n. 威胁","pose a threat to","对…构成威胁","动词 threaten"],["peril","ˈpɛrəl","n. 危险","in peril","处于危险中","形容词 perilous"],["risky","ˈrɪski","adj. 有风险的","a risky investment","有风险的投资","risk + -y"],["reckless","ˈrɛkləs","adj. 鲁莽的","reckless driving","鲁莽驾驶",""],["jeopardize","ˈdʒɛpərˌdaɪz","v. 危及","jeopardize one's career","危及事业","名词 jeopardy"],["endanger","ɪnˈdeɪndʒər","v. 危及","endanger lives","危及生命","endangered species 濒危物种"],["exposure","ɪkˈspoʊʒər","n. 暴露；曝光","exposure to the sun","日晒","动词 expose"],["alert","əˈlərt","n. 警报 adj. 警觉的 v. 提醒","be on the alert","保持警惕",""],["alarm","əˈlɑrm","n. 警报；惊慌 v. 使惊慌","a fire alarm","火警","alarm clock 闹钟"],["warning","ˈwɔrnɪŋ","n. 警告","give a warning","发出警告","动词 warn"],["emergency","əˈmərdʒən(t)si","n. 紧急情况","in an emergency","在紧急情况下","emergency exit 紧急出口"],["rescue","ˈrɛskju","v./n. 营救","come to the rescue","前来营救",""],["survive","sərˈvaɪv","v. 幸存；比…活得长","survive an accident","在事故中幸存","名词 survival"],["escape","əˈskeɪp","v./n. 逃脱","escape from prison","越狱",""],["refuge","ˈrɛfjudʒ","n. 避难（所）","take refuge in","在…避难","refugee 难民"],["secure","səˈkjʊr","v. 使安全；获得 adj. 安全的","secure a loan","获得贷款","名词 security"],["safeguard","ˈseɪfˌɡɑrd","v. 保护 n. 保障措施","safeguard our rights","保护我们的权利","safe + guard"],["shield","ʃild","v. 保护，遮挡 n. 盾牌","shield one's eyes","遮住眼睛",""],["guard","ɡɑrd","v. 守卫 n. 警卫","guard the gate","守门",""],["defend","dəˈfɛnd","v. 保卫；辩护","defend one's country","保卫国家","名词 defense"]]},{"t":"账目与利润","e":"Accounts","s":[["Does the café make a [profit]?","这家咖啡馆赚钱吗？"],["Last year it made a [loss].","去年它亏损了。"],["Its [turnover] was high, but [earnings] were low.","营业额很高，但收益很低。"],["[Gross] income looks good; [net] income is what remains after every [expense].","总收入看起来不错；净收入是扣除每一项开支后剩下的部分。"],["Rent and power are the main [overhead].","房租和电费是主要的经常性开支。"],["The owner keeps each [receipt] and records every [payment].","店主保留每一张收据，记录每一笔付款。"],["The new oven is paid by [installment].","新烤箱是分期付款买的。"],["At the end of the month she checks the [balance] of her bank [account], and she writes a [quarterly] report.","月底她会查看银行账户的余额，并写一份季度报告。"],["She took a bank [loan] last spring.","去年春天她办了一笔银行贷款。"],["Her [credit] is good and the [interest] is low, but the [lender] is strict: if she should [default], she would lose the shop.","她的信用良好，利息也低，但贷方很严格：如果她拖欠还款，就会失去这家店。"],["For now the business is [solvent].","目前这家店有偿付能力。"]],"g":[["income","收入"],["remains","剩下"],["rent","房租"],["power","电"],["owner","店主"],["records","记录"],["oven","烤箱"],["checks","查看"],["report","报告"],["strict","严格的"],["lose","失去"],["for now","目前"]],"w":[["profit","ˈprɑfət","n. 利润 v. 获利","make a profit","盈利","形容词 profitable"],["loss","lɔs","n. 亏损；损失","make a loss","亏损","动词 lose"],["turnover","ˈtərnˌoʊvər","n. 营业额；人员流动率","annual turnover","年营业额",""],["earnings","ˈərnɪŋz","n. 收益，收入","company earnings","公司收益","动词 earn"],["gross","ɡroʊs","adj. 总的，毛的","gross income","总收入","GDP 的 G"],["net","nɛt","adj. 净的 n. 网","net profit","净利润",""],["expense","ɪkˈspɛn(t)s","n. 费用，开支","travel expenses","差旅费","expensive 的名词"],["overhead","ˈoʊvərˌ(h)ɛd","n. 经常性开支 adj. 头顶上的","reduce overheads","减少日常开支",""],["receipt","rəˈsit","n. 收据","keep the receipt","保留收据","p 不发音"],["payment","ˈpeɪm(ə)nt","n. 付款","make a payment","付款",""],["installment","ɪnˈstɔlmənt","n. 分期付款；（连载的）一集","pay by installments","分期付款","英式 instalment"],["balance","ˈbælən(t)s","n. 余额；平衡 v. 平衡","check the balance","查余额",""],["account","əˈkaʊnt","n. 账户；描述 v. 解释","open an account","开户","account for 解释；占"],["quarterly","ˈkwɔrdərli","adj./adv. 季度的，每季度","a quarterly report","季度报告","quarter 四分之一"],["loan","loʊn","n. 贷款 v. 借出","take out a loan","办贷款",""],["credit","ˈkrɛdət","n. 信用；学分；赞扬","a credit card","信用卡",""],["interest","ˈɪnt(ə)rəst","n. 利息；兴趣；利益","an interest rate","利率",""],["lender","ˈlɛndər","n. 贷方，放款人","a mortgage lender","房贷放款机构","反义 borrower"],["default","dəˈfɔlt","v./n. 违约，拖欠；默认","default on a loan","拖欠贷款",""],["solvent","ˈsɑlv(ə)nt","adj. 有偿付能力的 n. 溶剂","remain solvent","保持偿付能力","反义 insolvent"]]},{"t":"数码设备","e":"Gadgets","s":[["My phone is the [device] I use most.","手机是我用得最多的设备。"],["It is a clever [gadget]: [portable], [compact], and [wireless].","它是个聪明的小玩意儿：便携、小巧、无线。"],["When the [signal] is weak or the [battery] is low, I feel lost, so I always carry a [charger].","信号弱或电池电量低时，我就不知所措，所以我总是带着充电器。"],["A [sensor] turns the screen when I move.","我一动，传感器就会旋转屏幕。"],["Inside, a tiny [chip] holds the [processor], and there is [storage] for ten thousand photos.","里面有一块微小的芯片装着处理器，还有能存一万张照片的存储空间。"],["The [hardware] is two years old, but the [software] is new.","硬件已经用了两年，但软件是新的。"],["I open one [application] to pay bills and another to learn English.","我打开一个应用付账单，打开另一个学英语。"],["A friend writes [programs] for a living.","一个朋友以写程序为生。"],["He says a single line of [code] with a [bug] can make the phone [crash].","他说，一行带漏洞的代码就能让手机死机。"],["His advice is always the same: [reboot] it.","他的建议永远一样：重启。"]],"g":[["clever","聪明的"],["weak","弱的"],["low","低的"],["lost","不知所措"],["carry","携带"],["screen","屏幕"],["tiny","微小的"],["holds","装着"],["bills","账单"],["for a living","谋生"],["single","单个的"],["advice","建议"]],"w":[["device","dəˈvaɪs","n. 设备，装置","a mobile device","移动设备",""],["gadget","ˈɡædʒət","n. 小器具，小玩意儿","a kitchen gadget","厨房小工具",""],["portable","ˈpɔrdəb(ə)l","adj. 便携的","a portable computer","便携电脑","port = 拿"],["compact","ˈkɑmˌpæk(t)","adj. 小巧的，紧凑的","a compact car","小型汽车",""],["wireless","ˈwaɪ(ə)rləs","adj. 无线的","a wireless network","无线网络","wire + -less"],["signal","ˈsɪɡn(ə)l","n. 信号 v. 发信号","a weak signal","信号弱",""],["battery","ˈbædəri","n. 电池","a low battery","电量低",""],["charger","ˈtʃɑrdʒər","n. 充电器","a phone charger","手机充电器","动词 charge"],["sensor","ˈsɛn(t)sər","n. 传感器","a motion sensor","运动传感器","sense 感觉"],["chip","tʃɪp","n. 芯片；薯片；碎片","a computer chip","电脑芯片",""],["processor","ˈprɑˌsɛsər","n. 处理器","a fast processor","高速处理器","动词 process"],["storage","ˈstɔrɪdʒ","n. 存储（空间）","storage space","存储空间","动词 store"],["hardware","ˈhɑrdˌwɛr","n. 硬件；五金","computer hardware","电脑硬件",""],["software","ˈsɔf(t)ˌwɛr","n. 软件","install software","安装软件","不可数"],["application","ˌæpləˈkeɪʃən","n. 应用程序；申请","a mobile application","手机应用","简称 app"],["program","ˈproʊˌɡræm","n. 程序；节目；计划 v. 编程","write a program","写程序","programmer 程序员"],["code","koʊd","n. 代码；密码；法典 v. 编码","write code","写代码",""],["bug","bəɡ","n. 程序错误；虫子","fix a bug","修复漏洞",""],["crash","kræʃ","v./n. 死机；撞车；暴跌","the system crashed","系统崩溃了",""],["reboot","ˌriˈbut","v./n. 重启","reboot the computer","重启电脑","re- + boot"]]},{"t":"人工智能","e":"AI","s":[["[Artificial] [intelligence] is no longer science fiction.","人工智能已不再是科幻小说。"],["A [robot] can walk, and a [neural] [network] can learn.","机器人能走路，神经网络能学习。"],["In the [digital] world, programs [simulate] the weather and [predict] traffic.","在数字世界里，程序模拟天气、预测交通。"],["Face [recognition] opens doors.","人脸识别能开门。"],["An [autonomous] car drives itself, and a [drone] delivers parcels.","自动驾驶汽车自己行驶，无人机投递包裹。"],["Every [pioneer] at this [frontier] has a [futuristic] dream.","这一前沿领域的每一位先驱都有一个充满未来感的梦想。"],["In one [scenario], machines do the dull work.","在一种设想中，机器承担枯燥的工作。"],["In another, they [disrupt] millions of jobs.","在另一种设想中，它们扰乱数百万个工作岗位。"],["The [pace] of change is fast.","变化的步伐很快。"],["Who will [govern] these systems?","谁来管理这些系统？"],["Without [oversight], experts warn, the tools may not serve [humanity].","专家警告说，如果没有监督，这些工具可能无法为人类服务。"]],"g":[["no longer","不再"],["science fiction","科幻小说"],["programs","程序"],["traffic","交通"],["delivers","投递"],["parcels","包裹"],["dull","枯燥的"],["millions","数百万"],["systems","系统"],["experts","专家"],["warn","警告"],["tools","工具"],["serve","服务"]],"w":[["artificial","ˌɑrdəˈfɪʃ(ə)l","adj. 人工的，人造的","artificial flowers","人造花","AI 的 A"],["intelligence","ɪnˈtɛlədʒ(ə)n(t)s","n. 智力；情报","human intelligence","人类智力","形容词 intelligent"],["robot","ˈroʊˌbɑt","n. 机器人","an industrial robot","工业机器人",""],["neural","ˈnʊr(ə)l","adj. 神经的","a neural network","神经网络","neur = 神经"],["network","ˈnɛtˌwərk","n. 网络 v. 建立人脉","a computer network","计算机网络",""],["digital","ˈdɪdʒədl","adj. 数字的，数码的","the digital age","数字时代",""],["simulate","ˈsɪmjəˌleɪt","v. 模拟","simulate a flight","模拟飞行","名词 simulation"],["predict","priˈdɪk(t)","v. 预测","predict the future","预测未来","pre- 预先 + dict 说"],["recognition","ˌrɛkəɡˈnɪʃən","n. 识别；认可","voice recognition","语音识别","动词 recognize"],["autonomous","ɔˈtɑnəməs","adj. 自主的；自治的","an autonomous vehicle","自动驾驶汽车","auto- 自己"],["drone","droʊn","n. 无人机","fly a drone","操控无人机",""],["pioneer","ˌpaɪəˈnɪr","n. 先驱 v. 开创","a pioneer in science","科学先驱",""],["frontier","ˌfrənˈtɪr","n. 前沿；边境","the frontiers of science","科学前沿","front 前面"],["futuristic","ˌfjutʃəˈrɪstɪk","adj. 未来派的，超前的","a futuristic design","充满未来感的设计","future + -istic"],["scenario","səˈnɛrioʊ","n. 设想，可能发生的情况","the worst-case scenario","最坏的情况",""],["disrupt","dɪsˈrəpt","v. 扰乱，打乱","disrupt a meeting","扰乱会议","dis- + rupt 断"],["pace","peɪs","n. 步伐，速度 v. 踱步","at a fast pace","快节奏地","keep pace with 跟上"],["govern","ˈɡəvərn","v. 管理，统治","govern a country","治理国家","government 的动词"],["oversight","ˈoʊvərˌsaɪt","n. 监督；疏忽","government oversight","政府监督",""],["humanity","hjuˈmænədi","n. 人类；人性","a crime against humanity","反人类罪","human + -ity"]]}],[{"t":"乘飞机","e":"Air Travel","s":[["Our [airline] sent a message: bring your [passport] and weigh your [baggage].","航空公司发来消息：带上护照，称一下行李。"],["[Boarding] began at seven.","七点开始登机。"],["The [cabin] was full, and I found my seat by the [aisle].","客舱坐满了，我在过道旁找到了座位。"],["A flight [attendant] asked us to fasten each [seatbelt].","一位空乘人员让我们系好安全带。"],["The [pilot] spoke calmly before [takeoff].","起飞前，飞行员平静地讲了话。"],["Over the mountains there was [turbulence], but the [landing] was smooth.","飞越山区时遇到了颠簸，但降落很平稳。"],["Then came a long [delay].","随后是长时间的延误。"],["Our [stopover] lasted six hours, and we had to [transfer] to another terminal and pass through [immigration].","我们中途停留了六个小时，还得转到另一个航站楼，并通过入境检查。"],["The plane needed [fuel], and a private [jet] was parked beside us.","飞机需要加油，一架私人喷气机停在我们旁边。"],["The [timetable] changed twice.","时刻表改了两次。"],["The airline apologized for the [inconvenience].","航空公司为带来的不便道了歉。"]],"g":[["message","消息"],["weigh","称重"],["seat","座位"],["flight","航班"],["fasten","系好"],["calmly","平静地"],["smooth","平稳的"],["lasted","持续"],["terminal","航站楼"],["private","私人的"],["parked","停放"],["apologized","道歉"]],"w":[["airline","ˈɛrˌlaɪn","n. 航空公司","a budget airline","廉价航空公司","air + line"],["passport","ˈpæsˌpɔrt","n. 护照","a valid passport","有效护照","pass + port 港口"],["baggage","ˈbæɡɪdʒ","n. 行李","baggage claim","行李提取处","不可数；英式 luggage"],["boarding","ˈbɔrdɪŋ","n. 登机，上船","a boarding pass","登机牌","动词 board"],["cabin","ˈkæbən","n. 客舱；小木屋","the cabin crew","机组乘务员",""],["aisle","aɪl","n. 过道","an aisle seat","靠过道的座位","s 不发音"],["attendant","əˈtɛnd(ə)nt","n. 服务员，乘务员","a flight attendant","空乘人员","动词 attend"],["seatbelt","ˈsitˌbɛlt","n. 安全带","fasten your seatbelt","系好安全带",""],["pilot","ˈpaɪlət","n. 飞行员 adj. 试点的","an airline pilot","民航飞行员","a pilot project 试点项目"],["takeoff","ˈteɪkˌɔf","n. 起飞","ready for takeoff","准备起飞","动词短语 take off"],["turbulence","ˈtərbjələn(t)s","n. 颠簸，湍流；动荡","air turbulence","气流颠簸","形容词 turbulent"],["landing","ˈlændɪŋ","n. 着陆，降落","an emergency landing","紧急迫降",""],["delay","dəˈleɪ","n./v. 延误，推迟","a two-hour delay","延误两小时",""],["stopover","ˈstɑpˌoʊvər","n. 中途停留","a stopover in Dubai","在迪拜中转停留","stop over 的名词"],["transfer","træn(t)sˈfər","v./n. 转乘；转移；调动","transfer to another flight","转乘另一航班","trans- 转移"],["immigration","ˌɪməˈɡreɪʃən","n. 入境检查；移民","go through immigration","过入境检查","动词 immigrate"],["fuel","ˈfju(ə)l","n. 燃料 v. 加燃料；刺激","run out of fuel","燃料耗尽",""],["jet","dʒɛt","n. 喷气式飞机；喷射","a private jet","私人飞机","jet lag 时差反应"],["timetable","ˈtaɪmˌteɪb(ə)l","n. 时刻表","a train timetable","列车时刻表","美式常用 schedule"],["inconvenience","ˌɪnkənˈvinjən(t)s","n. 不便 v. 给…带来不便","cause inconvenience","造成不便","in- 不 + convenience"]]},{"t":"酒店与餐厅","e":"Hospitality","s":[["I made a [reservation] at a seaside hotel.","我在一家海滨酒店订了房。"],["In the [lobby], a clerk gave me the key to a [suite].","在大堂，一名职员把一间套房的钥匙给了我。"],["Every [amenity] was there, and breakfast was [complimentary].","各种便利设施一应俱全，早餐是免费赠送的。"],["The morning [buffet] was huge.","早上的自助餐非常丰盛。"],["That evening the hotel hosted a wedding [banquet]; a [catering] team and a famous [chef] prepared it.","当晚酒店承办了一场婚宴，由一支餐饮团队和一位名厨准备。"],["I ate in the small restaurant: a light [appetizer], fish, and a chocolate [dessert].","我在小餐厅用餐：一道清淡的开胃菜、鱼和一份巧克力甜点。"],["The [waiter] carried a heavy [tray] and placed a [napkin] on my lap.","服务员端着沉重的托盘，把一块餐巾铺在我腿上。"],["I left a [tip] and paid the [bill].","我留了小费，付了账单。"],["The staff were [courteous] and [attentive].","员工彬彬有礼，服务周到。"],["I had only one [complaint], the slow lift.","我只有一点不满：电梯太慢。"],["Guest [satisfaction], the manager said, is everything.","经理说，客人的满意就是一切。"]],"g":[["seaside","海滨的"],["clerk","职员"],["key","钥匙"],["huge","丰盛的"],["hosted","承办"],["prepared","准备"],["light","清淡的"],["chocolate","巧克力"],["lap","大腿"],["staff","员工"],["lift","电梯"],["guest","客人"]],"w":[["reservation","ˌrɛzərˈveɪʃən","n. 预订；保留意见","make a reservation","预订","动词 reserve"],["lobby","ˈlɑbi","n. 大堂 v. 游说","the hotel lobby","酒店大堂",""],["suite","swit","n. 套房；一套","a hotel suite","酒店套房","读音同 sweet"],["amenity","əˈmɛnədi","n. 便利设施","hotel amenities","酒店设施","常用复数"],["complimentary","ˌkɑmpləˈmɛn(t)əri","adj. 免费赠送的；称赞的","complimentary breakfast","免费早餐","别混 complementary 互补的"],["buffet","bʊˈfeɪ","n. 自助餐","a breakfast buffet","自助早餐","来自法语，t 不发音"],["banquet","ˈbæŋkwət","n. 宴会","a wedding banquet","婚宴",""],["catering","ˈkeɪdərɪŋ","n. 餐饮服务","a catering company","餐饮公司","动词 cater"],["chef","ʃɛf","n. 厨师","a head chef","主厨","ch 读 sh"],["appetizer","ˈæpəˌtaɪzər","n. 开胃菜","order an appetizer","点开胃菜","appetite 胃口"],["dessert","dəˈzərt","n. 甜点","have ice cream for dessert","甜点吃冰淇淋","别混 desert 沙漠"],["waiter","ˈweɪdər","n. 服务员","call the waiter","叫服务员","女性 waitress"],["tray","treɪ","n. 托盘","a tray of food","一托盘食物",""],["napkin","ˈnæpkɪn","n. 餐巾","a paper napkin","纸巾",""],["tip","tɪp","n. 小费；窍门；尖端 v. 给小费","leave a tip","留小费",""],["bill","bɪl","n. 账单；议案；钞票","pay the bill","付账",""],["courteous","ˈkərdiəs","adj. 有礼貌的","a courteous reply","礼貌的答复","名词 courtesy"],["attentive","əˈtɛn(t)ɪv","adj. 周到的；专心的","attentive service","周到的服务","attention 的形容词"],["complaint","kəmˈpleɪnt","n. 投诉，抱怨","make a complaint","投诉","动词 complain"],["satisfaction","ˌsædəsˈfækʃən","n. 满意","customer satisfaction","客户满意度","动词 satisfy"]]},{"t":"教与学","e":"Teaching","s":[["A century ago, [literacy] was rare in this valley, and most farmers were [illiterate].","一个世纪前，这个山谷里识字的人很少，大多数农民是文盲。"],["Today every child follows a national [syllabus] and gets a free [textbook].","如今每个孩子都按国家教学大纲上课，并领到一本免费课本。"],["Good teachers do more than [instruct].","好老师不只是传授知识。"],["Mr. Chen will [tutor] weak students after class.","陈老师会在课后辅导差生。"],["He does not ask pupils to [recite] pages or [cram] for exams.","他不要求学生背诵整页课文，也不让他们临时抱佛脚应付考试。"],["A weekly [quiz] replaces big tests; a low [score] is a signal, not a shame, and no [grade] is final. He likes to [praise] effort.","每周一次的小测验取代了大考；分数低是一个信号而不是耻辱，没有哪个成绩是最终的。"],["He prefers to [reward] progress rather than [punish] mistakes.","他喜欢表扬努力，宁愿奖励进步，也不愿惩罚错误。"],["He can [inspire] even the laziest boy.","他连最懒的男孩都能激励。"],["A [gifted] girl with real [potential] nearly became a [dropout]; he found her [aptitude] for math, and now she is a young [scholar].","一个真正有潜力的天才女孩差点辍学；他发现了她的数学天赋，现在她已经是一名年轻学者了。"]],"g":[["century","世纪"],["rare","罕见的"],["valley","山谷"],["national","国家的"],["weak","差的"],["pupils","学生"],["weekly","每周的"],["replaces","取代"],["signal","信号"],["shame","耻辱"],["final","最终的"],["effort","努力"],["progress","进步"],["laziest","最懒的"]],"w":[["literacy","ˈlɪdərəsi","n. 读写能力","the literacy rate","识字率",""],["illiterate","ɪ(l)ˈlɪdərət","adj. 不识字的 n. 文盲","be illiterate","不识字","il- 不 + literate"],["syllabus","ˈsɪləbəs","n. 教学大纲","the course syllabus","课程大纲",""],["textbook","ˈtɛks(t)ˌbʊk","n. 教科书","a history textbook","历史课本",""],["instruct","ɪnˈstrək(t)","v. 教授；指示","instruct students in math","教学生数学","名词 instruction"],["tutor","ˈtudər","v. 辅导 n. 家教，导师","tutor a student","辅导学生",""],["recite","rəˈsaɪt","v. 背诵，朗诵","recite a poem","背诗",""],["cram","kræm","v. 临时抱佛脚；塞满","cram for an exam","考前突击",""],["quiz","kwɪz","n. 小测验 v. 提问","a pop quiz","突击小测",""],["score","skɔr","n. 分数 v. 得分","a high score","高分",""],["grade","ɡreɪd","n. 成绩等级；年级 v. 评分","get a good grade","取得好成绩",""],["praise","preɪz","v./n. 表扬","praise sb for sth","因某事表扬某人",""],["reward","rəˈwɔrd","v./n. 奖励","reward good work","奖励出色的工作",""],["punish","ˈpənɪʃ","v. 惩罚","punish sb for lying","因撒谎惩罚某人","名词 punishment"],["inspire","ɪnˈspaɪ(ə)r","v. 激励；给予灵感","inspire students","激励学生","名词 inspiration"],["gifted","ˈɡɪftəd","adj. 有天赋的","a gifted child","天才儿童","gift 天赋"],["potential","pəˈtɛn(t)ʃ(ə)l","n. 潜力 adj. 潜在的","reach one's potential","发挥潜力",""],["dropout","ˈdrɑpˌaʊt","n. 辍学者","a high school dropout","高中辍学者","drop out 的名词"],["aptitude","ˈæptəˌtud","n. 天资，才能","an aptitude for music","音乐天赋",""],["scholar","ˈskɑlər","n. 学者","a famous scholar","著名学者",""]]},{"t":"报刊出版","e":"Publishing","s":[["It is hard to [publish] a newspaper today.","如今出版一份报纸很难。"],["The free [press] is losing readers, and many a [periodical] has closed.","自由的新闻界正在流失读者，许多期刊已经停刊。"],["Our town still has a weekly [journal].","我们镇上仍有一份周刊。"],["The Friday [edition] has a sports [column] by a popular [columnist], an [editorial] on local politics, and a long [article] on farming.","周五版有一位受欢迎的专栏作家写的体育专栏、一篇关于地方政治的社论，还有一篇关于农业的长文。"],["Every photo needs a [caption].","每张照片都需要一条说明文字。"],["Last week our foreign [correspondent] got an [interview] with a minister; it was an [exclusive].","上周，我们的驻外记者采访了一位部长，那是一篇独家报道。"],["Two people [proofread] each page, and a designer does the [layout] before we [print].","每一页都由两个人校对，设计师排好版后我们才付印。"],["We respect [copyright] and pay each writer a [royalty].","我们尊重版权，付给每位作者版税。"],["Nobody may [censor] us.","谁也不能审查我们。"],["And we are not a [tabloid].","而且我们不是小报。"]],"g":[["readers","读者"],["closed","停刊"],["weekly","每周的"],["popular","受欢迎的"],["local","地方的"],["politics","政治"],["farming","农业"],["foreign","驻外的"],["minister","部长"],["designer","设计师"],["respect","尊重"]],"w":[["publish","ˈpəblɪʃ","v. 出版；发表","publish a book","出版一本书","publisher 出版社"],["press","prɛs","n. 新闻界；出版社 v. 按，压","freedom of the press","新闻自由",""],["periodical","ˌpɪriˈɑdək(ə)l","n. 期刊","an academic periodical","学术期刊","period 周期"],["journal","ˈdʒərn(ə)l","n. 期刊；日志","a medical journal","医学期刊",""],["edition","əˈdɪʃən","n. 版本，版次","the latest edition","最新版",""],["column","ˈkɑləm","n. 专栏；柱子；纵列","a newspaper column","报纸专栏","n 不发音"],["columnist","ˈkɑləm(n)əst","n. 专栏作家","a political columnist","政治专栏作家",""],["editorial","ˌɛdəˈtɔriəl","n. 社论 adj. 编辑的","an editorial on","关于…的社论",""],["article","ˈɑrdək(ə)l","n. 文章；物品；条款","a newspaper article","报纸文章",""],["caption","ˈkæpʃən","n.（图片）说明文字","a photo caption","照片说明",""],["correspondent","ˌkɔrəˈspɑnd(ə)nt","n. 记者，通讯员","a war correspondent","战地记者",""],["interview","ˈɪn(t)ərˌvju","n./v. 采访；面试","a job interview","求职面试",""],["exclusive","ɪkˈsklusɪv","n. 独家报道 adj. 独有的","an exclusive interview","独家采访","反义 inclusive"],["proofread","ˈprufˌrid","v. 校对","proofread an essay","校对文章","proof + read"],["layout","ˈleɪˌaʊt","n. 版面设计，布局","a page layout","页面版式","lay out 的名词"],["print","prɪnt","v. 印刷，打印 n. 印刷品","print a document","打印文件",""],["copyright","ˈkɑpiˌraɪt","n. 版权","protect copyright","保护版权","copy + right"],["royalty","ˈrɔɪ(ə)lti","n. 版税；王室成员","pay royalties","支付版税","royal 王室的"],["censor","ˈsɛn(t)sər","v. 审查，删改 n. 审查员","censor the news","审查新闻","名词 censorship"],["tabloid","ˈtæbˌlɔɪd","n. 小报","a tabloid newspaper","通俗小报",""]]},{"t":"电影","e":"Film","s":[["The [director] and the [producer] argued about the [script] for a year.","导演和制片人为剧本争论了一年。"],["Finally the [cast] was chosen.","演员阵容终于选定。"],["After a long [audition], an unknown actress won the main [role].","经过长时间的试镜，一位无名女演员赢得了主角。"],["Her [character] is a quiet nurse; the [villain] is her charming boss.","她演的角色是一名文静的护士；反派是她那位迷人的上司。"],["Each [costume] was sewn by hand, and every [stunt] was real.","每件戏服都是手工缝制的，每个特技都是真的。"],["The first [scene] took ten days to shoot.","第一场戏拍了十天。"],["Hours of [footage] were cut.","好几个小时的素材被剪掉了。"],["When the [trailer] appeared, people expected a [blockbuster].","预告片出来时，人们以为会是一部大片。"],["In fact the film feels like a [documentary], with a short [animation] at the start.","实际上这部电影感觉像纪录片，开头有一小段动画。"],["I watched it with a [subtitle] in English.","我看的是带英文字幕的版本。"],["The [soundtrack] is simple.","配乐很简单。"],["The [climax] comes late, and the [suspense] never drops.","高潮来得晚，悬念却始终不减。"]],"g":[["argued","争论"],["chosen","选定"],["unknown","无名的"],["actress","女演员"],["quiet","文静的"],["nurse","护士"],["charming","迷人的"],["sewn","缝制"],["by hand","手工"],["shoot","拍摄"],["cut","剪掉"],["expected","预期"],["drops","减弱"]],"w":[["director","dəˈrɛktər","n. 导演；主任；董事","a film director","电影导演","动词 direct"],["producer","prəˈdusər","n. 制片人；生产者","a film producer","电影制片人","动词 produce"],["script","skrɪp(t)","n. 剧本；手迹","a film script","电影剧本","scrib = 写"],["cast","kæst","n. 演员阵容 v. 投；选角","a strong cast","强大的演员阵容",""],["audition","ɔˈdɪʃən","n./v. 试镜","audition for a role","为一个角色试镜","aud = 听"],["role","roʊl","n. 角色；作用","play a role","扮演角色；起作用",""],["character","ˈkɛr(ə)ktər","n. 人物；性格；汉字","the main character","主角",""],["villain","ˈvɪlən","n. 反派，坏人","play the villain","演反派",""],["costume","ˈkɑsˌtum","n. 戏服，服装","a Halloween costume","万圣节服装",""],["stunt","stənt","n. 特技；噱头","perform a stunt","表演特技","stuntman 特技演员"],["scene","sin","n. 场景；现场","a love scene","爱情戏","behind the scenes 幕后"],["footage","ˈfʊdɪdʒ","n. 影片片段，素材","film footage","电影片段",""],["trailer","ˈtreɪlər","n. 预告片；拖车","a movie trailer","电影预告片",""],["blockbuster","ˈblɑkˌbəstər","n. 大片，轰动之作","a summer blockbuster","暑期大片",""],["documentary","ˌdɑkjəˈmɛnt(ə)ri","n. 纪录片 adj. 纪实的","a wildlife documentary","野生动物纪录片",""],["animation","ˌænəˈmeɪʃən","n. 动画","computer animation","电脑动画","动词 animate"],["subtitle","ˈsəbˌtaɪd(ə)l","n. 字幕；副标题","English subtitles","英文字幕","sub- 下 + title"],["soundtrack","ˈsaʊn(d)ˌtræk","n. 电影配乐，原声带","a film soundtrack","电影原声带",""],["climax","ˈklaɪˌmæks","n. 高潮","reach a climax","达到高潮",""],["suspense","səˈspɛn(t)s","n. 悬念","full of suspense","充满悬念",""]]},{"t":"健身","e":"Fitness","s":[["I joined a [gym] in January.","我一月份办了健身房的会员。"],["My [fitness] was poor, and my first [workout] nearly killed me.","我的体能很差，第一次锻炼差点要了我的命。"],["Now I follow a [routine].","现在我按固定的计划来。"],["My [trainer] starts with ten minutes of [aerobic] exercise.","教练先安排十分钟的有氧运动。"],["We [jog], then [stretch].","我们慢跑，然后拉伸。"],["On Mondays we build [strength]; I lift a small [weight].","每周一练力量，我举一个很小的重物。"],["She also changed my [diet]: less [carbohydrate], less [fat], more vegetables.","她还改了我的饮食：少吃碳水化合物，少吃脂肪，多吃蔬菜。"],["Exercise speeds up the [metabolism], she says.","她说，运动能加快新陈代谢。"],["Drink water, or you will [dehydrate].","要喝水，不然会脱水。"],["I do not want to be [slim]; I want to be [lean] and strong.","我不想变瘦，我想变得精瘦而强壮。"],["Last month I felt a [strain] in my back, and I got an ankle [sprain] while running.","上个月我感到背部拉伤，跑步时还扭伤了脚踝。"],["I was [sore] for a week, and happy.","我酸痛了一个星期，却很开心。"]],"g":[["joined","加入"],["poor","差的"],["nearly","差点"],["killed","要命"],["follow","遵循"],["exercise","运动"],["lift","举起"],["vegetables","蔬菜"],["speeds up","加快"],["back","背部"],["ankle","脚踝"]],"w":[["gym","dʒɪm","n. 健身房","go to the gym","去健身房","gymnasium 的缩写"],["fitness","ˈfɪtnəs","n. 健康，体能","physical fitness","体能","形容词 fit"],["workout","ˈwərkˌaʊt","n. 锻炼","a morning workout","晨练","work out 的名词"],["routine","ruˈtin","n. 常规，固定安排 adj. 例行的","a daily routine","日常安排",""],["trainer","ˈtreɪnər","n. 教练；运动鞋","a personal trainer","私人教练",""],["aerobic","əˈroʊbɪk","adj. 有氧的","aerobic exercise","有氧运动","aero = 空气"],["jog","dʒɑɡ","v./n. 慢跑","go jogging","去慢跑",""],["stretch","strɛtʃ","v./n. 伸展，拉伸","stretch your legs","伸伸腿",""],["strength","strɛŋ(k)θ","n. 力量；优点","build strength","增强力量","形容词 strong"],["weight","weɪt","n. 重量；体重；重物","lose weight","减肥","动词 weigh"],["diet","ˈdaɪət","n. 饮食；节食 v. 节食","a balanced diet","均衡饮食","be on a diet 在节食"],["carbohydrate","ˌkɑrbəˈhaɪˌdreɪt","n. 碳水化合物","low in carbohydrates","低碳水","口语 carb"],["fat","fæt","n. 脂肪 adj. 胖的","body fat","体脂",""],["metabolism","məˈtæbəˌlɪzəm","n. 新陈代谢","a fast metabolism","代谢快",""],["dehydrate","diˈhaɪˌdreɪt","v. 脱水","become dehydrated","脱水","de- 去 + hydr 水"],["slim","slɪm","adj. 苗条的；微小的","a slim figure","苗条的身材","a slim chance 希望渺茫"],["lean","lin","adj. 精瘦的 v. 倾斜，倚靠","lean meat","瘦肉","lean on 依靠"],["strain","streɪn","n. 拉伤；压力 v. 拉伤","a muscle strain","肌肉拉伤",""],["sprain","spreɪn","n./v. 扭伤","an ankle sprain","脚踝扭伤",""],["sore","sɔr","adj. 酸痛的","a sore throat","嗓子疼",""]]},{"t":"心理健康","e":"Mental Health","s":[["Modern life is full of [stress].","现代生活充满压力。"],["After two years of overtime, Lin suffered [burnout].","加了两年班后，林出现了职业倦怠。"],["An old [trauma] returned, with a [phobia] of crowds and long nights of [insomnia].","旧日的创伤又回来了，伴随着对人群的恐惧和漫长的失眠之夜。"],["Her [mood] changed by the hour.","她的情绪每个小时都在变。"],["Was it a [disorder], or the start of a [breakdown]?","这是一种障碍，还是崩溃的开始？"],["A [psychiatrist] suggested [counseling].","一位精神科医生建议她接受心理咨询。"],["She learned that the [subconscious] mind stores fear, and that [instinct] reacts before thought.","她了解到，潜意识储存着恐惧，本能在思考之前就作出反应。"],["Every [stimulus] causes a [response].","每一个刺激都会引起一个反应。"],["To change her [behavior], she had to change one [habit] at a time.","要改变行为，她必须一次改变一个习惯。"],["She stopped her [compulsive] checking of emails and felt less [paranoid].","她不再强迫性地查看邮件，也不那么疑神疑鬼了。"],["Music helped to [soothe] her.","音乐有助于抚慰她。"],["Slowly she learned to [relax].","慢慢地，她学会了放松。"]],"g":[["modern","现代的"],["overtime","加班"],["suffered","遭受"],["returned","回来"],["crowds","人群"],["suggested","建议"],["mind","头脑"],["stores","储存"],["fear","恐惧"],["reacts","反应"],["thought","思考"],["causes","引起"],["checking","查看"],["slowly","慢慢地"]],"w":[["stress","strɛs","n. 压力；重音 v. 强调","under stress","承受压力","形容词 stressful"],["burnout","ˈbərnˌaʊt","n. 精疲力竭，倦怠","job burnout","职业倦怠","burn out 的名词"],["trauma","ˈtrɔmə","n. 精神创伤；外伤","childhood trauma","童年创伤","形容词 traumatic"],["phobia","ˈfoʊbiə","n. 恐惧症","a phobia of heights","恐高症",""],["insomnia","ɪnˈsɑmniə","n. 失眠","suffer from insomnia","失眠","in- 不 + somn 睡"],["mood","mud","n. 情绪，心情","in a good mood","心情好",""],["disorder","dɪsˈɔrdər","n. 失调，障碍；混乱","an eating disorder","饮食失调","dis- + order"],["breakdown","ˈbreɪkˌdaʊn","n. 崩溃；故障","a nervous breakdown","精神崩溃","break down 的名词"],["psychiatrist","səˈkaɪətrəst","n. 精神科医生","see a psychiatrist","看精神科医生","p 不发音"],["counseling","ˈkaʊn(t)s(ə)lɪŋ","n. 心理咨询，辅导","marriage counseling","婚姻咨询","英式 counselling"],["subconscious","səbˈkɑnʃəs","adj. 潜意识的 n. 潜意识","the subconscious mind","潜意识","sub- 下 + conscious"],["instinct","ˈɪnstɪŋ(k)t","n. 本能，直觉","by instinct","凭本能","形容词 instinctive"],["stimulus","ˈstɪmjələs","n. 刺激（物）","a visual stimulus","视觉刺激","复数 stimuli"],["response","rəˈspɑn(t)s","n. 反应；回答","in response to","作为对…的回应","动词 respond"],["behavior","bəˈheɪvjər","n. 行为","good behavior","良好的行为","英式 behaviour"],["habit","ˈhæbət","n. 习惯","break a bad habit","改掉坏习惯",""],["compulsive","kəmˈpəlsɪv","adj. 强迫性的；上瘾的","compulsive shopping","强迫性购物","compel 强迫"],["paranoid","ˈpɛrəˌnɔɪd","adj. 多疑的，偏执的","be paranoid about","对…疑神疑鬼",""],["soothe","suð","v. 安慰，缓解","soothe a crying baby","哄哭闹的婴儿","形容词 soothing"],["relax","rəˈlæks","v. 放松","relax after work","下班后放松","名词 relaxation"]]},{"t":"打官司","e":"Lawsuit","s":[["A small firm filed a [lawsuit] last year.","一家小公司去年提起了诉讼。"],["It decided to [sue] a larger rival.","它决定起诉一家规模更大的竞争对手。"],["The [plaintiff] hired a young [attorney].","原告聘请了一位年轻的律师。"],["In [court], the [trial] lasted a week.","在法庭上，审判持续了一个星期。"],["At the first [hearing], an engineer gave [testimony] under [oath].","在第一次听证会上，一名工程师宣誓后作了证。"],["The judge's [ruling] turned on one [clause] of the contract.","法官的裁决取决于合同中的一项条款。"],["Was it [binding]?","它有约束力吗？"],["Was the contract [valid] or [void]?","这份合同是有效的还是无效的？"],["The judge found the rival [liable] and ordered it to pay [damages].","法官认定对手负有法律责任，并命令其支付损害赔偿金。"],["Both sides later reached a [settlement].","双方后来达成了和解。"],["The case was not about [negligence].","这个案子与过失无关。"],["The rival had tried to [infringe] a [patent], and it failed.","对手企图侵犯一项专利，结果失败了。"]],"g":[["firm","公司"],["filed","提起"],["rival","竞争对手"],["hired","聘请"],["lasted","持续"],["engineer","工程师"],["judge","法官"],["turned on","取决于"],["contract","合同"],["ordered","命令"],["sides","双方"],["reached","达成"],["case","案子"],["failed","失败"]],"w":[["lawsuit","ˈlɔˌsut","n. 诉讼","file a lawsuit","提起诉讼","law + suit"],["sue","su","v. 起诉","sue sb for damages","起诉某人要求赔偿",""],["plaintiff","ˈpleɪn(t)əf","n. 原告","the plaintiff's lawyer","原告律师","反义 defendant"],["attorney","əˈtərni","n. 律师","a defense attorney","辩护律师","美式用词"],["court","kɔrt","n. 法庭；球场；宫廷","appear in court","出庭",""],["trial","ˈtraɪ(ə)l","n. 审判；试验","a fair trial","公正的审判","动词 try"],["hearing","ˈhɪrɪŋ","n. 听证会；听力","a court hearing","法庭听证",""],["testimony","ˈtɛstəˌmoʊni","n. 证词","give testimony","作证","动词 testify"],["oath","oʊθ","n. 誓言","under oath","宣誓后",""],["ruling","ˈrulɪŋ","n. 裁决 adj. 统治的","a court ruling","法院裁决","动词 rule"],["clause","klɔz","n. 条款；从句","a contract clause","合同条款",""],["binding","ˈbaɪndɪŋ","adj. 有约束力的","a binding agreement","有约束力的协议","动词 bind"],["valid","ˈvæləd","adj. 有效的；合理的","a valid passport","有效护照","反义 invalid"],["void","vɔɪd","adj. 无效的；空的 n. 空白","null and void","无效",""],["liable","ˈlaɪəb(ə)l","adj. 负有法律责任的；可能的","be liable for","对…负责","名词 liability"],["damages","ˈdæmɪdʒɪz","n. 损害赔偿金","claim damages","索赔","单数 damage 损害"],["settlement","ˈsɛdlmənt","n. 和解；解决；定居点","reach a settlement","达成和解","动词 settle"],["negligence","ˈnɛɡlədʒ(ə)n(t)s","n. 过失，疏忽","medical negligence","医疗过失","形容词 negligent"],["infringe","ɪnˈfrɪndʒ","v. 侵犯，违反","infringe a patent","侵犯专利","名词 infringement"],["patent","ˈpætnt","n. 专利 v. 取得专利","apply for a patent","申请专利",""]]},{"t":"移民","e":"Migration","s":[["My grandfather was a [migrant].","我祖父是一名移民。"],["At twenty he decided to [emigrate] and left his [homeland].","二十岁时他决定移居国外，离开了故乡。"],["He was not a [native] speaker of English, and to the locals he was just another [settler].","他的母语不是英语，在当地人眼里他不过是又一个外来定居者。"],["It took ten years to gain [citizenship].","他花了十年才取得公民身份。"],["His [nationality] changed; his [identity] did not.","他的国籍变了，但他的身份认同没变。"],["A friend of his was [deported].","他的一个朋友被驱逐出境。"],["Another lived in [exile] and called himself an [expatriate].","另一个流亡在外，自称侨民。"],["My father tried hard to [assimilate].","我父亲努力融入当地社会。"],["I grew up in a [multicultural] city, yet I still met [racial] jokes, quiet [racism], and one tired [stereotype] after another. Where do I [belong]?","我在一座多元文化的城市长大，却仍然遇到带种族色彩的玩笑、不动声色的种族歧视，以及一个又一个陈旧的刻板印象。"],["Grandfather sent a [remittance] home every month.","我属于哪里？祖父每个月都往家里汇款。"],["Today a new [influx] of families is arriving, hoping to [resettle] here.","如今又有一批家庭涌来，希望在这里重新安家。"]],"g":[["decided","决定"],["speaker","说…语言的人"],["locals","当地人"],["gain","取得"],["grew up","长大"],["jokes","玩笑"],["quiet","不动声色的"],["tired","陈旧的"],["arriving","到来"],["hoping","希望"]],"w":[["migrant","ˈmaɪɡr(ə)nt","n. 移民；候鸟","a migrant worker","外来务工人员","动词 migrate"],["emigrate","ˈɛməˌɡreɪt","v. 移居国外","emigrate to Canada","移居加拿大","e- 向外；移入 immigrate"],["homeland","ˈhoʊmˌlænd","n. 祖国，故乡","return to one's homeland","回到祖国",""],["native","ˈneɪdɪv","adj. 本地的；母语的 n. 本地人","a native speaker","母语者",""],["settler","ˈsɛdlər","n. 定居者，移民","early settlers","早期定居者","动词 settle"],["citizenship","ˈsɪdəzənˌʃɪp","n. 公民身份","apply for citizenship","申请入籍","citizen + -ship"],["nationality","ˌnæʃəˈnælədi","n. 国籍；民族","dual nationality","双重国籍",""],["identity","aɪˈdɛn(t)ədi","n. 身份；认同","a sense of identity","认同感","ID 的全称 identity card"],["deport","dəˈpɔrt","v. 驱逐出境","be deported","被驱逐出境","de- 离开 + port 运"],["exile","ˈɛɡˌzaɪl","n./v. 流放，流亡","live in exile","流亡",""],["expatriate","ɛksˈpeɪtriət","n. 侨民 adj. 侨居的","an expatriate community","侨民社区","口语 expat"],["assimilate","əˈsɪməˌleɪt","v. 同化，融入；吸收","assimilate into society","融入社会","simil = 相似"],["multicultural","ˌməltiˈkəl(t)ʃ(ə)r(ə)l","adj. 多元文化的","a multicultural society","多元文化社会","multi- 多"],["racial","ˈreɪʃ(ə)l","adj. 种族的","racial equality","种族平等","名词 race"],["racism","ˈreɪˌsɪzəm","n. 种族主义","fight racism","反对种族歧视",""],["stereotype","ˈstɛriəˌtaɪp","n. 刻板印象 v. 对…形成刻板看法","a gender stereotype","性别刻板印象",""],["belong","bəˈlɔŋ","v. 属于","belong to","属于","sense of belonging 归属感"],["remittance","rəˈmɪtn(t)s","n. 汇款","send a remittance","汇款","动词 remit"],["influx","ˈɪnˌfləks","n. 涌入","an influx of tourists","游客涌入","in- + flux 流"],["resettle","riˈsɛd(ə)l","v. 重新安置，重新定居","resettle refugees","安置难民","re- + settle"]]},{"t":"市政服务","e":"Public Services","s":[["The [municipal] [council] met on Tuesday.","市议会星期二开了会。"],["Every [resident] may attend, and the [community] hall was full.","每位居民都可以参加，社区礼堂座无虚席。"],["People from each [district], even from [downtown], had questions.","来自各个区甚至市中心的人都有问题要问。"],["The new sports [facility] is late.","新的体育设施延期了。"],["Poor [sanitation] in the old town worries parents: the [sewage] pipes are old, and bad [drainage] floods the streets.","老城区卫生条件差，让家长们担忧：污水管道老旧，排水不畅导致街道积水。"],["Where should our [waste] go?","我们的垃圾该送到哪里去？"],["We [recycle] too little, and the [landfill] is nearly full.","我们回收得太少，垃圾填埋场快满了。"],["There is [litter] on every [pavement].","每条人行道上都有乱扔的垃圾。"],["The mayor promised a cleaner [plaza] and a repaired [fountain].","市长承诺要有一个更干净的广场，并修好喷泉。"],["Police will [patrol] the park at night.","警察将在夜间巡逻公园。"],["Nobody wants a [curfew], but everyone is tired of [vandalism].","没有人想要宵禁，但人人都受够了破坏公物的行为。"]],"g":[["attend","参加"],["hall","礼堂"],["pipes","管道"],["floods","使积水"],["nearly","几乎"],["mayor","市长"],["promised","承诺"],["repaired","修好的"],["police","警察"],["tired of","厌倦"]],"w":[["municipal","mjuˈnɪsəp(ə)l","adj. 市政的","the municipal government","市政府",""],["council","ˈkaʊn(t)s(ə)l","n. 委员会，议会","the city council","市议会","别混 counsel 建议"],["resident","ˈrɛz(ə)d(ə)nt","n. 居民 adj. 居住的","a local resident","当地居民","动词 reside"],["community","kəˈmjunədi","n. 社区；群体","the local community","当地社区",""],["district","ˈdɪstrɪk(t)","n. 区，地区","a business district","商业区",""],["downtown","ˌdaʊnˈtaʊn","n./adv. 市中心","go downtown","去市中心",""],["facility","fəˈsɪlədi","n. 设施；才能","sports facilities","体育设施","常用复数"],["sanitation","ˌsænəˈteɪʃən","n. 环境卫生","poor sanitation","卫生条件差","形容词 sanitary"],["sewage","ˈsuɪdʒ","n. 污水","sewage treatment","污水处理","sewer 下水道"],["drainage","ˈdreɪnɪdʒ","n. 排水（系统）","a drainage system","排水系统","动词 drain"],["waste","weɪst","n. 废物；浪费 v. 浪费","household waste","生活垃圾",""],["recycle","riˈsaɪk(ə)l","v. 回收利用","recycle paper","回收纸张","re- + cycle"],["landfill","ˈlæn(d)ˌfɪl","n. 垃圾填埋场","a landfill site","垃圾填埋场","land + fill"],["litter","ˈlɪdər","n. 乱扔的垃圾 v. 乱扔","drop litter","乱扔垃圾",""],["pavement","ˈpeɪvm(ə)nt","n. 人行道；路面","walk on the pavement","走人行道","美式 sidewalk"],["plaza","ˈplɑzə","n. 广场","a shopping plaza","购物广场",""],["fountain","ˈfaʊnt(ə)n","n. 喷泉","a drinking fountain","饮水台",""],["patrol","pəˈtroʊl","v./n. 巡逻","patrol the streets","在街上巡逻",""],["curfew","ˈkərˌfju","n. 宵禁","impose a curfew","实行宵禁",""],["vandalism","ˈvændlˌɪzəm","n. 故意破坏公物的行为","an act of vandalism","破坏公物的行为","vandal 破坏者"]]},{"t":"海洋","e":"Ocean","s":[["A [marine] biologist's day follows the [tide].","海洋生物学家的一天跟着潮汐走。"],["A warm [current] runs along this [shore], through the [bay] and out into the [gulf].","一股暖流沿着这片海岸流过，穿过海湾，流入外面的大海湾。"],["At dawn our boat leaves the [harbor].","黎明时我们的船离开港口。"],["We untie it from the [dock], lift the [anchor], and [sail] east.","我们把船从码头解开，起锚，向东航行。"],["The [voyage] takes six hours.","航程需要六个小时。"],["A fishing [fleet] passes us; once we saw a [submarine].","一支捕鱼船队从我们身边经过；有一次我们还看见了一艘潜艇。"],["We count every [whale], [shark], and [dolphin].","我们数每一头鲸鱼、每一条鲨鱼和每一只海豚。"],["Divers photograph the [coral] and collect mud from the [seabed].","潜水员给珊瑚拍照，并从海床上采集泥样。"],["An old [tsunami] left a [shipwreck] here, and it is now full of fish.","一场很久以前的海啸在这里留下了一艘沉船，如今里面满是鱼。"]],"g":[["biologist","生物学家"],["follows","跟随"],["warm","温暖的"],["runs","流动"],["dawn","黎明"],["untie","解开"],["lift","提起"],["east","向东"],["passes","经过"],["count","数"],["divers","潜水员"],["photograph","拍照"],["collect","采集"],["mud","泥"]],"w":[["marine","məˈrin","adj. 海洋的 n. 海军陆战队员","marine life","海洋生物","mar = 海"],["tide","taɪd","n. 潮汐；潮流","at high tide","涨潮时","形容词 tidal"],["current","ˈkərənt","n. 水流；电流 adj. 当前的","an ocean current","洋流",""],["shore","ʃɔr","n. 岸，海滨","on the shore","在岸上",""],["bay","beɪ","n. 海湾","a quiet bay","宁静的海湾",""],["gulf","ɡəlf","n. 海湾；鸿沟","the Persian Gulf","波斯湾","比 bay 大"],["harbor","ˈhɑrbər","n. 港口 v. 怀有；庇护","a fishing harbor","渔港","英式 harbour"],["dock","dɑk","n. 码头 v. 停靠；扣除","at the dock","在码头",""],["anchor","ˈæŋkər","n. 锚；主持人 v. 抛锚","drop anchor","抛锚","a news anchor 新闻主播"],["sail","seɪl","v. 航行 n. 帆","sail around the world","环球航行","sailor 水手"],["voyage","ˈvɔɪ(ɪ)dʒ","n. 航行，航程","a long voyage","远航",""],["fleet","flit","n. 船队，舰队；车队","a fishing fleet","捕鱼船队",""],["submarine","ˈsəbməˌrin","n. 潜艇 adj. 海底的","a nuclear submarine","核潜艇","sub- 下 + marine"],["whale","(h)weɪl","n. 鲸鱼","a blue whale","蓝鲸",""],["shark","ʃɑrk","n. 鲨鱼","a shark attack","鲨鱼袭击",""],["dolphin","ˈdɑlfən","n. 海豚","a school of dolphins","一群海豚",""],["coral","ˈkɔrəl","n. 珊瑚","a coral reef","珊瑚礁",""],["seabed","ˈsiˌbɛd","n. 海床","on the seabed","在海底","sea + bed"],["tsunami","(t)suˈnɑmi","n. 海啸","a tsunami warning","海啸预警","来自日语，t 不发音"],["shipwreck","ˈʃɪpˌrɛk","n. 沉船；海难","explore a shipwreck","探索沉船","ship + wreck 残骸"]]},{"t":"植物与园艺","e":"Garden","s":[["In March I plant each [seed] in a pot.","三月，我把每粒种子种在花盆里。"],["Within a week a green [sprout] appears, and a white [root] grows down.","不到一周，绿芽就冒了出来，白色的根向下生长。"],["The [stalk] of a sunflower rises fast.","向日葵的茎长得很快。"],["The old apple tree has a thick [trunk]; every [branch] and [twig] carries a [bud].","那棵老苹果树树干粗壮，每根树枝和细枝上都带着芽。"],["In April the [blossom] opens, and each pink [petal] falls like snow.","四月花开了，每片粉色的花瓣像雪一样飘落。"],["The rose has a sharp [thorn].","玫瑰长着尖刺。"],["A [vine] climbs the wall, [moss] covers the stones, and [bamboo] grows in the corner.","藤蔓爬上墙，苔藓覆盖着石头，竹子长在角落里。"],["Good [soil] is everything.","好土壤就是一切。"],["In winter I [prune] the trees.","冬天我给树修枝。"],["Without water, leaves [wither]; with too much, roots [rot].","缺水，叶子会枯萎；水太多，根会腐烂。"],["I cut the [lawn] on Sundays and shape the [hedge] twice a year.","我每周日修剪草坪，每年给树篱修两次形。"]],"g":[["plant","种植"],["pot","花盆"],["appears","出现"],["sunflower","向日葵"],["rises","生长"],["thick","粗的"],["carries","带着"],["pink","粉色的"],["rose","玫瑰"],["sharp","尖的"],["climbs","爬"],["covers","覆盖"],["corner","角落"],["shape","修形"]],"w":[["seed","sid","n. 种子","plant a seed","播下种子",""],["sprout","spraʊt","n. 新芽 v. 发芽","bean sprouts","豆芽",""],["root","rut","n. 根；根源 v. 生根","the root of the problem","问题的根源",""],["stalk","stɔk","n. 茎，秆 v. 跟踪","a corn stalk","玉米秆",""],["trunk","trəŋk","n. 树干；象鼻；后备箱","a tree trunk","树干",""],["branch","bræn(t)ʃ","n. 树枝；分支机构","a branch of a bank","银行分行",""],["twig","twɪɡ","n. 细枝","a dry twig","干树枝",""],["bud","bəd","n. 花蕾，芽 v. 发芽","a flower bud","花蕾",""],["blossom","ˈblɑsəm","n. 花（尤指果树的）v. 开花","cherry blossom","樱花",""],["petal","ˈpɛd(ə)l","n. 花瓣","rose petals","玫瑰花瓣",""],["thorn","θɔrn","n. 刺","a rose thorn","玫瑰刺","形容词 thorny 棘手的"],["vine","vaɪn","n. 藤蔓；葡萄藤","a grape vine","葡萄藤","vineyard 葡萄园"],["moss","mɔs","n. 苔藓","covered with moss","长满苔藓",""],["bamboo","ˌbæmˈbu","n. 竹子","a bamboo forest","竹林",""],["soil","sɔɪl","n. 土壤；国土","fertile soil","肥沃的土壤",""],["prune","prun","v. 修剪；削减","prune a tree","修剪树木",""],["wither","ˈwɪðər","v. 枯萎","flowers wither","花枯萎",""],["rot","rɑt","v./n. 腐烂","the wood rots","木头腐烂","形容词 rotten"],["lawn","lɔn","n. 草坪","mow the lawn","修剪草坪",""],["hedge","hɛdʒ","n. 树篱 v. 规避","trim a hedge","修剪树篱","hedge fund 对冲基金"]]},{"t":"材料与形状","e":"Materials","s":[["Engineers choose materials with care.","工程师选材料很用心。"],["[Metal] is strong: [copper] carries electricity, [aluminum] is light, and an [alloy] can be both.","金属很结实：铜能导电，铝很轻，合金可以两者兼备。"],["[Plastic] is cheap; [rubber] bends; [ceramic] resists heat; carbon [fiber] is light and stiff.","塑料便宜，橡胶能弯曲，陶瓷耐热，碳纤维又轻又硬。"],["A part may be [solid] or [hollow].","一个零件可以是实心的，也可以是空心的。"],["Lead is [dense].","铅的密度很大。"],["Glass is clear, while wood is [opaque].","玻璃是透明的，木头则不透明。"],["Cast iron is [brittle], but a steel spring is [elastic].","铸铁很脆，而钢弹簧有弹性。"],["Shape matters too.","形状也很重要。"],["A ball is a [sphere]; a box is a [cube]; a can is a [cylinder].","球是球体，盒子是立方体，罐子是圆柱体。"],["A [triangle] is the strongest frame, a [rectangle] the easiest to build, and a gentle [curve] the most beautiful.","三角形是最坚固的框架，长方形最容易建造，平缓的曲线则最美。"]],"g":[["engineers","工程师"],["materials","材料"],["care","用心"],["carries","传导"],["electricity","电"],["light","轻的"],["bends","弯曲"],["resists","耐"],["heat","热"],["stiff","硬的"],["part","零件"],["lead","铅"],["clear","透明的"],["cast iron","铸铁"],["spring","弹簧"],["frame","框架"],["gentle","平缓的"]],"w":[["metal","ˈmɛd(ə)l","n. 金属","precious metals","贵金属",""],["copper","ˈkɑpər","n. 铜","copper wire","铜线",""],["aluminum","ˌæləˈmɪniəm","n. 铝","aluminum foil","铝箔","英式 aluminium"],["alloy","ˈæˌlɔɪ","n. 合金","an aluminum alloy","铝合金",""],["plastic","ˈplæstɪk","n. 塑料 adj. 塑料的","a plastic bag","塑料袋",""],["rubber","ˈrəbər","n. 橡胶；橡皮","rubber gloves","橡胶手套",""],["ceramic","səˈræmɪk","n. 陶瓷 adj. 陶瓷的","ceramic tiles","瓷砖",""],["fiber","ˈfaɪbər","n. 纤维","carbon fiber","碳纤维","英式 fibre"],["solid","ˈsɑləd","adj. 固体的；实心的；可靠的 n. 固体","solid wood","实木",""],["hollow","ˈhɑloʊ","adj. 空心的；空洞的","a hollow tube","空心管",""],["dense","dɛn(t)s","adj. 密度大的；稠密的","a dense forest","茂密的森林","名词 density"],["opaque","oʊˈpeɪk","adj. 不透明的；难懂的","opaque glass","不透明玻璃","反义 transparent"],["brittle","ˈbrɪd(ə)l","adj. 易碎的，脆的","brittle bones","脆弱的骨头",""],["elastic","əˈlæstɪk","adj. 有弹性的 n. 松紧带","an elastic band","橡皮筋",""],["sphere","sfɪr","n. 球体；领域","a perfect sphere","完美的球体",""],["cube","kjub","n. 立方体","an ice cube","冰块","形容词 cubic"],["cylinder","ˈsɪləndər","n. 圆柱体；气缸","a gas cylinder","煤气罐",""],["triangle","ˈtraɪˌæŋɡ(ə)l","n. 三角形","a right triangle","直角三角形","tri- 三 + angle"],["rectangle","ˈrɛkˌtæŋɡ(ə)l","n. 长方形","draw a rectangle","画一个长方形","rect = 直"],["curve","kərv","n. 曲线，弯道 v. 弯曲","a sharp curve","急弯",""]]},{"t":"网购","e":"Online Shopping","s":[["The modern [consumer] shops by phone.","现代消费者用手机购物。"],["Any small [vendor] can sell online, buying [wholesale] and keeping little [stock].","任何小商贩都可以在网上卖东西，批发进货，只留少量库存。"],["I browse the [catalog], fill my [cart], and go to the [checkout].","我浏览商品目录，装满购物车，然后去结账。"],["A [coupon] or a gift [voucher] gives a [discount], and every holiday brings a new [promotion].","一张优惠券或礼品代金券可以打折，每逢节日又有新的促销。"],["[Delivery] is fast: a [courier] brings the [parcel] the next day, and [tracking] shows where it is.","送货很快：快递员第二天就把包裹送到，物流跟踪能显示它在哪里。"],["Before buying, I check the seller's [rating] and read each [review].","购买前，我会查看卖家的评分，阅读每一条评价。"],["Paid [membership] means free shipping, and a monthly [subscription] sends coffee to my door.","付费会员可以免运费，每月订阅则会把咖啡送到我家门口。"],["But be careful: some cheap goods are [counterfeit].","但要小心：有些便宜货是假冒的。"]],"g":[["modern","现代的"],["sell","卖"],["browse","浏览"],["fill","装满"],["gift","礼品"],["holiday","节日"],["brings","带来"],["seller","卖家"],["paid","付费的"],["shipping","运费"],["monthly","每月的"],["careful","小心的"],["goods","货物"]],"w":[["consumer","kənˈsumər","n. 消费者","consumer rights","消费者权益","动词 consume"],["vendor","ˈvɛndər","n. 小贩，卖主","a street vendor","街头小贩",""],["wholesale","ˈhoʊlˌseɪl","adv./adj. 以批发方式（的）n. 批发","buy wholesale","批发购买","反义 retail"],["stock","ˈprɛf(ə)rən(t)s ˌʃɛr","n. 库存；股票 v. 储备","in stock","有货","out of stock 缺货"],["catalog","ˈkædlˌɔɡ","n. 目录","a product catalog","产品目录","英式 catalogue"],["cart","kɑrt","n. 购物车；手推车","add to cart","加入购物车",""],["checkout","ˈtʃɛkˌaʊt","n. 结账（处）","go to the checkout","去结账","check out 的名词"],["coupon","ˈkuˌpɑn","n. 优惠券","a discount coupon","折扣券",""],["voucher","ˈvaʊtʃər","n. 代金券，凭证","a gift voucher","礼品券",""],["discount","ˈdɪsˌkaʊnt","n. 折扣 v. 打折","a 20% discount","八折",""],["promotion","prəˈmoʊʃən","n. 促销；晋升","a sales promotion","促销活动","动词 promote"],["delivery","dəˈlɪv(ə)ri","n. 送货；分娩","free delivery","免费送货","动词 deliver"],["courier","ˈkʊriər","n. 快递员，快递公司","send by courier","用快递寄送",""],["parcel","ˈpɑrs(ə)l","n. 包裹","send a parcel","寄包裹",""],["tracking","ˈtrækɪŋ","n. 跟踪，追踪","a tracking number","物流单号","动词 track"],["rating","ˈreɪdɪŋ","n. 评分，等级","a five-star rating","五星好评","动词 rate"],["review","rəˈvju","n. 评价；复习 v. 评论；复习","read the reviews","看评价","re- + view"],["membership","ˈmɛmbərˌʃɪp","n. 会员资格","a gym membership","健身房会员","member + -ship"],["subscription","səbˈskrɪpʃən","n. 订阅；订阅费","a monthly subscription","包月订阅","动词 subscribe"],["counterfeit","ˈkaʊn(t)ərˌfɪt","adj. 伪造的 n. 赝品 v. 伪造","counterfeit goods","假货",""]]},{"t":"学术写作","e":"Writing","s":[["Before writing an essay, make an [outline].","写文章之前先列提纲。"],["Each [paragraph] needs one [topic].","每个段落需要一个主题。"],["Your [argument] rests on a [premise], so state your [claim] early.","你的论证建立在前提之上，所以要尽早陈述你的主张。"],["You may [quote] an expert, or [paraphrase] her words.","你可以引用专家的话，也可以转述她的话。"],["Use examples to [illustrate] a point and data to [demonstrate] it.","用例子来说明观点，用数据来证明它。"],["Figures [indicate] trends; a good writer will [highlight] the key one and [elaborate] only when needed.","数字能显示趋势；好的作者会突出最关键的那个，只在必要时才详细阐述。"],["Keep sentences [concise].","句子要简洁。"],["Linking words guide the reader.","连接词引导读者。"],["[Furthermore] and [moreover] add a point. [Nevertheless] turns the other way. [Consequently] and [hence] show a result, [whereas] marks a contrast.","furthermore 和 moreover 用来补充一点，nevertheless 表示转折，consequently 和 hence 表示结果，whereas 表示对比。"]],"g":[["essay","文章"],["rests on","建立在…上"],["state","陈述"],["expert","专家"],["examples","例子"],["point","观点"],["data","数据"],["figures","数字"],["trends","趋势"],["key","关键的"],["sentences","句子"],["linking words","连接词"],["guide","引导"],["result","结果"],["marks","表示"]],"w":[["outline","ˈaʊtˌlaɪn","n. 提纲，轮廓 v. 概述","write an outline","写提纲","out + line"],["paragraph","ˈpɛrəˌɡræf","n. 段落","the first paragraph","第一段",""],["topic","ˈtɑpɪk","n. 主题，话题","a topic sentence","主题句",""],["argument","ˈɑrɡjəmənt","n. 论证，论点；争吵","a strong argument","有力的论证","动词 argue"],["premise","ˈprɛməs","n. 前提","a false premise","错误的前提",""],["claim","kleɪm","n. 主张；索赔 v. 声称；索取","make a claim","提出主张",""],["quote","kwoʊt","v. 引用；报价 n. 引语","quote a writer","引用作家的话","名词 quotation"],["paraphrase","ˈpɛrəˌfreɪz","v./n. 转述，改述","paraphrase a sentence","转述一句话","para- 旁 + phrase"],["illustrate","ˈɪləˌstreɪt","v. 举例说明；画插图","illustrate a point","说明一个观点","名词 illustration"],["demonstrate","ˈdɛmənˌstreɪt","v. 证明；演示；示威","demonstrate a method","演示一种方法","名词 demonstration"],["indicate","ˈɪndəˌkeɪt","v. 表明，显示","studies indicate that","研究表明","名词 indication"],["highlight","ˈhaɪˌlaɪt","v. 强调，突出 n. 最精彩的部分","highlight the key points","突出要点",""],["elaborate","əˈlæbəˌreɪt","v. 详细阐述 adj. 精心制作的","elaborate on a plan","详细说明计划","固定搭配 on"],["concise","kənˈsaɪs","adj. 简洁的","a concise summary","简明的总结",""],["furthermore","ˈfərðərˌmɔr","adv. 此外，而且","Furthermore, it is cheap.","而且它很便宜。","further + more"],["moreover","mɔˈroʊvər","adv. 此外，再者","Moreover, it is safe.","此外它很安全。","近义 furthermore"],["nevertheless","ˌnɛvərðəˈlɛs","adv. 然而，尽管如此","Nevertheless, he tried.","尽管如此，他还是试了。","近义 however"],["consequently","ˈkɑn(t)səkwən(t)li","adv. 因此","Consequently, sales fell.","因此销量下降了。","consequence 的副词"],["hence","hɛn(t)s","adv. 因此；从此","hence the name","因此得名","比 so 正式"],["whereas","(h)wəˈræz","conj. 然而，而","He is tall, whereas I am short.","他高，而我矮。","表对比"]]}],[{"t":"外貌","e":"Appearance","s":[["First impressions depend on [appearance].","第一印象取决于外表。"],["My uncle's most striking [feature] is his nose.","我叔叔最显眼的特征是他的鼻子。"],["He has a dark [complexion], though he turns [pale] when he is ill.","他肤色较深，不过生病时会变得苍白。"],["A [freckle] or two and a deep [wrinkle] mark his face.","脸上有一两颗雀斑和一道深深的皱纹。"],["He wears a grey [beard] and is nearly [bald]; his son has thick [curly] hair.","他留着灰白的胡子，几乎秃顶；他儿子则有一头浓密的卷发。"],["His wife is tall and [slender]; his sister is short and [plump].","他的妻子高挑苗条，他的妹妹矮矮胖胖。"],["He himself is [stout] but [muscular].","他自己很壮实，但肌肉发达。"],["She is [graceful], while he is [clumsy].","她举止优雅，而他笨手笨脚。"],["He has a [scar] on his chin and a small [tattoo] on his arm.","他下巴上有一道疤，手臂上有一个小纹身。"],["When he reads the news, you see a [frown]; when he sees us, a wide [grin].","他读新闻时，你会看到他皱眉；见到我们时，他会咧嘴大笑。"],["If you praise him, he will [blush].","你要是夸他，他会脸红。"]],"g":[["impressions","印象"],["depend on","取决于"],["striking","显眼的"],["nose","鼻子"],["ill","生病的"],["mark","留下痕迹"],["thick","浓密的"],["chin","下巴"],["arm","手臂"],["wide","大大的"],["praise","表扬"]],"w":[["appearance","əˈpɪrən(t)s","n. 外表；出现","judge by appearance","以貌取人","动词 appear"],["feature","ˈfitʃər","n. 特征；五官 v. 以…为特色","a key feature","主要特点",""],["complexion","kəmˈplɛkʃən","n. 肤色，面色","a fair complexion","白皙的肤色",""],["pale","peɪl","adj. 苍白的；浅色的","turn pale","脸色变白",""],["freckle","ˈfrɛk(ə)l","n. 雀斑","freckles on the nose","鼻子上的雀斑",""],["wrinkle","ˈrɪŋk(ə)l","n. 皱纹 v. 起皱","wrinkles around the eyes","眼角的皱纹",""],["beard","bɪrd","n.（下巴上的）胡须","grow a beard","留胡子","上唇的叫 mustache"],["bald","bɔld","adj. 秃顶的","go bald","秃顶",""],["curly","ˈkərli","adj. 卷曲的","curly hair","卷发","curl 卷"],["slender","ˈslɛndər","adj. 苗条的，纤细的","a slender figure","苗条的身材",""],["plump","pləmp","adj. 丰满的，胖乎乎的","plump cheeks","胖乎乎的脸蛋","比 fat 委婉"],["stout","staʊt","adj. 壮实的，结实的","a stout man","壮实的男人",""],["muscular","ˈməskjələr","adj. 肌肉发达的","muscular arms","肌肉发达的手臂","名词 muscle"],["graceful","ˈɡreɪsfəl","adj. 优雅的","a graceful dancer","优雅的舞者","名词 grace"],["clumsy","ˈkləmzi","adj. 笨拙的","a clumsy waiter","笨手笨脚的服务员",""],["scar","skɑr","n. 伤疤 v. 留下疤痕","leave a scar","留下疤痕",""],["tattoo","tæˈtu","n. 纹身 v. 纹身","get a tattoo","纹身",""],["frown","fraʊn","v./n. 皱眉","frown at sb","对某人皱眉",""],["grin","ɡrɪn","v./n. 咧嘴笑","a wide grin","咧嘴大笑",""],["blush","bləʃ","v./n. 脸红","blush with shame","羞得脸红",""]]},{"t":"人的缺点","e":"Faults","s":[["The old tale has seven brothers, each with one fault.","这个古老的故事里有七兄弟，每人有一个缺点。"],["The first is [greedy], the second [selfish], the third [stingy].","老大贪婪，老二自私，老三吝啬。老四又狡猾又奸诈。"],["The fourth is [cunning] and [sly].","老五爱骗人：他在每笔交易中都不诚实。"],["The fifth is [deceitful]: he is [dishonest] in every deal.","老六冷酷无情，对动物残忍，对对手凶狠。"],["The sixth is [ruthless], [cruel] to animals and [vicious] to rivals.","最小的那个虚荣又自负，而且懒散。"],["The youngest is [vain] and [conceited]; he is also [idle]. Their neighbors are no better: a [timid] farmer, his [cowardly] son, a [rude] innkeeper, an [aggressive] soldier, a [bossy] priest, a [moody] poet, and a [spiteful] cook.","他们的邻居也好不到哪去：一个胆小的农夫，他那懦弱的儿子，一个粗鲁的客栈老板，一个好斗的士兵，一个爱发号施令的牧师，一个喜怒无常的诗人，还有一个怀恨在心的厨子。"],["In the end a child teaches them all.","最后是一个孩子给他们所有人上了一课。"]],"g":[["tale","故事"],["fault","缺点"],["deal","交易"],["rivals","对手"],["youngest","最小的"],["neighbors","邻居"],["innkeeper","客栈老板"],["soldier","士兵"],["priest","牧师"],["poet","诗人"],["cook","厨子"]],"w":[["greedy","ˈɡridi","adj. 贪婪的","be greedy for money","贪财","名词 greed"],["selfish","ˈsɛlfɪʃ","adj. 自私的","a selfish decision","自私的决定","self + -ish"],["stingy","ˈstɪndʒi","adj. 吝啬的","be stingy with money","花钱小气",""],["cunning","ˈkənɪŋ","adj. 狡猾的 n. 狡猾","a cunning fox","狡猾的狐狸",""],["sly","slaɪ","adj. 奸诈的；会意的","a sly smile","狡黠的笑",""],["deceitful","dəˈsitf(ə)l","adj. 骗人的，不诚实的","a deceitful person","爱骗人的人","动词 deceive"],["dishonest","dɪsˈɑnəst","adj. 不诚实的","a dishonest trader","不诚实的商人","dis- 不 + honest"],["ruthless","ˈruθləs","adj. 无情的，冷酷的","a ruthless boss","冷酷的老板",""],["cruel","ˈkru(ə)l","adj. 残忍的","be cruel to animals","虐待动物","名词 cruelty"],["vicious","ˈvɪʃəs","adj. 凶狠的，恶毒的","a vicious dog","恶犬","a vicious circle 恶性循环"],["vain","veɪn","adj. 虚荣的；徒劳的","in vain","徒劳地","名词 vanity"],["conceited","kənˈsidəd","adj. 自负的","a conceited young man","自负的年轻人",""],["idle","ˈaɪd(ə)l","adj. 懒散的；闲置的","an idle student","懒散的学生",""],["timid","ˈtɪməd","adj. 胆小的，羞怯的","a timid child","胆小的孩子",""],["cowardly","ˈkaʊərdli","adj. 懦弱的","a cowardly act","懦弱的行为","名词 coward 懦夫"],["rude","rud","adj. 粗鲁的","be rude to","对…无礼",""],["aggressive","əˈɡrɛsɪv","adj. 好斗的；有进取心的","aggressive behavior","攻击性行为",""],["bossy","ˈbɔsi","adj. 爱发号施令的","a bossy sister","爱指挥人的姐姐","boss + -y"],["moody","ˈmudi","adj. 喜怒无常的","a moody teenager","情绪多变的青少年","mood + -y"],["spiteful","ˈspaɪtf(ə)l","adj. 怀恨的，恶意的","a spiteful remark","恶意的话","名词 spite"]]},{"t":"人的优点","e":"Virtues","s":[["What makes a good friend?","什么样的人算好朋友？"],["Mine is [generous] with her time and always [honest].","我的朋友在时间上很慷慨，而且总是很诚实。"],["She is [loyal] and [trustworthy]: a secret is safe with her.","她忠诚、值得信赖：秘密交给她很安全。"],["She was [courageous] enough to tell me a hard truth.","她有足够的勇气告诉我难以接受的真相。"],["She is a [decent] person with a [noble] heart, [gracious] in victory and [polite] to strangers.","她是个正派的人，有一颗高尚的心，胜利时有风度，对陌生人有礼貌。"],["She is [patient] with children, [cheerful] in the morning, and [energetic] at work.","她对孩子有耐心，早上很开朗，工作时精力充沛。"],["As a nurse she is [dedicated] to her patients and [devoted] to her family.","作为护士，她尽心尽力对待病人，全心全意爱护家人。"],["People call her [selfless].","人们说她无私。"],["She is also [prudent] with money, [sensible] in a crisis, and [sensitive] to others' feelings.","她花钱也很谨慎，遇到危机时很明智，对别人的感受很敏感。"],["Her [thoughtful] gifts are famous, and her [humorous] stories make everyone laugh.","她那些贴心的礼物是出了名的，她幽默的故事总让大家开怀大笑。"]],"g":[["secret","秘密"],["safe","安全的"],["truth","真相"],["heart","心"],["victory","胜利"],["strangers","陌生人"],["nurse","护士"],["patients","病人"],["crisis","危机"],["feelings","感受"],["gifts","礼物"],["famous","出名的"]],"w":[["generous","ˈdʒɛn(ə)rəs","adj. 慷慨的","be generous with money","出手大方","名词 generosity"],["honest","ˈɑnəst","adj. 诚实的","to be honest","说实话","h 不发音"],["loyal","ˈlɔɪ(ə)l","adj. 忠诚的","be loyal to","忠于","名词 loyalty"],["trustworthy","ˈtrəs(t)ˌwərði","adj. 值得信赖的","a trustworthy friend","值得信赖的朋友","trust + worthy"],["courageous","kəˈreɪdʒəs","adj. 勇敢的","a courageous decision","勇敢的决定","名词 courage"],["decent","ˈdis(ə)nt","adj. 正派的；像样的","a decent job","一份体面的工作","别混 descent 下降"],["noble","ˈnoʊb(ə)l","adj. 高尚的；贵族的","a noble cause","崇高的事业",""],["gracious","ˈɡreɪʃəs","adj. 有风度的，和蔼的","a gracious host","和蔼的主人",""],["polite","pəˈlaɪt","adj. 有礼貌的","be polite to","对…有礼貌","反义 impolite"],["patient","ˈpeɪʃənt","adj. 有耐心的 n. 病人","be patient with","对…有耐心","名词 patience"],["cheerful","ˈtʃɪrf(ə)l","adj. 开朗的，愉快的","a cheerful smile","开朗的笑容","cheer + -ful"],["energetic","ˌɛnərˈdʒɛdɪk","adj. 精力充沛的","an energetic child","精力旺盛的孩子","名词 energy"],["dedicated","ˈdɛdəˌkeɪdəd","adj. 尽心尽力的；专用的","be dedicated to","致力于","动词 dedicate"],["devoted","dəˈvoʊdəd","adj. 挚爱的，忠实的","be devoted to","深爱；专心于","动词 devote"],["selfless","ˈsɛlfləs","adj. 无私的","a selfless act","无私的行为","self + -less"],["prudent","ˈprudnt","adj. 谨慎的，精明的","a prudent investor","谨慎的投资者",""],["sensible","ˈsɛn(t)səbəl","adj. 明智的，理智的","a sensible choice","明智的选择","别混 sensitive"],["sensitive","ˈsɛn(t)sədɪv","adj. 敏感的；体贴的","be sensitive to","对…敏感","别混 sensible"],["thoughtful","ˈθɔtf(ə)l","adj. 体贴的；深思的","a thoughtful gift","贴心的礼物","thought + -ful"],["humorous","ˈhjumərəs","adj. 幽默的","a humorous story","幽默的故事","名词 humor"]]},{"t":"商务谈判","e":"Negotiation","s":[["Each company sent a [representative].","每家公司派了一名代表。"],["Ours opened with a [proposal]; theirs replied with a lower [offer].","我方先提出一份提案，对方回了一个更低的报价。"],["We raised our [bid].","我们提高了出价。"],["Then we discussed [terms], one [condition] at a time.","然后我们讨论条款，一个条件一个条件地谈。"],["Each side had a lot at [stake].","双方都利害攸关。"],["Their large orders gave them [leverage].","他们的大额订单给了他们筹码。"],["Our [tactic] was patience.","我们的策略是耐心。"],["At one point they said they would leave; it was a [bluff].","有一刻他们说要走，那是在虚张声势。"],["Next came an [ultimatum]: sign by Friday.","接着来了最后通牒：周五前签字。"],["Talks reached a [deadlock].","谈判陷入僵局。"],["After a two-day [stalemate], a lunch ended the [impasse].","僵持两天后，一顿午饭打破了僵局。"],["A little [goodwill] helped.","一点善意起了作用。"],["By evening we had an [agreement].","到傍晚我们达成了协议。"],["The [deal] needed only a [signature].","这笔交易只差一个签名。"],["A [handshake] and a red company [seal] closed it.","一次握手和一枚红色的公司印章让它尘埃落定。"]],"g":[["opened","开场"],["replied","回应"],["raised","提高"],["discussed","讨论"],["side","一方"],["orders","订单"],["patience","耐心"],["point","时刻"],["sign","签字"],["talks","谈判"],["reached","陷入"],["ended","结束"],["closed","完成"]],"w":[["representative","ˌrɛprəˈzɛn(t)ədɪv","n. 代表 adj. 有代表性的","a sales representative","销售代表","动词 represent"],["proposal","prəˈpoʊz(ə)l","n. 提案，建议；求婚","submit a proposal","提交提案","动词 propose"],["offer","ˈɔfər","n. 报价；提议 v. 提供","make an offer","出价",""],["bid","bɪd","n. 出价，投标 v. 出价","a bid for the contract","竞标合同","bid – bid – bid"],["terms","tərmz","n. 条款，条件","terms and conditions","条款与条件","in terms of 就…而言"],["condition","kənˈdɪʃən","n. 条件；状况","on condition that","条件是",""],["stake","steɪk","n. 利害关系；赌注；股份","at stake","利害攸关","stakeholder 利益相关者"],["leverage","ˈlɛv(ə)rɪdʒ","n. 影响力，筹码；杠杆","have leverage over","对…有筹码","lever 杠杆"],["tactic","ˈtæktɪk","n. 策略，手段","a delaying tactic","拖延战术","strategy 是大战略"],["bluff","bləf","n./v. 虚张声势","call sb's bluff","揭穿某人的虚张声势",""],["ultimatum","ˌəltəˈmeɪdəm","n. 最后通牒","issue an ultimatum","下最后通牒","ultim = 最后"],["deadlock","ˈdɛdˌlɑk","n. 僵局","break the deadlock","打破僵局","dead + lock"],["stalemate","ˈsteɪlˌmeɪt","n. 僵持局面","end in stalemate","以僵局告终","原为象棋术语"],["impasse","ˈɪmˌpæs","n. 僵局，绝境","reach an impasse","陷入僵局","im- 不 + pass"],["goodwill","ˌɡʊdˈwɪl","n. 善意；商誉","a gesture of goodwill","善意的表示",""],["agreement","əˈɡrim(ə)nt","n. 协议；同意","reach an agreement","达成协议","动词 agree"],["deal","dil","n. 交易；协议 v. 处理","close a deal","成交","deal with 处理"],["signature","ˈsɪɡnətʃər","n. 签名","put one's signature on","在…上签名","动词 sign"],["handshake","ˈhæn(d)ˌʃeɪk","n. 握手","a firm handshake","有力的握手","shake hands 的名词"],["seal","si(ə)l","n. 印章；密封；海豹 v. 密封","a company seal","公司印章",""]]},{"t":"办公室","e":"Office","s":[["On my first day, a [colleague] showed me around.","上班第一天，一位同事带我四处看了看。"],["The boss's [secretary] sits by the door, next to the [receptionist].","老板的秘书坐在门边，挨着前台接待员。"],["A [clerk] took me to my [cubicle].","一名职员把我带到我的隔间。"],["A [memo] was waiting: read the [minutes] of the last meeting before the ten o'clock [conference].","一份备忘录在等着我：十点开会前先读上次会议的纪要。"],["I had to give a short [presentation] after the morning [briefing].","晨间简报之后，我得做一个简短的演示。"],["My data were in a [spreadsheet], saved in a [file] inside the wrong [folder].","我的数据在一张电子表格里，存成的文件却放错了文件夹。"],["I made a [photocopy] of my notes, but the [printer] jammed.","我把笔记复印了一份，可是打印机卡纸了。"],["I borrowed some [stationery] and finished the [paperwork] by hand.","我借了些文具，手写完成了文书工作。"],["Then I sent an email without the [attachment].","接着我发了一封没带附件的邮件。"],["A [reminder] popped up: check your [calendar].","一条提醒弹了出来：查看你的日历。"]],"g":[["showed around","带…参观"],["boss","老板"],["waiting","等着"],["data","数据"],["saved","保存"],["notes","笔记"],["jammed","卡住"],["borrowed","借"],["by hand","手写"],["popped up","弹出"],["check","查看"]],"w":[["colleague","ˈkɑliɡ","n. 同事","a former colleague","前同事",""],["secretary","ˈsɛkrəˌtɛri","n. 秘书；部长","a personal secretary","私人秘书",""],["receptionist","rəˈsɛpʃənəst","n. 接待员","a hotel receptionist","酒店前台","reception + -ist"],["clerk","klərk","n. 职员，办事员","a bank clerk","银行职员",""],["cubicle","ˈkjubək(ə)l","n.（办公室）隔间","an office cubicle","办公隔间",""],["memo","ˈmɛmoʊ","n. 备忘录","send a memo","发备忘录","memorandum 的缩写"],["minutes","ˈmɪnɪts","n. 会议纪要","take the minutes","做会议记录","单数 minute 是“分钟”"],["conference","ˈkɑnf(ə)rən(t)s","n. 会议","a press conference","新闻发布会",""],["presentation","ˌpriˌzɛnˈteɪʃən","n. 演示，报告；呈现","give a presentation","做演示","动词 present"],["briefing","ˈbrifɪŋ","n. 简报，情况介绍","a press briefing","新闻吹风会","brief 简短的"],["spreadsheet","ˈsprɛdˌʃit","n. 电子表格","open a spreadsheet","打开电子表格",""],["file","faɪl","n. 文件，档案 v. 归档；提起","save a file","保存文件",""],["folder","ˈfoʊldər","n. 文件夹","create a folder","新建文件夹","fold 折叠"],["photocopy","ˈfoʊdəˌkɑpi","n./v. 复印（件）","make a photocopy","复印一份","photo + copy"],["printer","ˈprɪn(t)ər","n. 打印机","a laser printer","激光打印机",""],["stationery","ˈsteɪʃəˌnɛri","n. 文具","office stationery","办公文具","别混 stationary 静止的"],["paperwork","ˈpeɪpərˌwərk","n. 文书工作","do the paperwork","处理文书工作",""],["attachment","əˈtætʃmənt","n. 附件；依恋","open an attachment","打开附件","动词 attach"],["reminder","rəˈmaɪndər","n. 提醒","set a reminder","设置提醒","remind + -er"],["calendar","ˈkæləndər","n. 日历；日程表","mark it on the calendar","在日历上标出",""]]},{"t":"学科","e":"Disciplines","s":[["A university is a map of knowledge.","大学是一张知识地图。"],["[Mathematics] is its language.","数学是它的语言。"],["[Physics] studies matter and energy, [chemistry] studies substances, and [biology] studies life.","物理学研究物质和能量，化学研究物质的成分，生物学研究生命。"],["[Geology] reads the rocks; [ecology] studies how living things depend on each other.","地质学解读岩石；生态学研究生物之间如何相互依存。"],["[Psychology] looks at the mind, [sociology] at society, and [anthropology] at human cultures.","心理学研究心智，社会学研究社会，人类学研究人类文化。"],["[Economics] uses [statistics] to study choice.","经济学用统计学来研究选择。"],["[Engineering] builds, [medicine] heals, and [literature] asks what it all means.","工程学负责建造，医学负责治愈，文学追问这一切意味着什么。"],["The [humanities] remind us that every [theory] began as a question.","人文学科提醒我们，每一个理论最初都是一个问题。"],["One [principle] holds everywhere: test your ideas.","有一条原则放之四海而皆准：检验你的想法。"],["The best work today is [interdisciplinary].","当今最好的研究是跨学科的。"],["You must [specialize] to gain [expertise], but keep your eyes open.","你必须专攻一门才能获得专长，但要保持开阔的眼界。"]],"g":[["map","地图"],["knowledge","知识"],["matter","物质"],["energy","能量"],["substances","物质"],["rocks","岩石"],["living things","生物"],["mind","心智"],["society","社会"],["choice","选择"],["heals","治愈"],["remind","提醒"],["holds","适用"],["test","检验"],["gain","获得"]],"w":[["mathematics","ˌmæθ(ə)ˈmædɪks","n. 数学","pure mathematics","纯数学","口语 math / maths"],["physics","ˈfɪzɪks","n. 物理学","nuclear physics","核物理","physicist 物理学家"],["chemistry","ˈkɛməstri","n. 化学","organic chemistry","有机化学","chemist 化学家"],["biology","baɪˈɑlədʒi","n. 生物学","marine biology","海洋生物学","bio- 生命 + -logy 学"],["geology","dʒiˈɑlədʒi","n. 地质学","study geology","学地质学","geo- 地"],["ecology","iˈkɑlədʒi","n. 生态学；生态","the ecology of the lake","湖泊的生态","eco- 生态"],["psychology","saɪˈkɑlədʒi","n. 心理学","child psychology","儿童心理学","p 不发音"],["sociology","ˌsoʊsiˈɑlədʒi","n. 社会学","study sociology","学社会学","socio- 社会"],["anthropology","ˌænθrəˈpɑlədʒi","n. 人类学","cultural anthropology","文化人类学","anthropo- 人"],["economics","ˌɛkəˈnɑmɪks","n. 经济学","study economics","学经济学","economist 经济学家"],["statistics","stəˈtɪstɪks","n. 统计学；统计数据","official statistics","官方统计数据",""],["engineering","ˌɛndʒəˈnɪrɪŋ","n. 工程学","civil engineering","土木工程","engineer 工程师"],["medicine","ˈmɛdəs(ə)n","n. 医学；药","study medicine","学医","形容词 medical"],["literature","ˈlɪdər(ə)tʃər","n. 文学；文献","English literature","英国文学",""],["humanities","hjuˈmænədiz","n. 人文学科","the humanities","人文学科","常用复数"],["theory","ˈθɪri","n. 理论","in theory","理论上","形容词 theoretical"],["principle","ˈprɪn(t)səp(ə)l","n. 原则，原理","in principle","原则上","别混 principal 校长"],["interdisciplinary","ˌɪn(t)ərˈdɪsəpləˌnɛri","adj. 跨学科的","interdisciplinary research","跨学科研究","inter- + discipline"],["specialize","ˈspɛʃəˌlaɪz","v. 专攻","specialize in law","专攻法律","special + -ize"],["expertise","ˌɛkˌspərˈtiz","n. 专业知识，专长","technical expertise","技术专长","expert 专家"]]},{"t":"事故","e":"Accident","s":[["The [accident] happened at noon.","事故发生在中午。"],["An [explosion] shook the factory, and a [blaze] spread through the roof.","一声爆炸震动了工厂，大火蔓延到整个屋顶。"],["People saw a red [flame] and black [smoke] from miles away.","几英里外的人都能看到红色的火焰和黑烟。"],["It took two hours to [extinguish] the fire.","扑灭大火用了两个小时。"],["One [firefighter] found three workers [trapped] under [rubble].","一名消防员发现三名工人被困在瓦砾下。"],["[Debris] covered the street, and the [wreckage] of a truck blocked the gate.","碎片铺满了街道，一辆卡车的残骸堵住了大门。"],["The first [victim] was lucky: he did not [bleed] much and had only a [bruise] and a [fracture] in one arm.","第一位受害者很幸运：他流血不多，只是有一处瘀伤，一只手臂骨折。"],["Another was [unconscious].","另一位昏迷不醒。"],["A [paramedic] placed her on a [stretcher] and put a [bandage] on her head.","一名急救人员把她抬上担架，在她头上缠了绷带。"],["Luckily, the accident was not [fatal].","幸运的是，这起事故没有造成死亡。"]],"g":[["happened","发生"],["noon","中午"],["shook","震动"],["factory","工厂"],["spread","蔓延"],["roof","屋顶"],["miles","英里"],["covered","铺满"],["truck","卡车"],["blocked","堵住"],["gate","大门"],["lucky","幸运的"],["placed","放置"]],"w":[["accident","ˈæksədnt","n. 事故；意外","a car accident","车祸","by accident 偶然"],["explosion","ɪkˈsploʊʒ(ə)n","n. 爆炸；激增","a gas explosion","煤气爆炸","动词 explode"],["blaze","bleɪz","n. 大火 v. 熊熊燃烧","fight a blaze","扑救大火",""],["flame","fleɪm","n. 火焰","burst into flames","突然起火",""],["smoke","smoʊk","n. 烟 v. 冒烟；吸烟","thick smoke","浓烟",""],["extinguish","ɪkˈstɪŋɡwɪʃ","v. 扑灭，熄灭","extinguish a fire","灭火","fire extinguisher 灭火器"],["firefighter","ˈfaɪ(ə)rˌfaɪdər","n. 消防员","a brave firefighter","勇敢的消防员",""],["trapped","træpt","adj. 被困的","be trapped in a lift","被困在电梯里","动词 trap"],["rubble","ˈrəb(ə)l","n. 瓦砾，碎石","be buried under rubble","被埋在瓦砾下",""],["debris","dəˈbri","n. 碎片，残骸","clear the debris","清理碎片","s 不发音"],["wreckage","ˈrɛkɪdʒ","n. 残骸","the wreckage of a plane","飞机残骸","动词 wreck"],["victim","ˈvɪktəm","n. 受害者","a victim of crime","犯罪受害者",""],["bleed","blid","v. 流血","bleed heavily","大量出血","bleed – bled – bled；名词 blood"],["bruise","bruz","n. 瘀伤 v. 碰伤","a bruise on the knee","膝盖上的瘀伤",""],["fracture","ˈfræktʃər","n. 骨折；断裂 v. 使断裂","a leg fracture","腿部骨折","fract = 破碎"],["unconscious","ˌənˈkɑnʃəs","adj. 失去知觉的；无意识的","be knocked unconscious","被打昏","un- + conscious"],["paramedic","ˌpɛrəˈmɛdɪk","n. 急救人员","call the paramedics","叫急救人员","para- 辅助 + medic"],["stretcher","ˈstrɛtʃər","n. 担架","carry sb on a stretcher","用担架抬某人","stretch 伸展"],["bandage","ˈbændɪdʒ","n. 绷带 v. 包扎","put on a bandage","缠上绷带",""],["fatal","ˈfeɪd(ə)l","adj. 致命的","a fatal accident","致命事故","fate 命运"]]},{"t":"下厨","e":"Cooking","s":[["My grandmother's soup starts simply.","我祖母的汤做起来很简单。"],["[Rinse] the vegetables and [peel] the potatoes.","把蔬菜冲洗干净，土豆削皮。"],["[Chop] the onion, [slice] the carrots, and [dice] the tomatoes.","洋葱切碎，胡萝卜切片，西红柿切丁。"],["[Grate] a little ginger.","擦一点姜末。"],["[Soak] the beans overnight and [drain] them.","豆子泡一夜后沥干。"],["[Stir] everything in a pot.","把所有东西放进锅里搅拌。"],["In a bowl, [whisk] two eggs and [blend] them with flour; [knead] the dough for noodles.","在碗里打两个鸡蛋，和面粉混合均匀，揉成面团做面条。"],["Let the soup [boil], then [simmer] for an hour.","把汤烧开，然后小火炖一小时。"],["She would [steam] buns beside it and [fry] an egg for me.","她会在旁边蒸包子，再给我煎一个鸡蛋。"],["On Sundays she would [bake] bread or [grill] fish.","星期天她会烤面包或烤鱼。"],["Before serving, [sprinkle] salt on top and [garnish] the bowl with green onion.","上桌前，在上面撒点盐，再用葱花点缀一下。"]],"g":[["soup","汤"],["vegetables","蔬菜"],["potatoes","土豆"],["onion","洋葱"],["carrots","胡萝卜"],["ginger","姜"],["beans","豆子"],["overnight","一整夜"],["pot","锅"],["bowl","碗"],["flour","面粉"],["dough","面团"],["noodles","面条"],["buns","包子"],["serving","上菜"]],"w":[["rinse","rɪn(t)s","v./n. 冲洗","rinse the rice","淘米",""],["peel","pil","v. 削皮，剥皮 n. 果皮","peel an apple","削苹果",""],["chop","tʃɑp","v. 切碎，砍","chop an onion","切洋葱","chopsticks 筷子"],["slice","slaɪs","v. 切片 n. 薄片","a slice of bread","一片面包",""],["dice","daɪs","v. 切丁 n. 骰子","dice the carrots","把胡萝卜切丁",""],["grate","ɡreɪt","v. 擦碎，磨碎","grate cheese","擦奶酪丝",""],["soak","soʊk","v. 浸泡","soak the beans","泡豆子",""],["drain","dreɪn","v. 沥干；排水 n. 下水道","drain the pasta","把面沥干",""],["stir","stər","v. 搅拌；激起","stir the soup","搅汤","stir-fry 翻炒"],["whisk","(h)wɪsk","v. 搅打 n. 打蛋器","whisk the eggs","打蛋",""],["blend","blɛnd","v. 混合 n. 混合物","blend the ingredients","把配料混合","blender 搅拌机"],["knead","nid","v. 揉（面团）","knead the dough","揉面","k 不发音"],["boil","bɔɪl","v. 煮沸，烧开","boil water","烧水",""],["simmer","ˈsɪmər","v. 用小火炖","simmer for ten minutes","小火炖十分钟",""],["steam","stim","v. 蒸 n. 蒸汽","steamed fish","清蒸鱼",""],["fry","fraɪ","v. 油炸，煎","fry an egg","煎鸡蛋","fried rice 炒饭"],["bake","beɪk","v. 烘烤","bake a cake","烤蛋糕","bakery 面包店"],["grill","ɡrɪl","v. 烧烤 n. 烤架","grilled fish","烤鱼",""],["sprinkle","ˈsprɪŋkəl","v. 撒，洒","sprinkle sugar on","在…上撒糖",""],["garnish","ˈɡɑrnɪʃ","v. 装饰（菜肴）n. 配菜","garnish with parsley","用欧芹点缀",""]]},{"t":"绘画","e":"Painting","s":[["The painter's [studio] smells of oil.","画家的工作室里弥漫着油彩的气味。"],["A wooden [easel] holds a large [canvas].","一个木画架上支着一大块画布。"],["She picks up a [brush] and mixes colors on her [palette].","她拿起画笔，在调色板上调色。"],["One blue [pigment] comes from a rare stone; its [hue] changes with the light.","有一种蓝色颜料来自一种稀有的石头，它的色调随光线变化。"],["She adds a darker [shade] for the evening sky.","她为傍晚的天空加了一层更深的色度。"],["Every work begins as a pencil [sketch].","每件作品都从一张铅笔素描开始。"],["This one is a [portrait] of her mother; behind the figure is a [landscape] of hills.","这一幅是她母亲的肖像，人物身后是一片山丘风景。"],["She also paints in [watercolor].","她也画水彩。"],["Her mother had to [pose] for hours.","她母亲不得不摆了好几个小时的姿势。"],["When the paint is dry, a gold [frame] is added.","颜料干了以后，再装上金色的画框。"],["A small [gallery] will show it in an [exhibition] next month.","一家小画廊下个月将在一场展览中展出它。"],["The [curator] hopes an [auction] house will notice.","策展人希望能引起一家拍卖行的注意。"],["One [collector] has already asked for a [replica].","已经有一位收藏家想要一件复制品了。"]],"g":[["painter","画家"],["smells of","有…的气味"],["wooden","木制的"],["holds","支着"],["picks up","拿起"],["mixes","调和"],["rare","稀有的"],["adds","添加"],["pencil","铅笔"],["figure","人物"],["hills","山丘"],["paint","颜料"],["dry","干的"],["notice","注意到"]],"w":[["studio","ˈstudioʊ","n. 工作室；演播室","an art studio","画室",""],["easel","ˈiz(ə)l","n. 画架","set up an easel","支起画架",""],["canvas","ˈkænvəs","n. 画布；帆布","oil on canvas","布面油画",""],["brush","brəʃ","n. 刷子，画笔 v. 刷","a paint brush","画笔",""],["palette","ˈpælət","n. 调色板；色调","a color palette","配色",""],["pigment","ˈpɪɡm(ə)nt","n. 颜料；色素","a natural pigment","天然颜料",""],["hue","(h)ju","n. 色调，色彩","a golden hue","金色调",""],["shade","ʃeɪd","n. 色度；阴凉处 v. 遮挡","a shade of blue","一种蓝色","in the shade 在阴凉处"],["sketch","skɛtʃ","n. 素描；草图 v. 画素描","a pencil sketch","铅笔素描",""],["portrait","ˈpɔrtrət","n. 肖像","a family portrait","全家福","动词 portray"],["landscape","ˈlæn(d)ˌskeɪp","n. 风景；风景画","a mountain landscape","山景","land + scape"],["watercolor","ˈwɔtərˌkələr","n. 水彩（画）","paint in watercolor","画水彩","英式 watercolour"],["pose","poʊz","v. 摆姿势；造成 n. 姿势","pose for a photo","摆姿势拍照","pose a threat 构成威胁"],["frame","freɪm","n. 框架，画框 v. 给…装框","a picture frame","相框",""],["gallery","ˈɡæl(ə)ri","n. 画廊，美术馆","an art gallery","美术馆",""],["exhibition","ˌɛksəˈbɪʃən","n. 展览","an art exhibition","艺术展","动词 exhibit"],["curator","ˈkjʊˌreɪdər","n. 策展人，馆长","a museum curator","博物馆馆长",""],["auction","ˈɔkʃən","n./v. 拍卖","sell at auction","拍卖出售",""],["collector","kəˈlɛktər","n. 收藏家；收集者","an art collector","艺术品收藏家","动词 collect"],["replica","ˈrɛpləkə","n. 复制品","an exact replica","一模一样的复制品",""]]},{"t":"宏观经济","e":"Macroeconomy","s":[["An economy moves between [boom] and [slump].","经济在繁荣与萧条之间起伏。"],["In a [downturn], [demand] falls while [supply] stays high.","在经济低迷时，需求下降而供给依然很高。"],["In good years there may be a [shortage] of workers.","在好年景，可能出现工人短缺。"],["Growth needs [investment].","增长需要投资。"],["A small country must [export] more than it [imports], so [trade] matters.","小国的出口必须多于进口，所以贸易很重要。"],["When one [sector] grows, others follow; the car [industry] feeds steel and glass.","一个行业增长，其他行业也会跟着增长；汽车产业带动钢铁和玻璃。"],["The central bank sets [monetary] [policy].","中央银行制定货币政策。"],["Some governments [deregulate] markets and [privatize] state firms.","有些政府放松对市场的管制，把国有企业私有化。"],["Economists watch each [indicator], such as the price [index].","经济学家关注每一项指标，比如物价指数。"],["Every [cycle] ends, they say.","他们说，每个周期都会结束。"],["This year the [outlook] is cautious.","今年的前景偏谨慎。"]],"g":[["economy","经济"],["falls","下降"],["stays","保持"],["growth","增长"],["matters","重要"],["follow","跟随"],["feeds","带动"],["steel","钢铁"],["central bank","中央银行"],["sets","制定"],["markets","市场"],["state firms","国有企业"],["economists","经济学家"],["cautious","谨慎的"]],"w":[["boom","bum","n. 繁荣，激增 v. 迅速发展","an economic boom","经济繁荣",""],["slump","sləmp","n. 萧条，暴跌 v. 骤降","an economic slump","经济萧条",""],["downturn","ˈdaʊnˌtərn","n. 衰退，低迷","an economic downturn","经济低迷","down + turn"],["demand","dəˈmænd","n. 需求；要求 v. 要求","supply and demand","供求",""],["supply","səˈplaɪ","n. 供给 v. 供应","water supply","供水","supplier 供应商"],["shortage","ˈʃɔrdɪdʒ","n. 短缺","a labor shortage","劳动力短缺","short + -age"],["investment","ɪnˈvɛs(t)m(ə)nt","n. 投资","foreign investment","外国投资","动词 invest"],["export","ˈɛkˌspɔrt","v. 出口 n. 出口（商品）","export goods","出口货物","ex- 向外 + port 运"],["import","ɪmˈpɔrt","v. 进口 n. 进口（商品）","import oil","进口石油","im- 向内 + port 运"],["trade","treɪd","n. 贸易 v. 交易","international trade","国际贸易",""],["sector","ˈsɛktər","n. 部门，行业","the private sector","私营部门",""],["industry","ˈɪndəstri","n. 工业；行业","the car industry","汽车业","形容词 industrial"],["monetary","ˈmɑnəˌtɛri","adj. 货币的","monetary policy","货币政策","money 的形容词"],["policy","ˈpɑləsi","n. 政策；保险单","foreign policy","外交政策",""],["deregulate","dəˈrɛɡjʊˌleɪt","v. 放松管制","deregulate the market","放松市场管制","de- 去 + regulate"],["privatize","ˈpraɪvəˌtaɪz","v. 使私有化","privatize a company","把公司私有化","private + -ize"],["indicator","ˈɪndəˌkeɪdər","n. 指标；指示器","an economic indicator","经济指标","动词 indicate"],["index","ˈɪnˌdɛks","n. 指数；索引","the price index","物价指数","复数 indexes / indices"],["cycle","ˈsaɪkəl","n. 周期，循环 v. 骑自行车","a business cycle","商业周期",""],["outlook","ˈaʊtˌlʊk","n. 前景；观点","the economic outlook","经济前景","look out 的名词"]]},{"t":"常用副词","e":"Adverbs","s":[["[Initially] I hated running.","起初我讨厌跑步。"],["[Eventually] I came to enjoy it, and [ultimately] it changed my life.","后来我渐渐喜欢上它，最终它改变了我的生活。"],["At first I ran [merely] to lose weight, [solely] on weekends, and [primarily] indoors.","一开始我跑步仅仅是为了减肥，只在周末跑，而且主要在室内。"],["I covered [roughly] two kilometers and was only [slightly] faster than walking.","我大概跑两公里，只比走路稍微快一点。"],["I could [barely] breathe and [scarcely] finish.","我几乎喘不过气，差点跑不完。"],["I [seldom] ran in rain.","我很少在雨中跑步。"],["Now I run [frequently], and [occasionally] I join a race.","现在我经常跑，偶尔还参加比赛。"],["I [deliberately] leave my phone at home.","我故意把手机留在家里。"],["Last year I [accidentally] took a wrong turn and found a lake.","去年我无意中拐错了弯，发现了一个湖。"],["[Apparently] few people know it.","看来没什么人知道它。"],["[Evidently] the path is old; [presumably] farmers once used it.","显然那条小路很古老，想必农民曾经走过。"],["Many things improved, [notably] my sleep, and [specifically] my mornings.","很多方面都有改善，尤其是我的睡眠，具体来说是我的早晨。"]],"g":[["hated","讨厌"],["lose weight","减肥"],["indoors","在室内"],["covered","跑完"],["breathe","呼吸"],["race","比赛"],["turn","拐弯"],["lake","湖"],["path","小路"],["improved","改善"]],"w":[["initially","ɪˈnɪʃ(ə)li","adv. 起初","Initially, I refused.","起初我拒绝了。","形容词 initial"],["eventually","əˈvɛn(t)ʃəli","adv. 最终，终于","eventually succeed","最终成功","不是“偶然”"],["ultimately","ˈəltəmətli","adv. 最终，归根结底","ultimately responsible","负最终责任","形容词 ultimate"],["merely","ˈmɪrli","adv. 仅仅，只不过","merely a joke","只是个玩笑","形容词 mere"],["solely","ˈsoʊ(l)li","adv. 仅仅；独自地","solely responsible","负全责","形容词 sole"],["primarily","praɪˈmɛrəli","adv. 主要地","primarily for students","主要面向学生","形容词 primary"],["roughly","ˈrəfli","adv. 大约；粗暴地","roughly 50 people","大约 50 人","形容词 rough"],["slightly","ˈslaɪtli","adv. 稍微","slightly different","略有不同","形容词 slight"],["barely","ˈbɛrli","adv. 几乎不；勉强","barely pass","勉强及格","本身含否定意思"],["scarcely","ˈskɛrsli","adv. 几乎不","scarcely any time","几乎没时间","本身含否定意思"],["seldom","ˈsɛldəm","adv. 很少","seldom go out","很少出门","近义 rarely"],["frequently","ˈfrikwən(t)li","adv. 经常","frequently asked questions","常见问题","FAQ 的 F"],["occasionally","əˈkeɪʒ(ə)nəli","adv. 偶尔","occasionally eat out","偶尔出去吃","名词 occasion"],["deliberately","dəˈlɪb(ə)rətli","adv. 故意地；从容地","deliberately ignore","故意无视","形容词 deliberate"],["accidentally","ˌæksəˈdɛn(t)əli","adv. 意外地，无意中","accidentally delete a file","误删文件",""],["apparently","əˈpɛrən(t)li","adv. 看来，似乎；显然","Apparently he is ill.","看来他病了。","形容词 apparent"],["evidently","ˈɛvəd(ə)ntli","adv. 显然","evidently wrong","显然错了","evidence 证据"],["presumably","priˈzuməbli","adv. 想必，大概","presumably true","想必是真的","动词 presume"],["notably","ˈnoʊdəbli","adv. 尤其，显著地","most notably","最值得注意的是","形容词 notable"],["specifically","spəˈsɪfək(ə)li","adv. 具体地，特别地","more specifically","更具体地说","形容词 specific"]]},{"t":"污染治理","e":"Pollution","s":[["Factories still [pollute] this river.","工厂仍在污染这条河。"],["The main [pollutant] is a [toxic] metal.","主要污染物是一种有毒金属。"],["In winter, [smog] covers the city; car [exhaust] and factory [fumes] are to blame.","冬天，雾霾笼罩城市，罪魁祸首是汽车尾气和工厂废气。"],["One [chemical] plant used to [discharge] waste at night and [dump] barrels in the forest.","有一家化工厂过去常在夜里排放废物，并把桶倾倒在森林里。"],["An oil [spill] killed thousands of fish.","一次石油泄漏害死了成千上万条鱼。"],["Now a new plant can [purify] the water with a giant [filter].","现在一座新工厂能用巨型过滤器净化水。"],["Proper [treatment] and safe [disposal] cost money.","妥善的处理和安全的处置都要花钱。"],["Some towns [incinerate] rubbish; others prefer [biodegradable] bags and [compost] food waste.","有些城镇焚烧垃圾，另一些则更愿意用可生物降解的袋子，并把厨余垃圾做成堆肥。"],["Everyone can cut their [carbon] [footprint], and firms can [offset] the rest by planting trees.","每个人都可以减少自己的碳足迹，企业可以通过植树来抵消剩余的部分。"]],"g":[["factories","工厂"],["main","主要的"],["covers","笼罩"],["to blame","应负责任"],["plant","工厂"],["waste","废物"],["barrels","桶"],["thousands","成千上万"],["giant","巨型的"],["proper","妥善的"],["rubbish","垃圾"],["prefer","更喜欢"],["firms","企业"],["rest","剩余部分"]],"w":[["pollute","pəˈlut","v. 污染","pollute the air","污染空气","名词 pollution"],["pollutant","pəˈlutnt","n. 污染物","air pollutants","空气污染物",""],["toxic","ˈtɑksɪk","adj. 有毒的","toxic waste","有毒废物","名词 toxin 毒素"],["smog","smɔɡ","n. 雾霾，烟雾","heavy smog","严重雾霾","smoke + fog"],["exhaust","ɪɡˈzɔst","n. 废气 v. 使筋疲力尽；用尽","car exhaust","汽车尾气","exhausted 累坏了"],["fume","fjum","n.（难闻或有害的）气体","toxic fumes","有毒气体","常用复数"],["chemical","ˈkɛmək(ə)l","adj. 化学的 n. 化学品","a chemical plant","化工厂",""],["discharge","dɪsˈtʃɑrdʒ","v./n. 排放；出院；解雇","discharge waste water","排放废水",""],["dump","dəmp","v. 倾倒；抛弃 n. 垃圾场","dump waste","倾倒垃圾",""],["spill","spɪl","n. 溢出，泄漏 v. 洒出","an oil spill","石油泄漏",""],["purify","ˈpjʊrəˌfaɪ","v. 净化","purify water","净化水","pure + -ify"],["filter","ˈfɪltər","n. 过滤器 v. 过滤","a water filter","净水器",""],["treatment","ˈtritmənt","n. 处理；治疗；对待","waste treatment","废物处理","动词 treat"],["disposal","dəˈspoʊz(ə)l","n. 处置，清除","waste disposal","垃圾处理","动词 dispose of"],["incinerate","ɪnˈsɪnəˌreɪt","v. 焚烧","incinerate rubbish","焚烧垃圾","名词 incinerator 焚化炉"],["biodegradable","ˌbaɪoʊdəˈɡreɪdəb(ə)l","adj. 可生物降解的","biodegradable plastic","可降解塑料","bio- + degrade + -able"],["compost","ˈkɑmˌpoʊst","v. 堆肥 n. 堆肥","make compost","制作堆肥",""],["carbon","ˈkɑrbən","n. 碳","carbon dioxide","二氧化碳",""],["footprint","ˈfʊtˌprɪnt","n. 脚印；足迹","a carbon footprint","碳足迹","foot + print"],["offset","ˌɔfˈsɛt","v. 抵消，补偿 n. 抵消物","offset the cost","抵消成本","offset – offset – offset"]]},{"t":"性别平等","e":"Gender","s":[["[Gender] [equality] is written into our law, but each social [norm] changes slowly.","性别平等已写入我们的法律，但每一种社会规范都变化得很慢。"],["Boys are told to be [masculine], girls to be [feminine].","男孩被教导要有男子气概，女孩要有女人味。"],["[Feminism] questions these rules.","女权主义对这些规则提出质疑。"],["A [feminist] does not hate men; she opposes [bias].","女权主义者并不仇视男性，她反对的是偏见。"],["[Sexism] at work may be quiet, like a joke, or serious, like [harassment].","职场中的性别歧视可能很隐蔽，像一句玩笑，也可能很严重，比如骚扰。"],["The pay [gap] is real, and so is the glass [ceiling].","薪酬差距是真实存在的，玻璃天花板也是。"],["Many men are still the only [breadwinner], and many women remain a [housewife] without choosing it.","许多男性仍然是唯一养家糊口的人，许多女性并非出于自愿却一直做家庭主妇。"],["Longer [parental] leave would help.","更长的育儿假会有帮助。"],["An [inclusive] office improves women's [visibility] in top jobs.","一个包容的办公环境能提高女性在高层职位中的可见度。"],["Education can [liberate] girls.","教育能解放女孩。"],["A century ago, women won [suffrage]; the struggle to [emancipate] both sexes from old roles goes on.","一个世纪前，女性赢得了选举权；把男女双方从旧角色中解放出来的斗争仍在继续。"]],"g":[["social","社会的"],["questions","质疑"],["hate","仇视"],["opposes","反对"],["joke","玩笑"],["serious","严重的"],["pay","薪酬"],["remain","仍然是"],["leave","假期"],["improves","提高"],["top jobs","高层职位"],["education","教育"],["century","世纪"],["struggle","斗争"],["sexes","性别"],["roles","角色"]],"w":[["gender","ˈdʒɛndər","n. 性别","gender roles","性别角色",""],["equality","iˈkwɑlədi","n. 平等","racial equality","种族平等","反义 inequality"],["norm","nɔrm","n. 规范，准则；常态","social norms","社会规范","形容词 normal"],["masculine","ˈmæskjələn","adj. 男性的，有男子气概的","a masculine voice","阳刚的嗓音",""],["feminine","ˈfɛmənən","adj. 女性的，有女人味的","a feminine style","女性化的风格",""],["feminism","ˈfɛməˌnɪzəm","n. 女权主义","modern feminism","现代女权主义",""],["feminist","ˈfɛmənəst","n. 女权主义者 adj. 女权主义的","a feminist writer","女权主义作家",""],["bias","ˈbaɪəs","n. 偏见 v. 使有偏见","bias against women","对女性的偏见","形容词 biased"],["sexism","ˈsɛkˌsɪzəm","n. 性别歧视","sexism at work","职场性别歧视","形容词 sexist"],["harassment","həˈræsm(ə)nt","n. 骚扰","sexual harassment","性骚扰","动词 harass"],["gap","ɡæp","n. 差距；缺口","the pay gap","薪酬差距","generation gap 代沟"],["ceiling","ˈsilɪŋ","n. 天花板；上限","a glass ceiling","玻璃天花板（无形的晋升障碍）",""],["breadwinner","ˈbrɛdˌwɪnər","n. 养家糊口的人","the main breadwinner","家里的主要经济支柱","bread + winner"],["housewife","ˈhaʊsˌwaɪf","n. 家庭主妇","a full-time housewife","全职主妇",""],["parental","pəˈrɛn(t)l","adj. 父母的","parental leave","育儿假","parent 的形容词"],["inclusive","ɪnˈklusɪv","adj. 包容的；包括的","an inclusive society","包容的社会","反义 exclusive"],["visibility","ˌvɪzəˈbɪlədi","n. 可见度；能见度","raise visibility","提高可见度","形容词 visible"],["liberate","ˈlɪbəˌreɪt","v. 解放","liberate a country","解放一个国家","名词 liberation"],["suffrage","ˈsəfrɪdʒ","n. 选举权","women's suffrage","妇女选举权",""],["emancipate","əˈmæn(t)səˌpeɪt","v. 解放，使摆脱束缚","emancipate slaves","解放奴隶","名词 emancipation"]]},{"t":"晚年","e":"Old Age","s":[["At eighty, my grandmother is a proud [senior].","八十岁的祖母是一位自豪的长者。"],["In an [aging] society, a longer [lifespan] brings new problems.","在老龄化社会里，更长的寿命带来了新问题。"],["She is [frail] now and too [feeble] to climb stairs.","她现在身体虚弱，无力爬楼梯。"],["Her sister has [dementia].","她的妹妹患有痴呆症。"],["To keep her [mobility], Grandma walks daily and refuses a [wheelchair].","为了保持行动能力，祖母每天散步，拒绝坐轮椅。"],["A [caregiver] visits twice a week.","一名护理员每周来两次。"],["A friend of hers spent his last months in a [hospice].","她的一位朋友在临终关怀院度过了最后几个月。"],["What she fears most is [loneliness].","她最怕的是孤独。"],["[Isolation] harms health; [companionship] protects it.","与世隔绝有损健康，有人陪伴则能保护健康。"],["She speaks calmly about death.","她平静地谈论死亡。"],["She wants a simple [funeral], a plain [coffin], and a [grave] in the village [cemetery], where we [bury] our family.","她想要一场简单的葬礼、一口朴素的棺材，以及村里墓地中的一座坟墓——我们家的人都葬在那里。"],["She has named me her [heir], and she jokes about writing her own [obituary].","她已指定我为继承人，还开玩笑说要自己写讣告。"]],"g":[["proud","自豪的"],["society","社会"],["climb stairs","爬楼梯"],["daily","每天"],["refuses","拒绝"],["visits","来访"],["fears","害怕"],["harms","损害"],["protects","保护"],["calmly","平静地"],["death","死亡"],["plain","朴素的"],["named","指定"],["jokes","开玩笑"]],"w":[["senior","ˈsinjər","n. 长者；上级 adj. 年长的；高级的","senior citizens","老年人","反义 junior"],["aging","ˈeɪdʒɪŋ","adj. 老龄化的，变老的 n. 老化","an aging population","老龄化人口","英式 ageing"],["lifespan","ˈlaɪfˌspæn","n. 寿命","the average lifespan","平均寿命","life + span"],["frail","freɪl","adj. 虚弱的，脆弱的","a frail old man","体弱的老人","名词 frailty"],["feeble","ˈfib(ə)l","adj. 无力的，微弱的","a feeble voice","微弱的声音",""],["dementia","dəˈmɛn(t)ʃ(i)ə","n. 痴呆症","suffer from dementia","患痴呆症","de- 去 + ment 心智"],["mobility","moʊˈbɪlədi","n. 行动能力；流动性","social mobility","社会流动性","形容词 mobile"],["wheelchair","ˈ(h)wilˌtʃɛr","n. 轮椅","in a wheelchair","坐轮椅","wheel + chair"],["caregiver","ˈkɛrˌɡɪvər","n. 护理员，照顾者","a family caregiver","家庭照护者","care + giver"],["hospice","ˈhɑspəs","n. 临终关怀院","hospice care","临终关怀","和 hospital 同源"],["loneliness","ˈloʊnlinəs","n. 孤独","a feeling of loneliness","孤独感","形容词 lonely"],["isolation","ˌaɪsəˈleɪʃən","n. 隔绝，孤立","in isolation","孤立地","动词 isolate"],["companionship","kəmˈpænjənˌʃɪp","n. 陪伴，友谊","enjoy sb's companionship","享受某人的陪伴","companion 同伴"],["funeral","ˈfjun(ə)rəl","n. 葬礼","attend a funeral","参加葬礼",""],["coffin","ˈkɔfən","n. 棺材","a wooden coffin","木棺",""],["grave","ɡreɪv","n. 坟墓 adj. 严重的","visit a grave","扫墓",""],["cemetery","ˈsɛməˌtɛri","n. 墓地","a public cemetery","公墓",""],["bury","ˈbɛri","v. 埋葬；掩埋","be buried in","葬于","读音同 berry；名词 burial"],["heir","ɛr","n. 继承人","the heir to the throne","王位继承人","h 不发音"],["obituary","əˈbɪtʃəˌwɛri","n. 讣告","write an obituary","写讣告",""]]},{"t":"备考","e":"Exam","s":[["The English [examination] is in June, and [registration] closes next week.","英语考试在六月，报名下周截止。"],["I have six months.","我还有六个月。"],["Every day I learn [vocabulary] and review [grammar].","我每天学词汇、复习语法。"],["Reading [comprehension] is my best part; [translation] is my worst.","阅读理解是我最强的部分，翻译最差。"],["I practice [dictation] with the radio and write one [composition] a week.","我跟着广播练听写，每周写一篇作文。"],["My teacher marks each [essay].","老师批改每一篇文章。"],["In the reading test, first [skim] the passage, then [scan] for details.","做阅读题时，先略读文章，再扫读找细节。"],["If you do not know, [guess].","不知道就猜。"],["Never [cheat].","绝不作弊。"],["To [pass], I need 425 points; if I [fail], I can [retake] the test in December.","要通过，我需要 425 分；如果没过，我可以在十二月重考。"],["I want real [proficiency], not just a score.","我想要的是真正的熟练程度，而不仅仅是一个分数。"],["The 425 [threshold] is only a start.","425 分这道门槛只是开始。"],["A higher [band] would [qualify] me for a better job.","更高的分数档能让我有资格得到一份更好的工作。"]],"g":[["closes","截止"],["review","复习"],["part","部分"],["worst","最差的"],["practice","练习"],["radio","广播"],["marks","批改"],["passage","文章"],["details","细节"],["points","分数"],["score","分数"],["start","开始"]],"w":[["examination","ɪɡˌzæməˈneɪʃən","n. 考试；检查","an entrance examination","入学考试","口语 exam"],["registration","ˌrɛdʒəˈstrəɪʃən","n. 报名，登记","registration fee","报名费","动词 register"],["vocabulary","voʊˈkæbjəˌlɛri","n. 词汇（量）","a large vocabulary","词汇量大",""],["grammar","ˈɡræmər","n. 语法","English grammar","英语语法","注意结尾是 -ar"],["comprehension","ˌkɑmprəˈhɛn(t)ʃən","n. 理解（力）","reading comprehension","阅读理解","动词 comprehend"],["translation","trænzˈleɪʃən","n. 翻译；译文","a Chinese translation","中文译本","动词 translate"],["dictation","dɪkˈteɪʃən","n. 听写","do a dictation","做听写","dict = 说"],["composition","ˌkɑmpəˈzɪʃən","n. 作文；构成；作品","write a composition","写作文","动词 compose"],["essay","ˈɛseɪ","n. 文章，论文","a 500-word essay","500 词的文章",""],["skim","skɪm","v. 略读；撇去","skim the article","略读文章","抓大意"],["scan","skæn","v. 扫读；扫描 n. 扫描","scan for details","扫读找细节","找具体信息"],["guess","ɡɛs","v./n. 猜","make a guess","猜一猜",""],["cheat","tʃit","v. 作弊；欺骗 n. 骗子","cheat in an exam","考试作弊",""],["pass","pæs","v. 通过；传递 n. 及格；通行证","pass an exam","通过考试",""],["fail","feɪl","v. 不及格；失败","fail an exam","考试不及格","名词 failure"],["retake","rəˈteɪk","v. 重考，补考","retake an exam","补考","re- + take"],["proficiency","prəˈfɪʃ(ə)n(t)si","n. 熟练，精通","English proficiency","英语水平","形容词 proficient"],["threshold","ˈθrɛʃˌ(h)oʊld","n. 门槛；起点","the pass threshold","及格线",""],["band","bænd","n. 分数段；乐队；带子","a higher band","更高的分数段",""],["qualify","ˈkwɑləˌfaɪ","v. 使有资格；取得资格","qualify for a job","有资格获得一份工作","名词 qualification"]]}]];
